#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:210
msgid ""
"This cave is legendary in Trollish lore, and is a holy place. Other creatures, however, might just see it as a lair to occupy and defend."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:212
msgid ""
"As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this temple smells of damp fur and cheese. A chorus of squeaks, like chanting issues from within."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:214
msgid ""
"As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this small temple smells faintly of fur and cheese."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:216
msgid ""
"A church holy to the followers of Eep. It smells faintly of damp fur and cheese."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:218
msgid ""
"A cave entrance. A slight breeze from within brings you the faint smell of brimstone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:220
msgid "A cave entrance. The lair of some monstrous beast?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:222
msgid ""
"The entrance to this cave has been crudely widened by a creature with claws capable of ripping the hard dark stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:26 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:42
msgid ""
"Regent Wilbur Humphrey, Foremost Paladin, and Prince Nicolai Ironfist, heir to the throne of Enroth, both reside in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:262
msgid "Enter Hive"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:263
msgid "Enter Castle Ironfist"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:264
msgid "Enter Tomb of VARN"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:265 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:266 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:267
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:268 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:269 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:270
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:271
msgid "Enter Dungeon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:27 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:43
msgid ""
"Lord Albert Newton, High Sorcerer of Enroth, resides in Castle Newton."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:28 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:44
msgid "Lord Osric Temper, Foremost Knight, resides in Castle Temper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:29 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:45
msgid ""
"Lord Anthony Stone, High Priest of Free Haven, resides in Castle Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:3
msgid ""
"A burial mound. Though obviously centuries old, the door's inlaid and gilded decorations are clean and untarnished. They must be preserved by magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:30 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:46
msgid ""
"Lady Loretta Fleise, Chancellor of the Treasury, resides in Castle Fleise."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:31 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:47
msgid ""
"Lord Eric von Stromgard, Marquis of the Northern Marches, resides in Castle Stromgard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:36
msgid ""
"The Oracle has provided the rulers of Enroth with wisdom for as long as anyone can remember."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:4
msgid ""
"When he passed away, Lord Brinne was mourned throughout the land. His tomb is a holy place visited by pilgrims and other well-wishers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:48
msgid ""
"The maelstrom energies of air magic hold together an egg of cloud mist. You can hear a faint but clearly angry howling coming from the strange structure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:49
msgid ""
"Though the air temperature is quite warm, this pod of ice does not melt. The elemental power of water magic swirls about it, keeping it winter cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:5
msgid "You find a passage leading downwards. Do you enter?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:50
msgid ""
"Forces of fire magic heat this cylinder of iron to red hot heat. The hiss of steam makes you wonder if the thing is full of boiling water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:51
msgid ""
"After you rescued them, the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair built a new entrance to their city."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:155 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:52
msgid ""
"The back door to the mysterious abandoned temple built by the race which lived on Dagger Wound before the Lizardmen--it should be safe now, right?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:53
msgid ""
"History holds that Lizardmen temples of this period were guarded by traps and not monsters. What then to make of the reptilian slithering receding into the darkness?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:54
msgid ""
"You see no solid ground in the airy realm through this gateway. In the hazy distance you can see oddly shaped buildings that seem to float in the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:55
msgid ""
"Looking through the gateway is like peering through a window into an underwater canyon. Creatures of all sizes swim menacingly in the distance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:56
msgid ""
"The smell of freshly lumbered wood gives indication of this fort's recent construction. The large stacks of supplies show that the Regnan pirates are planning a lengthy stay."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:57
msgid ""
"Though the view is obscured by shimmering waves of heated air, through the gateway you perceive a hellish landscape of endless bridgeways spanning an ocean of lava."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:58
msgid ""
"Even in the freeport of Ravenshore, some goods must avoid official eyes. Such usually pass through this secluded cove in the care of the wererat smugglers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:59
msgid ""
"The gateway leads to an earthen tunnel which extends a few paces then tees off left and right. You can't say where the passages lead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:6
msgid ""
"The volcano has apparently pulled this ancient building from the bottom of the sea. Who were it's mysterious builders?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:60
msgid ""
"By the number of wolf tracks marking the approach to this wolves' den, either the wolves are extremely active or hundreds of them live in these caves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:61
msgid ""
"The Dark Elven Merchants of Alvar run a mighty trade empire spanning the reach of Jadame. This is their local guildhouse in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:62
msgid ""
"From the conflux key come a keening pitch which resonates through the crystal. A hidden depth is revealed--a passage that draws you with inexplicable attraction."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:63
msgid ""
"The hive emits a hum which sets your teeth rattling in your jaw. The breeze you feel is not the wind, but the blowback of a thousand monstrous wings."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:64
msgid ""
"Ogre armies need carry no winches to their fort building sites. Their strength of arm and back is sufficient to raise the massive beams and posts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:65
msgid ""
"The Trolls of Rust have entombed their dead here for centuries--each generation digging deeper catacombs beneath those dug before."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:66
msgid ""
"What use do the Cyclopes make of this sinister vault? Whatever they do, makes it smell like a butcher's shop."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:67
msgid ""
"A tunnel of solidified lava snakes downward. Can it possible provide safe passage beneath the lake of fire?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:68
msgid ""
"Made ruin in some long forgotten war, parts of this castle are still whole. The dragon hunters have made good use of these."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:69
msgid ""
"By nature, dragons are solitary beings. Occasionally, a few will nest together, but here in Garrote Gorge they have built a mighty society."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:7
msgid ""
"The Alvarian Dark Dwarves are recent arrivals to the area. In a short time, however, they've built an extensive system of mines."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:70
msgid ""
"The stonework façade of this ancient temple has crumbled into the sand of time. Still, its majesty--and mystery--remain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:71
msgid ""
"Though this temple is newly built it already possesses a timeless quality."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:72
msgid ""
"The dark rock of these stone monuments cannot be found nearby. The nearest source is the Shadowspire Mountains a hundred leagues away."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:73
msgid ""
"This air vent seems to be the only entrance into the flooded Minotaur city, Balthazar Lair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:74
msgid ""
"Zog the Jackal's preference for building on high ground has provided an unexpected boon in the form of protection from the raging flood waters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:75
msgid ""
"The Regnans have never been known for their subtlety. This thick walled and cannon studded castle is the very definition of 'forbidding.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:76
msgid ""
"From a distance, this moss covered and crumbling stronghold seems long abandoned. Fresh boot prints in the mud and the signal mirror tell a different story."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:77
msgid ""
"This strange craft seems capable of traveling both on and under the water's surface. A series of cranks operated the wheel of blades which propel it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:78
msgid ""
"Brooding over the village below, the Necromancers' Guild exudes an atmosphere of domineering evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:79
msgid ""
"Though renown for her beauty, Zanthora's madness drives her to live apart from the company of others. In this forbidding castle she conducts her dark experiments."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:8
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The dead bodies near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:80 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:81
msgid ""
"All buildings in the Plane of Air float. So why does this cloud castle seem particularly incongruous? Perhaps because its great size?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:83
msgid ""
"Not a stick of wood or other combustibles are visible in the walls and towers of this mighty keep of stone and iron."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:84
msgid ""
"If there were any doubts of the Fire Elementals' hostile intentions towards Jadame, they are allayed by the presence of this rallying camp."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:85
msgid ""
"The Destroyer reigns from a macabre palace. What kind of being would choose to live inside the skull of a 400 foot tall giant?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:86
msgid ""
"The magic power of earth whirls around this cocoon-like encasement of earth and rock. A cry of torment like a dying wind issues from within."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:87 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:94
msgid "The front door to your new home stands before you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:88
msgid ""
"The grand entrance to Castle Gryphonheart stands before you.  A pair of tame griffins can frequently be seen circling above the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:89
msgid ""
"Castle Navan is the traditional seat of Elvish power.  Centuries of plant growth around the castle contribute to its sylvan character."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:9
msgid ""
"The enormous size and lavish decoration of Lord Markham's Manor provide a striking contrast to the humble peasant homes and huts nearby."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:90
msgid ""
"Who knows why the Necromancers felt the need to build a castle deep within the bowels of the earth?  Castle Gloaming is ugly, sinister, and very, very secure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:91
msgid ""
"Floating above most clouds gives Castle Lambent more sunlight per year than any other location.  The elegant architecture takes full advantage of the weather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:92
msgid ""
"The dripping of water and a strange, unidentifiable squeaking are the only noises that seem to come from the entrance to this cave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:93
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  Perhaps this is where those missing adventurers are..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:95
msgid ""
"These caves are the traditional hideout of goblins and bandits.  Whatever lives there now doesn't make the place smell too good…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:96
msgid ""
"Foul water pours from a large drain pipe coming from the Erathian Sewer.  It is said the Thieves' Guild can be found in here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:97
msgid ""
"This mighty fort does a superb job guarding the East Bridge from invaders.  It doesn't look like visitors are welcome inside the fort."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:98
msgid ""
"Fresh human or elvish footprints lead into this cave, and weeds and brush have been cleared from the entrance recently."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:99
msgid ""
"Faint sounds of distant explosions and mad laughter can be heard from beyond the door.  There is a sharp, acidic smell in the air."
msgstr ""

