"In the Demon Wars of Erathia, the Humans found that only erudine armor was proof against the fiery attacks of their foes. Bit by bit, pieces of this armor - like this shield - have made their way to Jadame."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:105
msgid "Veteran Shield"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:106
msgid "Dragon Hunter's Shield"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:106
msgid ""
"The town of Kriegspire in Enroth had a problem with Dragons. These shields were their answer. Magically bound layers of erudine, stalt-steel and hydra leather, make a nearly unbreakable material resistant to most Dragon breath weapons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:107 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:108 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:109
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:110 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:111 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1689
