#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:79
msgid ""
"A wooden head and handle studded with short iron spikes, the simple club's best attribute is that it can be constructed from found materials."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:79
