#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:10
msgid ""
"There was a pack of those vile wererats behind my house again last night.  Someone should do something about the vile little creatures. Between those vermin and the dire wolves it amazing that our children are safe!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:104
msgid ""
"I've heard that the abandoned keep on the hill is now home to a pack of goblins.  The keep was built to keep the goblins away, so how could this possibly happen?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:105
msgid ""
"A day's travel west of here is a new Temple dedicated to Baa.  I've heard that bad things happen to rich people that travel near there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:106
msgid ""
"The passes through the hills to the west are filled with bandits, travelling on foot through there can be dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:107
msgid ""
"Ocean travel around here can be dangerous because of the sea serpents and water elementals that roam the oceans."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:108
msgid ""
"The High Council in Free Haven should really consult the Oracle to find out why the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:109
msgid ""
"Prince Nicolai isn't even in charge anymore– Regent Humphrey makes all of the decisions.  It's not fair to blame Nicolai for all the problems."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:11
msgid "Please don't hurt us!  Arion Hunter says we are friends now!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:110
msgid ""
"The two solstices are days of considerable magical importance.  The summer solstice is on June 21st, and the winter solstice is on December 21st."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:111
msgid ""
"The stables at Castle Ironfist can take you to the Arena, an ancient place where warriors can test their prowess."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:112
msgid "Goblins are weak creatures, but they tend to attack in large numbers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:113
msgid ""
"Though their physical attacks are weak, these mages can cast various elemental attack spells."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:114
msgid ""
"A powerful artifact, Mordred is a dagger that possesses the ability to steal the health of its victim and transfer that vitality to its wielder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:115
msgid "Albert Newton in Mist handles the promotion of Sorcerers to Wizards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:116
msgid ""
"The abandoned temple northwest of town used to be occupied by the Temple of Baa, but they moved out in a hurry one day last year.  Now there's nothing but snakes, bats, and huge spiders."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:117
msgid ""
"When the Temple of Baa moved out of that old temple outside of town, all of the little problems we've been having just…went away.  I tell you, there's something unwholesome about those people.  I'm glad they're gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:118
msgid ""
"A wizard friend of mine told me the Temple of Baa was laying curses on our town from the abandoned temple just outside town.  One day they tried to lay the Curse of Endless Vermin on us, only they did something wrong and it backfired, infesting their own temple instead.  They moved righty-o quick once that happened."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:119
msgid ""
"I heard the Temple of Baa abandoned that old temple so quickly they didn't have time to take all their stuff.  It should all still be down there, if you're brave enough to go look for it.  There's a lot of nasty monsters in the way, though, so be careful if you go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:12
msgid ""
"We will be forever in your debt!  You have saved Ravenshore and all of Jadame!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:120
msgid ""
"It's been quite a while since New Sorpigal was raided by goblins, but with goblins living in the very place meant to protect us from them, it can't be too long before we're attacked again, can it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:121
msgid ""
"An evil guild of mages has been searching the southeast end of our peninsula for signs of the fabled Fountain of Magic.  They attack anyone who comes near to scare off potential rivals.  Be very careful if you travel in that direction!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:122
msgid ""
"The three fountains we have here in town are said to draw their water from a spring touched by the gods.  Each one is magical and beneficial to drink from."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:123
msgid ""
"A raiding party of goblins has staked out the west bridge, hoping to rob and kill travelers.  They aren't very subtle– you can see them from a mile away– but they ARE dangerous.  Watch your step!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:124
msgid ""
"Our town was founded centuries ago as the last major town in Enroth.  We have historically been a point from which colony ships left for the rest of the world."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:125
msgid ""
"The fruit on the trees in the orchards of our fair town is quite tasty, and free for all to take.  You should try it sometime!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:126
msgid ""
"Beware of travelling to the islands just off our north shore.  The waters sometime have dangerous monsters, and the islands are none too hospitable, either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:127
msgid ""
"It's been decades since we were last attacked by pirates from the islands of Regna, and I guess it's about time for us to be attacked again, what with the king missing and all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:128 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:153
msgid ""
"Buccaneers' Lair in New Sorpigal and Mist can teach you dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:129
msgid ""
"You can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap at protection services in Silver Cove and White Cap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:13
msgid "Would you like to fire the cannons in defense of Dagger Wound Island?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:130 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:155
msgid ""
"Blackshire and Free Haven are homes to the Smugglers' Guild, where you can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:131 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:156
msgid ""
"Sword, axe, spear, staff, and leather are all taught in Blades' End in both White Cap and New Sorpigal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:132
msgid ""
"Duelists' Edge in Mist teaches mace, bow, chain, shield, and body building."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:133
msgid ""
"Berserker's Fury in Castle Ironfist can teach you bow, shield, chain, plate, and repair item."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:134
msgid ""
"The Fraternal Order of Silver has recently built a keep just south of Mist.  They used to be such nice people, but now they're so intent on killing evil they destroy anything that isn't perfect, and that's just about everything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:135
msgid "I love living down here!  Lord Newton never remembers to raise taxes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:136
msgid ""
"The islands of Bootleg Bay are home to a few cannibal tribes.  People that visit those islands don't return."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:137
msgid ""
"The Fountain of Magic is supposed to be south of Bootleg Bay, but not many people have ever found it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:138
msgid ""
"In the islands south of Mist is the forge of Gharik, one of Archibald's fellow mages.  The place is crawling with elementals– no one ever goes there now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:139
msgid ""
"On an island north of Mist is Castle Alamos, one of the centers of magical study in Enroth.  All sorts of summoning and alchemy occurs in that castle– it's a dangerous place for the casual visitor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:14
msgid ""
"Help us!  If we do not push the pirates off the island all will be lost!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:140
msgid ""
"A couple of old temples are said to still stand in the jungle islands of Bootleg Bay.  I wonder if anyone still worships in them?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:141
msgid ""
"Water elementals prowl the waters near Mist.  As if their powerful physical attacks aren't enough, they can also fire Ice Bolts from a distance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:142
msgid ""
"This axe is a hero's dream.  It's enchanted to slay dragons and devils, and does so quite well.  Unfortunately, owners of the axe tend to find such creatures more often then they'd like to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:143
msgid ""
"Not many people make it to wizard, and even fewer are promoted to arch mages.  Albert Newton must ask the impossible of those looking to be promoted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:144
msgid ""
"Mist was originally intended to be a customs and trading port for dealings with the Eastern islands and countries.  Piracy has severely cut into that trade, so we're not as prosperous as we should be."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:145
msgid ""
"About 200 miles to the east of us lie the Regnan Islands.  They are inhabited with pirates ruled by an 'emperor' who 'taxes' passing ships that pass near their territory.  The Regnans produce almost nothing on their own, with the exception of weapons and mercenaries."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:146
msgid ""
"I hear you can make a potion of supreme protection by mixing an orange potion with a green potion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:147
msgid ""
"Melody Silver was recently imprisoned by the Silver Helms in their new outpost south of Mist.  They've been acting awfully strange lately, and it's terrible that they seized such a nice young woman.  Someone's got to do something about those people!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:148
msgid ""
"The Silver Helms, founded by John Silver, were originally organized to fight brigands and murderers, but they've been harassing citizens for even the most petty crimes recently."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:149
msgid ""
"Most of the international trade on our island is with the Kingdom of Erathia, homeland of our good Queen Catherine.  Erathia is the source of most of our precious metals and stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:15
msgid ""
"With the Pirate Outpost defeated our homes are once again safe!  Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:150
msgid ""
"Years of practicing high sorcery can erode the memory of the sorcerer severely, and there is no cure for it.  Even if there was, it's unlikely the victim would remember to use it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:151
msgid ""
"Albert Newton was promoted to his current position because of his strong support for Roland during the Succession War, even though Archibald offered him much sorcerous knowledge.  Lord Newton must surely be a good man to have refused to support the wicked Archibald, even though it looked like Archibald was going to win."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:152
msgid ""
"Although Lord Newton seems weak and forgetful these days, it's good to remember that he was once one of the greatest sorcerers in the land, perhaps the greatest sorcerer ever!  They say that Lord Newton has forgotten more sorcerous knowledge than Archibald ever knew, excepting the school of dark magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:154
msgid ""
"You can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap at Protection Services in Silver Cove and White Cap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:157
msgid ""
"Duelists' Edge in Free Haven teaches mace, bow, chain, shield, and repair item."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:158
msgid ""
"Berserker's Fury in Silver Cove can teach you sword, bow, shield, plate, and body building."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:159
msgid ""
"If you're skilled enough, Calvin Black can teach you ways to improve your staff skill.  He lives in a house right near the Imp Slapper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:16
msgid ""
"Ogres have become more of a problem in our daily lives.  If someone were to deal with the Ogres in their fortress, maybe things would get better!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:160
msgid ""
"When Gonzalo isn't spending time in the Imp Slapper, he teaches spear expertise."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:161
msgid ""
"If you're looking to gain expertise in leather armor, Arthur teaches right near the Buccaneers' Lair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:162
msgid "Bernard teaches expert repair skill just south of the Duelists' Edge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:163
msgid ""
"The weird creatures that have been summoned around here make people forget that Alamos was the home of some of the best alchemists in the world.  Powerful items must be kept in that castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:164
msgid ""
"One of the islands to the west has a strange circle of stones.  I think that's used for the Ceremony of the Sun, one of the requirements in Druid promotions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:165
msgid ""
"The waters around Castle Alamos teem with sea serpents that attack ships with their icy breath."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:166
msgid ""
"Percival is the ultimate ranged attack weapon.  With its rapid fire and dangerous explosive attack, it can wipe out large numbers of enemies at a safe distance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:167
msgid ""
"These annoying creatures are immune to magic, but not immune to a good sword blow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:168
msgid ""
"The old Dwarf King is in exile now, but I'll bet he wants his throne back pretty badly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:169
msgid ""
"Snergle hid the key to the innermost chambers of his caverns in the iron mines to the west."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:17
msgid ""
"Warrior Wasps have built a large nest southeast of here.  They could become a threat to the city if the nest grows too large."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:170
msgid ""
"Wilbur Humphrey is so scared that something will happen to Nicolai, the Prince has not been allowed to leave the castle in months."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:171
msgid ""
"After Corlagon's defeat in the Succession Wars, he retired to his Estate in the Mire of the Damned to study sorcery.  Rumor has it that he became a lich hoping to survive until Archibald could return."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:172
msgid ""
"The Shadow Guild, an upstart Thieves' Guild, supposedly has a hideout near Castle Ironfist.  I'm sure Anthony Stone would love to see that hideout destroyed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:173
msgid ""
"I'm surprised that Nicolai hasn't asked the Oracle for advice; I doubt Regent Humphrey has all the answers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:174
msgid ""
"There's still no news on when Catherine will be back from her trip to Erathia."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:175
msgid ""
"King Roland's Yacht, the Queen Catherine, hasn't left port in years.  Is it even still seaworthy?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:176
msgid ""
"Lizardmen prowl around the swampy areas south of Castle Ironfist.  They use bows, but the most powerful are wizards that will cast Lightning Bolts when threatened."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:177
msgid ""
"The Arena of Enroth can be reached through the stables in Ironfist.  You can fight almost any kind of monster there, if you have the taste for that sort of thing.  Lots of people would go every day, but the Arena is only open on Sundays."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:178
msgid ""
"A useful shield that unerringly blocks missile attacks and makes its user more likely to land blows in battle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:179
msgid ""
"Wilbur Humphrey, in Roland's absence, handles the promotions of all paladins to crusaders."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:18
msgid ""
"News from the different regions of Jadame has been very slow in getting to Alvar.  I wonder if the merchants know what is going on in the world?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:180
msgid ""
"Lord Corlagon was Archibald's greatest lieutenant during the Succession War, and after his side lost, he retired to his mansion in the swamps somewhere.  It is said that he performed the Ritual of the Endless Night and became a lich a couple of years ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:181
msgid ""
"Wilbur Humphrey is Foremost Paladin of the land.  Though many say he is too naïve and unfit to rule while King Roland is gone, people say he is utterly fearless and honest.  I personally think we couldn't possibly find a better man for the job!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:182
msgid ""
"The fabulous Circus of the Sun usually sets up a few day's travel down the trade road leading north from Castle Ironfist.  They are always there in December of each year."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:183
msgid ""
"There are highwaymen plying the trade road brazenly near the castle.  The Regent must be mightily distracted to permit these ruffians to rob innocent travelers right beneath his nose!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:184
msgid ""
"The Seer lives in a hut on a mountain near the source of the Silver River that runs from the Steel Mountains, past Castle Ironfist, and into the ocean.  It is said that he helps those who are lost."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:185
msgid ""
"Rocklin, former King of the Dwarves, has been deposed by a dwarf named Snergle.  Snergle renamed the mines and caverns formerly operated by Rocklin to, predictably, Snergle's Mine and Snergle's Caverns.  You can find both of those places west of the mountains near Castle Ironfist called the Steel Mountains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:186
msgid ""
"The swamps of Enroth are home to all manner of unwholesome monsters, many of them undead.  Carry fire and tread lightly if you should ever have to venture there!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:187
msgid ""
"The road between Castle Ironfist and New Sorpigal has become quite unsafe.  Ordinarily, we only have one group of bandits preying upon travelers…but these days we have not one, not two, but THREE groups of bandits!  First, there is that hideous Temple of Baa, then we have the Dragoon hideout near the south shore somewhere, and finally we have an unauthorized Thieves' Guild open for business near the Castle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:188
msgid "Newt teaches expert leather skill south of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:189
msgid ""
"You can learn expert chain skill from Rich just south of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:19
msgid ""
"The sea of fire has destroyed our village!  Who knows how long we can still live here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:190
msgid ""
"A little south of Castle Ironfist are four small houses.  Benito teaches expert plate skill in the northmost one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:191
msgid "Edgar will teach sufficiently skilled shield users expert techniques."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:192
msgid ""
"Aaron teaches expert sword wielding right next to the weapon shop in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:193
msgid "Expert axe is taught by Stephan in the training grounds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:194
msgid ""
"Helen lives with her friend Tracy right between the King's Crown and the Eagle's Eye."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:195
msgid ""
"Tyler teaches expert disarm right across the street from the training grounds in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:196
msgid ""
"Leon teaches expert identify right across the street from the training grounds in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:197
msgid ""
"Olaf lives in a small house behind Castle Ironfist, and teaches expert body building from there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:198
msgid ""
"Elton teaches expert learning in one of the towers of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:199
msgid ""
"Walter teaches expert diplomacy in one of the towers of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:2
msgid "If you see this text tell James."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:20
msgid ""
"With the destruction of the village, all we need now is a Cyclops raiding party to attack us!  Then our fate would be sealed and we would certainly perish!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:200
msgid ""
"Behind the King's Crown you can find Terrance Smith.  He'll teach skilled dagger users a few new tricks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:201
msgid ""
"I hear there's a reward out for the ones who can put down the Dragoon highwaymen plying the road near the south shore.  Some merchant's offering a LOT of money for the return of his stolen merchandise!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:202
msgid ""
"A small order of monks has grown just south of Bootleg Bay, called the Order of the Fist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:203
msgid ""
"The islands of Bootleg Bay hide a pile of pirate treasure.  That is, if you can get past the cannibals and actually find it…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:204
msgid ""
"The location of the Fountain of Magic is still a mystery.  For some reason, the people that find it never reveal its location."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:205
msgid ""
"The Church of the Sun used to have a temple on an island in Bootleg Bay."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:206
msgid ""
"A powerful crown, Arthur not only boosts all its wearer's physical characteristics, but also their spell points."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:207
msgid ""
"I've heard that you need to slay an elder dragon to be promoted from Crusader to Hero.  No wonder there are so few Heroes around!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:208
msgid ""
"The temple of Tsantsa can be found on one of the large islands south of Silver Cove.  The people that live on that island like to sacrifice captives to their beastly god Tsantsa, and then shrink their heads in the pools of disgusting chemicals they keep in their temple.  The islanders are quite hostile, so be sure to kiss your loved ones goodbye if you have plans to visit the island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:209
msgid ""
"Long abandoned by the Church of the Sun, their temple still stands on a large island east of Free Haven.  A small order of confused monks, misapprehending the true nature of the temple, have somehow made peace with the islanders and moved into the temple– bringing a stolen holy artifact with them.  Now the old temple's insidious magic has affected their minds, making them believe they must defend the temple to the death.  The monks are very unfriendly these days, and attack all who trespass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:21
msgid ""
"A strange cave has opened north of the village.  It appeared shortly after the sea of fire devastated the village.  Strange creatures have been seen entering and leaving this cave.  I wonder what is inside it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:210
msgid "Preston teaches expert chain skill just east of the Goblin's Tooth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:211
msgid ""
"Shoshi can teach you new perception tricks from his house just east of the Goblin's Tooth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:212
msgid ""
"Winston used to be a member of that new clerical order down here, but he quit.  Apparently he left something behind because he's looking for someone to go back to the Temple of the Fist for him.  He's lives in one of the antechambers of the House of Healing now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:213
msgid ""
"Cedric Druthers' splinter group of druids perform ceremonies in a cave west of Silver Cove."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:214
msgid ""
"The stronghold of the Fraternal Order of Silver is located near Silver Cove.  The Silver Helms seem more violent lately, I wonder why that is?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:215
msgid ""
"The Warlord's Fortress is to the northwest of Silver Cove.  Only the strongest warriors are enlisted into his army."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:216
msgid ""
"The Shadow Guild supposedly has a large guild right near Castle Stone.  I'm surprised Anthony Stone hasn’t discovered its location yet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:217
msgid ""
"Not many ships travel to Castle Alamos.  Most captains are afraid of the strange creatures that prowl around the northern seas."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:218
msgid ""
"Guilds of Light can be found in Silver Cove and Blackshire and Guilds of Dark can be found in Winter Cap and Blackshire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:219
msgid ""
"Diamond Gargoyles are the toughest gargoyles around.  They're impossible to kill with physical attacks, so you should use magic to kill them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:22
msgid ""
"Under Sir Charles Quixote's guidance we will rid this region of the threat of Dragons once and for all!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:220
msgid ""
"Druids can cast a variety of elemental spells when angered, and are often slightly shielded from magical attacks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:221
msgid ""
"These legendary boots enable their wearer to move faster and react quicker."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:222
msgid ""
"To be promoted to Arch Druid, a Greater Druid needs to perform the Ceremony of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon near Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:223
msgid ""
"The fortress of the Warlord watches over the source of the Calimar river as it winds its way past Silver Cove and empties into Bootleg Bay.  Originally established to protect a town planned for that region, the fortress became a magnet for mercenaries and criminals after the town failed and all the settlers moved south to greener pastures."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:224
msgid ""
"The Monolith overlooks the Silver road that leads from Silver Cove to Free Haven.  It's been an object of fascination and occasional worship for ages.  A long time ago, some group of druids carved a home out of the giant rock, and it has been inhabited by various groups since then.  The druids who currently live there were experimenting with some kind of new magic, and I think something may have gone wrong.  They've been avoiding contact with the outside world for some time now, and refuse to allow visitors to enter the Monolith."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:225
msgid ""
"The town of Silver Cove got its start as a fishing and trading village a few hundred years ago.  With time, our little village grew up to be a full-fledged town.  We have ample room to expand the town, and the land around us is fertile and easy to farm.  We are just a little distant from the rest of the Kingdom, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:226
msgid ""
"The Lady of Silver Cove often seems more interested in amassing her fortune than governing well, but I don't think it's so simple.  She often spends a lot of wealth on town improvements and security, so I guess she can't be all bad."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:227
msgid ""
"The Silver Helm vigilantes have occupied a fortress just north of Silver Cove.  Accusing Lady Fleise of the sin of greed, the Silver Helms have begun to attack her caravans travelling between Silver Cove and Free Haven.  I'm sure she's none too happy about it..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:228
msgid ""
"Be careful of travelling the waters north and east of Silver Cove– they're inhabited by giant, man-eating sea serpents!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:229
msgid ""
"The Spring Equinox is on March 20th, and the Autumn Equinox is on September 23rd.  It's said that these dates are important magical events."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:23
msgid ""
"Nagas have become more and more of a problem while we are hunting.  It's not bad enough that we have to stay watchful for Dragons attacking us from the sky, now we have to worry about Nagas ranging out from their vault."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:230
msgid ""
"The White Rock Islands north of Silver Cove have long been abandoned by civilized humans, and are now home to the monsters and madmen.  Druids occasionally risk their lives and journey to those islands looking for the fabled Circle of Stones so they can perform the Ceremony of the Sun."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:231
msgid ""
"The Silver Helms have been attacking everyone they see as less than 100% behind their fight against evil.  I don't know about you, but I think such an extreme position can't be a good thing– what's Sir John Silver thinking?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:232
msgid ""
"The druids of the Monolith have made a pact with the Netherworld– I know, because I met a druid who escaped from there one night.  He says unspeakable things are happening inside the Monolith, and if something isn't done soon, the outside world may soon learn more than it ever wanted to know about the secrets of the ancient place."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:233
msgid ""
"Tina lives with her daughter just east of Town Hall.  She teaches light expertise to skilled apprentices."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:234
msgid ""
"You can learn expert repair just west of the Mercenary Guild from Cyrus Montebleu."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:235
msgid ""
"Clyde teaches expert meditation skill right across the street from the Self Guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:236
msgid ""
"Sigriv can teach you expert techniques with the spear just south of the training grounds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:237
msgid ""
"I heard that Eleanor wants the evil druids kicked out of the Monolith to the west, and she's willing to offer a reward to the people that do it.  She's on the east side of town if you want to know more."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:238
msgid ""
"The home of the Necromancers; no one travels to Castle Darkmoor anymore unless they're looking for undead.  I can't imagine the village of Darkmoor surviving much longer without any trade from the rest of Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:239
msgid ""
"The mountains to the west keep all the horrible creatures of Dragonsand from rampaging across the rest of Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:24
msgid ""
"Sir Charles Quixote sent us out to train under the guidance of Jeric Whistlebone.  Some day I hope to be as great a knight as he!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:240
msgid ""
"Snergle isn't a good leader, but none of the dwarves dare to stand up to him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:241
msgid ""
"Terrax never left Darkmoor after he became a lich.  He could very well still be inside researching new magical spells."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:242
msgid ""
"The ghosts that haunt the Mire of the Damned can age you past your years with a single touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:243
msgid ""
"Harpies will curse their unlucky victims.  Fortunately, they're pretty easy to kill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:244
msgid ""
"Even though skeletons are the weakest undead monster, some of them can curse you or fill your hearts with unnatural fear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:245
msgid ""
"A ring useful for either a cleric or paladin, Igraine boosts the effect of their spells."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:246
msgid ""
"Osric requires a test of skill for promotion to champion.  Few ever succeed in that test."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:247
msgid "Connie teaches expert axe skill just outside Darkmoor village."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:248
msgid ""
"Casey teaches expert merchant skill upstairs in the south of Darkmoor village."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:249
msgid ""
"Jack teaches expert mace skill across the street from Smoke and Mirrors."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:25
msgid ""
"There have been strange flashes of light from the north for many nights now.  Zanthora the Mad Necromancer is most certainly brewing up trouble for someone.  I certainly hope it is not for us of the Guild of Necromancers!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:250
msgid ""
"Avinril was an important dwarf until the new king Snergle kicked him out.  He's looking for revenge now, and needs help.  I know you can find him in the Haunt out by one of the dwarf mines."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:251
msgid ""
"The Church of the Moon had a temple to the west.  Now, Cedric Druthers' druids use the temple for their ceremonies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:252
msgid ""
"The sewers under Free Haven are crawling with thieves and pests.  I can't imagine anyone WANTING to live in a sewer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:253
msgid "I've heard that a strange ship sails in the middle of Temper's lake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:254
msgid ""
"Cedric Druthers' druids now occupy an old temple of the Church of the Moon to the west of Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:255
msgid ""
"The High Council has not once visited the Oracle since these disasters have started happening.  The wisdom of the Oracle could certainly be used now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:256
msgid ""
"The pass to White Cap and Castle Stromgard is now patrolled by renegade ogres and greedy humans."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:257
msgid ""
"No surprise, archers will fire arrows at you.  However, some archers prefer to use flaming arrows, and the best of them can actually cast Fireball."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:258
msgid ""
"A sorcerer or archer's best friend, this amulet boosts the effect of elemental magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:259
msgid "Osric Temper handles all the promotions of knights in Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:26
msgid ""
"There was another vampire attack last night.  I wish we didn’t have to put up with them!  But the Guild of Necromancers has their alliance with the Nosferatu, and we cannot retaliate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:260
msgid ""
"The High Council meets in Free Haven to represent the Lords of Enroth and handle the important business of the Realm.  With trouble brewing in the west, you would think they'd meet more frequently, but they still limit their hours as though nothing were happening!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:261
msgid ""
"Of all the Lords of Enroth, Osric Temper is the most concerned with handling the devils that have been attacking the western towns and villages.  I personally believe he is the only Lord with his head screwed on straight these days!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:262
msgid ""
"I hear there's a Thieves' Guild in the city with a trap door leading into the Free Haven city sewer.  They must use it to distribute all their stolen loot around town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:263
msgid ""
"The Circus of the Sun usually sets up a few days south of Castle Temper on the west side of the Crescent River.  They stay there during August of every year."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:264
msgid ""
"Though small, the village of Rockham serves as a trading post and rest stop for people travelling around the Kingdom.  'Though all roads may lead to Free Haven, nearly every traveler has to pass through Rockham to get there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:265
msgid ""
"When Ethric the Necromancer…died, he left instructions for his body to be placed in a tomb he had built next to the mountains south of the Pearblossom river.  It's said that he rose from the dead a few days later in a sort of infernal miracle.  Since then, the tomb has become a spiritual sink where all manner of lost souls drift to after death.  There they languish, mindlessly attacking the living in defense of their new master Ethric the Mad."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:266
msgid ""
"An unsavory company of mercenaries has moved into a fortification built by Roland during the Succession War, near Crescent Lake.  Far as I know, the mercenaries haven't done anything wrong yet, but their presence is ominous, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:267
msgid ""
"Free Haven is the oldest and most prosperous city in the Kingdom.  With a natural harbor and the Oracle, it was only common sense for people to gather here since the Silence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:268
msgid ""
"Glimmervale Lake has been the source of many supernatural sightings lately.  People say the sightings are caused by the tampering of the Necromancer's Guild, disbanded now for ten years.  Who knows what damage they caused before King Roland put a stop to their evil?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:269
msgid ""
"Temple Stone in Free Haven was recently burnt to the ground by a group of monks trying to steal the sacred chalice from the temple.  They fled east by boat, and nobody's seen them since."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:27
msgid ""
"There has not been a battle with the Temple of the Sun in years.  I hope they are not planning another assault upon the Guild.  It took years for us to recover from the last battle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:270
msgid ""
"I don't know if you've noticed, but those creepy followers of Baa keep popping in and out of buildings around town in the strangest manner.  Could be that they've located one of their temples in the city sewer system."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:271
msgid ""
"Maybe there really is something to the notion that evil is down, while good is up.  Both the followers of Baa and members of the Shadow Guild can be found in the city sewers.  Would that we have a big flood one day to wash all that trash out to sea!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:272
msgid ""
"Beware bandits on the road to Blackshire!  Ever since the King went off to who knows where, criminals have been plying the roads between all the major cities."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:273
msgid ""
"Liches are the only form of the living dead that actually chooses to be living dead.  A lich is the rotting skeleton of a powerful cleric or sorcerer, held together by necromantic rites performed during life.  A relatively new monster, it is said that Ethric the Mad was the first sorcerer to discover and perform the Ritual of the Endless Night, simultaneously becoming the world's first lich and necromancer. <Shuddering> Creepy, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:274
msgid ""
"The mercenaries living in that stronghold near Castle Temper seem to have a lot of money, because they keep ordering up weapons and supplies.  Someone must be paying them for some reason, but who?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:275
msgid ""
"I hear the former King of the Dwarves is hiding out in some local tavern, drowning his sorrows after being deposed by Snergle.  A sorry fate for Roland's most steadfast ally during the War!  I'll bet if King Roland were around he would help him out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:276
msgid ""
"Timothy teaches expert body magic southwest of the four elemental guilds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:277
msgid "Michael teaches expert sword skill just northeast of the body guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:278
msgid "Sylvester can show you new diplomacy tricks south of Town Square."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:279
msgid ""
"Livia will teach promising merchants a few expert techniques south of Town Square."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:28
msgid ""
"Glory to all who bathe in the cleansing light of the Sun! Do you walk in the path of its light?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:280
msgid "Takao teaches expert shield just west of the Sharpening Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:281
msgid ""
"Mynasia teaches expert mind magic southwest of the four elemental guilds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:282
msgid ""
"Michele teaches expert spirit magic southwest of the four elemental guilds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:283
msgid ""
"You can find expert disarm training from Ivan right near the Smugglers' Guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:284
msgid ""
"Logan lives just northeast of the body guild, and he teaches expert dagger skill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:285
msgid "Jack teaches expert fire magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:286
msgid ""
"Woodrow lives just southwest of the mind guild, and he teaches expert plate skill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:287
msgid "Hitomi teaches expert water magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:288
msgid "Li teaches expert earth magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:289
msgid "Zodahn teaches expert air magic just south of Temple Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:29
msgid ""
"There was a tremendous wind storm that devastated most of the forest to the north of here!  It has driven basilisks, will o' wisps and unicorns closer to the temple!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:290
msgid ""
"Zoltan was complaining recently that a new artifact for his collection was stolen by the Dragoons to the south of here.  He's put up a bounty for its return, go to his house just south of Town Square for more information."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:291
msgid ""
"Gabriel said he was working on a way to reverse some weird undead ritual.  I don't know much about rituals, but I do know that Gabriel lives just south of Temple Stone if you want to ask him about it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:292
msgid ""
"Carlo's good friend Sherell is lost in Bootleg Bay; he's looking for people to help him out near the docks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:293
msgid ""
"Rumor has it that the main Shadow Guild guildhall is located very close to Castle Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:294
msgid ""
"The pass to the Frozen Highlands is unsafe to travel now because of the ogres and humans that took over Icewind Keep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:295
msgid ""
"Magyars are straightforward fighters, but the magyar matrons can attack with a deadly electrical blast."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:296
msgid ""
"This seemingly simple mace bursts into flames when used, simultaneously dealing a vicious flame attack on its victim and also protecting its wielder from fire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:297
msgid ""
"Anthony Stone, among other things, promotes deserving Clerics to Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:298
msgid ""
"Erik Von Stromgard is the finest archer in the lands, and as such is given the task of training and promoting archers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:299
msgid ""
"Lord Stromgard is without a doubt the greatest archer in the land.  He always competes in the major competitions, and I've never seen him lose."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:3
msgid "If the pirates make it through our warriors we are certainly doomed!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:30
msgid ""
"Be gone!  We have no use for you here, unless we uses you to feed the wyverns!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:300
msgid ""
"Lord Stone has the dual role of being the High Priest of the Realm and the overseer of underworld activity.  A very strange combination, I suppose, but he certainly does seem to keep the peace.  Long may he live!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:301
msgid ""
"Icewind Keep was once Lord Stromgard's first castle, but he lost it to an attack of ogres and evil humans about a year ago.  He's moved to his second castle east of White Cap, but they say he's rather bitter about the loss and thinks only of revenge these days."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:302
msgid ""
"The Shadow Guild is a new Thieves' Guild created to challenge Lord Stone's authority over the underworld.  They have two hideouts– one near Castle Ironfist and the other within spitting distance of Castle Stone.  It looks to me like they're spoiling for a fight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:303
msgid ""
"White Cap is the third largest town in Enroth, and it's been suffering ever since Lord Stromgard lost Icewind Keep to the ogres last year.  The ogres keep raiding caravans trying to go through the pass.  If the caravans ever stop, it'll be the end for the town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:304
msgid ""
"Sure has been a long time since last summer, I think.  MUCH too long.  Something is wrong with the weather, and I'm beginning to think the gods are punishing us for supporting the Ironfist dynasty!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:305
msgid ""
"If tales told be true, the Shadow Guild and the Temple of Baa are in cahoots to ruin the Kingdom.  I hear the Temple has been magically extending winter in these parts, and the ritual materials they need are being supplied by the Shadow Guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:306
msgid ""
"If you've ever seen a sorcerer try to fly near a town, you may have been treated to the sight of the Dragon Towers shooting him down.  Dragon Towers shoot at anything that flies near a town, because they have trouble telling the difference between a man and a dragon.  Be careful!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:307
msgid ""
"It sure is a bad thing that those ogres have control over Icewind keep!  Some of their human allies are archers, and they like to shoot at people going through the pass.  They've been real bad for business at White Cap, believe me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:308
msgid ""
"There are a few important passes in the kingdom, and more and more they're controlled by monsters rather than the king's men.  If things go the way they're going much longer, we'll have to pay taxes to the devils instead of the king!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:309
msgid ""
"A master of air I spoke with some time ago claims that someone is tinkering with the weather using ritual magic.  He says he traced the magic back to one of those temples of Baa that've been springing up all over the place recently."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:31
msgid ""
"We have not had any travelers from Balzathar Lair since the canyon filled with water.  I wonder if any of them survived the flood!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:310
msgid ""
"The mountains around here have some mighty strange hermits living in them here and there.  Most are crazy, but a few go there to meditate on truths not meant for mortal man to know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:311
msgid ""
"If you look carefully in the mountains of this Kingdom, you might come across a pass that can cut days off your travel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:312
msgid ""
"Both Lord Stromgard and Lord Stone were key supporters of King Roland during the Succession Wars.  They owe their current positions to that support, and I think they have been amongst the most conscientious of the Lords of the Realm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:313
msgid "Dickson teaches expert mace just west of Castle Stromgard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:314
msgid "Jed teaches expert bow just west of Castle Stromgard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:315
msgid "Morton teaches expert dark magic in the southwest of White Cap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:316
msgid ""
"I've heard that Abdul has his resort in the south of Dragonsand.  Some resort!  It's probably filled with dragons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:317
msgid ""
"There's a strange pyramid in the middle of Dragonsand.  No one has any idea who built it, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:318
msgid ""
"Wyrms move very quickly on the ground, but cannot fly.  They attack with a poisonous breath attack."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:319
msgid ""
"Fire Lizards are just one of a variety of draconian creatures found in Dragonsand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:32
msgid ""
"Better watch out!  The Dread Pirate Stanley doesn't like strangers snooping around our island!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:320
msgid ""
"Wielders of Cronos gain an incredible boost to their vitality.  They'll need anything they can get, because troubles and misfortune constantly follow this axe."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:321
msgid ""
"A cave near Blackshire opened about the same time that people in the town started disappearing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:322
msgid ""
"The people of Blackshire have fallen under a terrible curse– they turn into werewolves at night!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:323
msgid ""
"An old temple sits in the center of Star Island.  Strangely enough, the number of statues on the island has slowly increased over time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:324
msgid ""
"Werewolves are simply people that turn into a half-man, half-beast creature at night.  They are especially powerful under a full moon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:325
msgid ""
"Air elementals flitter about in the valley between the Frozen Highlands and Dragonsand.  Though the weakest elementals, they're fast and have a nasty electrical attack."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:326
msgid ""
"The sword of a mighty warrior, Hercules confers a huge boost to might and endurance, but at the cost of the wielder's intellect."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:327
msgid ""
"No one has been promoted to high priest in ages.  I wonder what Anthony Stone requires from Priests for that promotion?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:328
msgid ""
"The island at the center of Star Lake is home to some monsters straight from the heart of hell!  I heard about someone who rowed out there one night with some friends and these huge snake creatures came boiling up out of the ground.  They had to but look you in the eye to turn you right to stone!  Anyway, this guy was the only one to make it back alive, he says, and he did it by running and not looking back!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:329
msgid ""
"A terrible curse has befallen the people in this area, and everyone thinks they know the source– it's that new cave that opened itself up in the side of the mountain south of town.  Someone needs to go in there and end the curse, but bravery's at a premium in Blackshire, these days."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:33
msgid ""
"If we can conquer Dagger Wound Island, then nothing will stop us from raiding Ravenshore and even the city of Alvar itself!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:330
msgid ""
"Dragonsand is the home and breeding ground of the dragons of Enroth.  Never will you find a more fierce or terrible monster than a dragon, and never will you find one that is gentle or kind."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:331
msgid ""
"The Circus of the Sun likes to set up alongside the road between Blackshire and Star Lake.  They're around here every year during April.  It's a good show– well worth the money to go see it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:332
msgid ""
"The road leading west from Blackshire has gone from the safest road in the Kingdom to the most dangerous.  West of here lies Pleasant Valley, and the name has long since become a joke.  Now that valley is a barren and ruined land, crawling with those hideous new monsters– the devils."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:333
msgid ""
"Just go west down the road from Blackshire a few days and you're sure to see some devils.  You better be able to run pretty fast, though!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:334
msgid ""
"Lord Kilburn disappeared while patrolling the road leading from Blackshire to Pleasant Valley.  At least, that's what people are saying.  If you're looking for him, you might want to start looking around there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:335
msgid ""
"We all saw the king fleeing from the devils toward Castle Kriegspire a while back.  Haven't heard from him since.  Sad.  I think the devils will take us all, before long."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:336
msgid "Ambrose teaches expert dark magic in the town of Blackshire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:337
msgid ""
"Castle Kriegspire, at one time, was the center of magical experimentation in creating creatures.  Now, it's abandoned and the creatures run rampant inside.  The volcano it rests in was created to keep all the monsters in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:338
msgid ""
"Agar, one of Archibald's sorcerers, was the most skilled of the experimenters in Kriegspire.  His monsters are the ones crawling around the castle now.  He left with the rest of the mages, but no one knows where he went to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:339
msgid ""
"Though weaker than dragons, drakes are nothing to sneer at.  These flying reptiles have powerful elemental attacks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:34
msgid ""
"I saw torches last night at the old ruined fort across the bay last night.   I wonder what people were doing out there?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:340
msgid ""
"Some of the minotaurs escaped from Kriegspire and now roam in and around the volcano surrounding the old castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:341
msgid ""
"Earth elementals prowl around the area of Kriegspire.  Free from the mages that summoned them, theses elementals look to destroy whatever they come across."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:342
msgid ""
"No armor in the world can match Apollo for protection against elemental spells.  Unfortunately, the armor gains its power from sapping the endurance of its wearer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:343
msgid ""
"The Superior Temple of Baa was constructed about a year ago against the mountains east of Castle Kriegspire.  Unlike most of their temples, it's closed to the public.  You'll have to join them if you ever want to be let in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:344
msgid ""
"The village of Edenbrook wouldn't be around these days if it weren't for King Roland and his men.  They saved it from a horde of devils a little while back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:345
msgid ""
"When the king fled to Castle Kriegspire he was followed by an enormous army of devils.  A couple of days later a few dozen devils were seen leaving the old volcano the castle occupies, but the King himself hasn't been seen since."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:346
msgid ""
"Rarely do humans and dragons get along, but the death knights have formed some sort of pact with a group of dragons in a keep on the north side of the mountains near Kriegspire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:347
msgid ""
"Nicholas can show you expert techniques with the magic of light in the village of Kriegspire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:348
msgid ""
"Titans are second in power only to the mighty dragons.  Not only do titans possess an incredible electric attack, they are skilled in mind magic and favor the Psychic Shock spell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:349
msgid ""
"Fire elementals seem to like Hermit's Isle, though who would summon them there is a mystery."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:35
msgid "Thanks for helping us empty the lair!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:350
msgid ""
"Although this crown reduces the reaction time of its wearer, it also makes the wearer incredibly resistant to elemental magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:351
msgid ""
"Hermit's Island has recently become home to the Supreme Temple of Baa.  They have found an ancient installation to put their temple in, and are no doubt performing dark experiments as we speak."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:352
msgid ""
"Dragonsand, the great desert of Enroth, is home to all the worst monsters in the world.  Dragons, titans, and other oversized killer monsters roam the sands freely on whatever errands such creatures find important.  Humans foolish enough to travel the desert learn to run and hide very quickly, or they don't last long."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:353
msgid ""
"Once the greenest and most fertile of lands in Enroth, Pleasant Valley has fallen under a curse that has caused the plants to wither, the animals to sicken, and the people to leave.  It is a barren land now, and no one wants to live there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:354
msgid ""
"Shortly after the Night of Shooting Stars, the blight began to eat away at Pleasant Valley.  In a few short years, nearly all the plants and animals had sickened and died, and the villagers and farmers living in the valley had to move east to find food.  The blight has shown no signs of abating– rather, it has accelerated, and will one day cover the entire continent unless something is done to stop it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:355
msgid ""
"Most of the devils you see in Pleasant Valley are in fact worker or soldier devils.  They are organized like ants, only they have intelligent leaders.  The leaders can fly, and their best leaders can use human speech and writing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:356
msgid ""
"Though powerful, the devils are far from invincible.  King Roland fought and won a battle at Sweet Water Pass by outmaneuvering them and outthinking them.  They're tough, but they die like anything else does when you put a sword through it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:357
msgid ""
"These legendary boots make the wearer a blur, able to react instantly to any situation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:358
msgid ""
"The devils seem to swarm around a strange building near the remains of Sweet Water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:359
msgid ""
"Although the ruins of the buildings are still there, the town is completely destroyed.  No one lives there anymore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:36
msgid ""
"Now that the water is gone, we can begin putting our lives in order.  But what if the flood comes back?  Are we still safe?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:360
msgid ""
"The forest of Blackwoode has been wiped out completely since the night of Shooting Stars."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:361
msgid ""
"The devils seem to prefer fire attacks and enjoy attacking in large groups.  Some of the most powerful can cast spells from the fire school."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:362
msgid ""
"This odd amulet will grant its wearer extra vitality, spell points, and luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:363
msgid ""
"Sweet Water used to be the most beautiful town in the kingdom, but no news has come from it since the Night of Shooting Stars.  I think the shooting star landed right on top of the town, leaving no survivors to tell the tale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:364
msgid ""
"The Oracle had warned of the coming of devils from the sky in writings long ago.  I don't think anyone remembers, and of those who do, no one thinks the Night of Shooting Stars and the devils are connected."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:365
msgid ""
"I met a man who went to discover the fate of the town of Sweet Water, and he says that the place was burnt to the ground by the devils.  The devils have built a strange tower near the old town, and eerie noises come from it every twenty minutes.  He would have explored further, but there were so many devils near the tower he didn't dare."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:366
msgid ""
"Have you noticed how Temples of Baa have been sprouting up throughout the kingdom?  They're everywhere, and I for one think it's an ominous development.  Although they offer free healing, they don't seem to be doing it out of kindness– there must be a method to their madness!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:367
msgid ""
"The queen left quite a while ago for her home country of Erathia.  People are getting worried– what if something happened to her during her trip?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:368
msgid ""
"Most of the shipping in Enroth follows a set schedule.  If you're in the right place at the right time, the shipping companies can take you great distances quickly and cheaply."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:369
msgid ""
"The legends say that the great ship used in the Crossing lies buried under a giant stone tomb in the middle of Dragonsand.  There must have been a lake or ocean long ago where the desert is now, for the ship to end up in the middle of the desert!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:37
msgid ""
"Our herd leader, Masul, will certainly wish to speak with you if you haven't already found him.  Seek him out and he may reward you for helping us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:370
msgid ""
"If you touch one of the obelisks scattered around the kingdom, you'll get a part of a riddle no one's yet unraveled.  People say that a great treasure lies buried somewhere in Enroth, and the one who finds the answer to the riddle will find the treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:371
msgid ""
"Beware the Dragon Towers you'll find near every major settlement.  They will shoot a fireball at anyone flying.  I guess they're meant to protect the towns from dragons and other flying monsters, but they can't tell the difference between a man and a monster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:372
msgid ""
"Some people are saying the Temple of Baa and the devils are in league!  It makes sense– the temple first appeared a few months after the Night of Shooting Stars, and we all know the devils and that night are related!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:373
msgid ""
"There's a rumor going 'round that Slicker Silvertongue, Wilbur Humphrey's representative on the High Council, is a traitor.  People are saying he's been seen in several Temples of Baa, and everyone knows the temple is against the king!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:374
msgid ""
"Weather sure has turned sour since the Night of Shooting Stars.  Every summer seems colder than the last.  Why, I'd venture to say last summer was the coldest winter I've ever experienced!  'Course, that's an exaggeration, but you know what I mean.  Something's wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:375
msgid ""
"Doesn't it seem there's been more floods and earthquakes since the king disappeared?  It's as though the gods are angry with the king and his dynasty.  Perhaps they have lost the Mandate of Heaven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:376
msgid ""
"Though the Temple of Baa may offer free healing, it seems to me that more things go wrong, and more people get hurt, when one of their temples is nearby.  Could it be they are cursing the people near them, and then healing them for some bizarre reason?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:377
msgid ""
"Have you ever seen Archibald's statue in the library behind Castle Ironfist?  It is amazingly lifelike… almost as though he was turned to stone rather than sculpted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:378
msgid ""
"The western province of Pleasant Valley has undergone a shocking transformation in the last few years.  Once it was a rich, fertile farming region.  Now all the plants have died from a terrible blight, and the water has dried up.  All the animals sickened or died, and all the people had to move away to find food to eat."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:379
msgid ""
"Ancient legends say that all the greatest artifacts from before the Silence came with the ship our distant ancestors used to get here from their homeland.  They say the voyage was so long that three generations of people were born, lived, and died while aboard the ship!  How's that for a whopper of a tale?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:38
msgid "Group 36"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:380
msgid ""
"Erathia is the second major continent to be settled in the world.  It is a lot wilder and more unsafe than Enroth, and all the little kingdoms there are always bickering and fighting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:381
msgid ""
"The islands east of Enroth are all part of the 'Kingdom' of Regna.  They were settled by the most nasty and violent of people hundreds of years ago, and they haven't changed their ways.  They are pirates and mercenaries to a man, and have no regard for the sorrow they cause by siding with petty tyrants and usurpers like Archibald was."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:382
msgid ""
"If the old tales are true, the dwarves were once just like the rest of us, but before the Crossing, the dwarves lived in a place where they and everything around them weighed a lot more.  The stories say this made them very short and very strong, and they haven't changed since."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:383
msgid "I don't like Mondays."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:384
msgid ""
"The best armor shop in all of Enroth is the Enchanted Hauberk.  The proprietor's name is Teddy, but he hates to be called that.  Safer to refer to him as Theodore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:385
msgid ""
"The best magic shop in the kingdom is Mighty Magicks.  It is possible to find there the most unusual and powerful enchanted items for sale anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:386
msgid ""
"Be careful with even ordinary objects.  If something is magical, get an expert like me to identify it before you sell it for pennies on the gold piece of its true worth.  You can be surprised by what there is to find out there, and you might sell off something very useful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:387
msgid ""
"The lands to the far west of the continent used to be green and fertile, but have wasted to an unhappy land of cracked earth, bad smells, and barren landscapes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:388
msgid ""
"Most civilized areas you'll find are in the east.  While there are some small towns and villages located to the west, don't count on finding many."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:389
msgid ""
"This ghastly place is named for all of the undead that prowl it.  Rumor has it that people killed in the mire return as undead guardians of the place."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:39
msgid "Group 37"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:390
msgid ""
"There are some places you can't get to by boat, during different times of the year.  You should plan your trips carefully to avoid inconvenience."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:391
msgid ""
"Many areas of the oceans are home to giant sea serpents.  Though not much danger to ships, they can be lethal to people, water walking or even bystanders on the coast."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:392
msgid ""
"If you are wounded enough, you will fall unconscious.  Taking a wound while unconscious almost always leads to death."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:393
msgid ""
"Mixing poppysnaps, phirna root, or widoweeps berries with water in an empty potion bottle will make a simple potion.  These simple potions have limited beneficial effects, but are stronger than the herbs by themselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:394
msgid ""
"Let me tell you the effects of the simple potions.  Red potions are minor healing, blue potions are minor spell point gain, and yellow potions are a boost to all seven statistics."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:395
msgid ""
"Because skills get so difficult to learn once you've achieved a high level in them, it is much more efficient to learn many skills to a moderate level, rather than a couple of skills to a high level."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:396
msgid ""
"Kriegspire, one of the centers of magical experimentation, has been swallowed by an enormous volcano.  Surely one of their experiments must have gone completely awry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:397
msgid ""
"The three most important things to remember in a battle are:  Don't get surrounded, concentrate on killing a single enemy before moving on to another, and don't be afraid to run.  No shame in living another day!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:398
msgid ""
"A finely crafted weapon is a rare find, but a magic weapon is a treasure indeed.  Magic weapons are often more damaging, faster, and sometimes even have spells imbedded into them.  Your skill is important, but having a great weapon certainly doesn't hurt either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:399
msgid ""
"When fighting in a place that is very hot or cold, try using the opposite kind of spell on your enemies.  Often they are resistant or immune to the element they're used to living in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:4
msgid ""
"Our thanks for defeating the pirates!  Now if you could only do something about the mountain of fire!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:40
msgid "Nothing to see here… move along."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:400
msgid ""
"Some sorcerers have cheated death itself in their attempts to gain power.  These sorcerers trade their lives for eternal life as an undead.   I can't imagine the lust for power that would cause someone to trade their soul.  Liches are powerful and determined; you should be careful fighting them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:401
msgid ""
"Light magic makes up one half of the Mirrored Path.  Light cannot exist without dark, nor dark without light.  The spells in the school of light are what most people would call 'holy.'  It is difficult to find training in this path, but the rewards are certainly worth the effort."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:402
msgid ""
"Merchants respond to a customer's skill in bargaining.  It's important to only use your best negotiator when you buy or sell anything with a  merchant."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:403
msgid ""
"A group of bandits called the Dragoons are now preying on merchants travelling between Free Haven and New Sorpigal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:404
msgid ""
"A while back I was exploring the Star Lake area, and saw a bunch of statues on the island at the center of the lake.  They were marvelously carved– the most lifelike statues I've ever seen.  I wonder who put them there?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:405
msgid ""
"The law of the land is simple:  Do not murder, do not threaten, do not bribe.  Begging is frowned upon, as is keeping company with known criminals.  Reputation is everything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:406
msgid ""
"Enroth is ruled by a king, and the council of five lords.  These six people handle the laws, rules, and matters of state for all of Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:407
msgid ""
"When someone has a chest or other lock they don't want you to get into, they'll usually trap it rather than lock it.  Everyone knows that a determined thief will eventually get through a lock, but not every determined thief will survive the trap once he opens the chest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:408
msgid ""
"Some locks are bound by magical enchantments.  You won't be able to open them, no matter how fine a locksmith you are, unless you have the magical key necessary."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:409 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:434
msgid ""
"Have you heard of the Temple of Baa?  They're wonderful!  My family was hungry and they fed us when no one else would.  All we had to do was promise to come back!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:41
msgid "Walk in the Light, friends."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:410
msgid ""
"People often remark at how lucky I am.  It's not so much that I'm lucky, it's that I look on the bright side of everything.  You'd be amazed at how trivial some of your worst problems are if you look at them from the right angle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:411
msgid ""
"Every now and then there's someone who needs to go to a strange place, like Castle Kriegspire.  Like this one fellow the other day, he paid me well to help him and his servants carry stuff over the lip of Kriegspire Mountain and into its center.  His servants didn't look too healthy, either, but they never got tired.  Smelled bad, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:412
msgid ""
"Paradise Valley is no more.  All that's left from the Night of the Shooting Stars is a barren wasteland.  I've seen it, but I didn't have the courage to venture into it.  I'm not sure what sort of acts the people of Paradise Valley did to justify that sort of Heavenly retribution, but they must have been foul indeed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:413
msgid ""
"Ah!  There's nothing like sitting next to the fire at home with a glass of wine, my dog at my feet, and a good balance sheet to work on.  That's the life!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:414
msgid ""
"There's no two ways about it– you always need gold.  Everything has a price; hopefully you can pay it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:415
msgid ""
"Terrible things have been happening lately.  I heard about a village that was washed away in the recent heavy rains when their local creek overflowed its banks, and the news from Sweet Water is so bad there's been no news– people are saying the entire town was wiped out!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:416
msgid ""
"I've heard the tales of the supper served to Roland's expedition the night before they left.  I wonder if any of them expected to return based on the accounts I've heard of that feast.  The luxury afforded to those men certainly sounded to me like some sort of last meal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:417
msgid ""
"Our horses around here are thankfully very tame, but there are some centaurs– half man, half horse– roaming the countryside of Erathia.  The centaurs like to gather in tribes and make war on the humans and elves living near them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:418
msgid ""
"The sewers under Free Haven house all sorts of interesting things.  I've heard stories of hideouts, temples, treasure, and well, sewage.  I don’t know which to believe, but it certainly seems like an interesting place."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:419
msgid ""
"Beware taking long trips for a few days– three planets are in retrograde, and one is actually on its third epicycle stage this month, all while Leo is ascending against Pisces' lateral movement.  Don't say I didn’t warn you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:42
msgid ""
"Welcome to our holy retreat. If you have business with our order, seek out the head priest, Oskar Tyre. His office is in the temple."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:420
msgid ""
"There are some places you can't get to during different parts of the year by boat.  You should plan your trips carefully to avoid inconvenience."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:421
msgid ""
"Magical flying is constrained to a certain altitude, so certain high mountains will block magical flight.  Given all the advantages of flight, that's really a very minor drawback."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:422
msgid ""
"The water in the lakes and seas around Enroth is very cold, and even the best swimmers can drown in it.  If you fall in the water, get out as fast as you can!  You can't survive long there, no matter how tough you think you are."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:423
msgid ""
"An excellent spell, but unfortunately most towns are in the east, so you won't get very far exploring with this spell.  Of course, if you need to run back to town, this is the easiest way to go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:424
msgid ""
"Although they were a heretical religion, their heart was in the right place.  The Church helped the poor, healed the sick, and comforted the distraught.  But they grew rich, powerful, and prideful, and pride indeed goeth before a fall.  When they attacked their rival, the Church of the Moon, they brought both their enemy and themselves down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:425
msgid ""
"It's hard to make a living these days playing music in the taverns.  I've been travelling between the towns for years, but people are really scared these days.  Everyone is afraid to spend money."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:426
msgid ""
"Boats don't always travel on the schedules or to the destinations you want.  If you want personal control over your water travel, the water walk spell is the way to go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:427
msgid ""
"The cutlass is a better weapon than the broadsword for many reasons, but the best is the way it's swept backward to deceive your opponent about the length of your weapon's reach.  The smithies of Regna turn out the best cutlasses in the world, you can bet on that, matey!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:428
msgid ""
"Chadwick, a veteran of the Succession Wars, lives in Free Haven.  He's the most decorated living cavalier in Enroth, and one of Osric's favorite knights."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:429
msgid ""
"Most games of chance are made to separate fools from their money.  Unless you're a psychic or phenomenally lucky, don't waste your hard earned gold on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:43
msgid ""
"What are you bothering me for? Talk to the Guildmaster, Sandro. He deals with guests. Not me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:430
msgid ""
"With the death of Roland and rumors of a collapse of the Ironfist Rule, the roads are almost unsafe to travel anymore.  Brigands and bandits of all sorts now prey on anyone travelling too far from the protection of the castles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:431
msgid ""
"If you must resort to 'special' measures to get someone to talk to you, remember that begging is almost free of consequences.  Some types, however, just won't listen to a beggar, forcing you to try another tack.  Thieves and merchants never tolerate begging."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:432
msgid ""
"Nicolai Ironfist is my twin brother.  I'll bet you didn't know that, did you?  We were separated a long time ago by our father, Roland.  They've used magic to keep Nicolai looking so young, but he's really my age."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:433
msgid ""
"Most people like to talk about the sewers of Free Haven as a home for all sorts of thieves.  I doubt it though.  I'd certainly live in a nice house with plenty of butlers and maids if I had my druthers.  Why would I choose to live in a sewer?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:435
msgid ""
"We need a real king, not a child.  How can Nicolai be a good ruler when he's still a child?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:436
msgid ""
"There's not much difference in cloak styles, except a general color or fabric choice.  There is one that stands out,  however, as quite unusual.  That's the Doomsday Cloak, fabricated 80 years ago by the Church of the Moon.  You can recognize it buy it's black interior lining and silver hem.  These cloaks are invariably highly enchanted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:437
msgid ""
"Someone has to do all the grunt labor around here.  Too bad that someone is me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:438
msgid ""
"All this cold weather's really got me worried.  It's really unusual, and I'm concerned for the health of my crop."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:439
msgid ""
"If I had a Heavenly Forge, I could make hundreds of barrels a day and not break a sweat.  I guess those forges were one good thing about the Time of Wonders."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:44
msgid ""
"Out of my way, cretin! You interrupt my thoughts, and I'm thinking about important matters!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:440
msgid ""
"To make strong, excellent pottery, you really need a hot fire.  If it weren't so dangerous, I'd make a trip to Castle Kriegspire to try out the fires they're supposed to have under the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:441
msgid ""
"When the storms hit in July, I was completely unprepared for the demand for winter clothes.  Now that I'm ready for the winter demand, it hasn't been all that cold.  I must have done something to anger the Heavens!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:442
msgid ""
"There are a few different kinds of magical boots that alchemists have been making.  Most of the metallic ones have some sort of enchantment on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:443
msgid ""
"Why isn't anyone doing anything about all the bad things happening?  Isn't that what the council is there for?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:444
msgid ""
"There must be something wrong with this year's grain crops.  I can't seem to find enough sellers of raw wheat and corn to make my business run properly.  I don't know how much longer this can go on before I'm broke."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:445
msgid ""
"The metal weapons aren't the only things to be enchanted.  Wooden weapons, like bows, sometimes have powerful spells placed in them as well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:446
msgid ""
"Marble is the finest building material money can buy.  Most of it comes from the hills near Blackshire...   which is too bad, since people are saying there's some sort of terrible curse on the people of that area. Not much work is getting done around there these days."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:447
msgid ""
"How can you recognize a goblin pirate? He is the one with the patch over both eyes!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:448
msgid ""
"Monsters been eating the good game animals, lately.  Lots more monsters than usual."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:449
msgid ""
"I can't believe how few people will actually part with a little money for a wretch like me.  Is everyone so selfish?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:45
msgid ""
"I hope that this war against the Dragons never ends!  Charles Quixote pays mercenaries like myself very well for our services."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:450
msgid ""
"Don't tell no one, but I have a cleric friend who heals the brand marks right off the cattle we, ah, borrow from all the ranchers.  Works like a charm!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:451
msgid ""
"The destruction of Paradise Valley wiped out the grandest forest in Enroth, Blackwoode Forest.  A peaceful place, Blackwoode Forest was full of game.  I made a good living there among the trees.  Now I'm not sure where to hunt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:452
msgid ""
"You can't even begin to understand how unpleasant working for the nobility is.  They may have money, but no other client is so pushy, demanding, or uncaring about the way they use your time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:453
msgid ""
"The Island Empire of Regna hasn't converted to Baa yet.  I'm hoping to travel there to spread the word of Baa."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:454
msgid "We get all of our important shipments in on Tuesdays."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:455
msgid ""
"Fortunately, most violent people take their aggressions out in the Arena, and not in the towns."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:456
msgid ""
"The High Council hasn't consulted the Oracle for years.  The last person to try was Archibald, and the Oracle didn't help him out at all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:457
msgid ""
"There is nothing worse than new religions promising the world to the underprivileged.  They are upsetting the applecart and fomenting rebellion.  This Temple of Baa that everyone is talking about– now, they're no good.  I do wish the regent would mobilize against them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:458
msgid ""
"Baa, friend…oh.  Uh, I thought you were a member of my temple.  Sorry, my mistake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:459
msgid ""
"I hate school.  My father says I need to work hard so that I can get a good job, maybe even learn to study magic.  Who cares about that?  I just want to play!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:46 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:47
msgid ""
"Our king, Deftclaw, has given you his protection, but watch your step. Cause any trouble, and I will make a snack out of you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:460 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:461
msgid ""
"Not to ruin my business, but to be honest, if you think about it, it really pays to only hire us smiths when you need us, rather than carrying us around wherever you go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:462
msgid ""
"If you ever find an item containing the Lloyd's Beacon spell, remember that the locations you are able to transport to are based per person.  That means that even a non-spell using person could have a location that they can transport to with the use of a Lloyd's Beacon item."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:463
msgid ""
"There are three plants that can be used to make the three basic potions.  They are poppysnaps, phirna root, and widoweeps berries.  Just mix the crushed flowers, roots, or berries respectively with water to get the potion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:464
msgid ""
"Castle Kriegspire was originally built to study the extinct volcano in which it rests, but recent activity from that mountain has chased all humans from the castle.  It hasn't been destroyed yet, but monsters are the only ones that dare live inside it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:465
msgid ""
"The dragons from Dragonsand have taken advantage of the devils' attacks and have spread out from the desert into the nearby wastelands. They are even rumored to be as north as Kriegspire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:466
msgid ""
"Some monsters can be reasoned with.   If you know the charm spell, for instance, you can make even the most ferocious of beasts temporarily friendly.  Remember– you don't have to kill everything you meet.  Sometimes just getting past them is enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:467 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:497
msgid ""
"Lady Fleise is the Queen of the Merchants, and she has built a huge fortune by controlling shipping prices."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:468
msgid ""
"Occasionally some coastal towns or slow ships are attacked by pirates.  Fortunately, pirates are rare, but their attacks can affect prices in the towns they plunder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:469
msgid ""
"Certain monsters and spells can reduce your body to ashes, making efforts to raise the dead difficult.  We healers call this eradication.  Only special temples and spells can cure eradication."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:470
msgid ""
"You don't need a powerful spell caster with you for healing.  All the towns and castles have temples with healers.  You can make healing potions, find items with healing spells in them, or even magical fountains or shrines that can heal you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:471
msgid "The largest Guild of the Self was founded in Silver Cove."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:472
msgid ""
"Whenever you have the opportunity, it pays to become an expert or master in any given skill you've been practicing.  Experts and masters enjoy benefits and effects out of the reach of people who just learn the basic skill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:473
msgid ""
"It's important to fight creatures challenging to you.  If you fight weak creatures, you don't learn much experience, and if you fight hard creatures, you run the risk of dying.  The creatures at your skill level are the most rewarding to learn from."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:474
msgid ""
"Always wear armor if you can!  Always!  And spend a little effort to learn to use it or you'll wallow like a pregnant yak in a fight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:475
msgid ""
"A man had wandered through not too long ago proclaiming to have knowledge of ancient weapons, the likes of which have not been seen since the Time of Wonders.  We laughed him and his insane ramblings right out of town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:476
msgid ""
"This spell is my personal favorite.  It works best on the strongest and toughest monsters by making them heavier, and smashes lots of important internal organs.  It seems to cut their health in half, and with the strong ones, that can be quite a bit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:477
msgid ""
"The greatest magical researcher since the Silence, Twillen's age has finally caught up with him.  The last I heard, he was searching for a way to find his youth again.  I don't think even he can counter the forces of nature."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:478
msgid ""
"Dark magic makes up one half of the Mirrored Path.  Dark cannot exist without light, nor light without dark.  'Evil' is the word most commonly associated with the school of dark, but that's not true.  A school, like a weapon, isn't good or evil by itself–  it's morality is determined by its use."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:479
msgid ""
"Although banks in Enroth don't pay interest, they protect your money from theft and loss.  You should consider putting your money in a bank before embarking on any long or dangerous trips."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:48
msgid "Group 46"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:480
msgid ""
"Ahhh, the point of being a merchant!  Gold makes the world move.  Economies bustle with exchange of gold, from markets to farms, to towns, to kingdoms– everywhere!  Even kings spend the lives of their men more readily than they will their gold.  Being a merchant is the way to accumulate wealth, and that wealth gives me a status that most people will never have."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:481
msgid ""
"There is a small village around Abdul's Desert Resort that sells some of the finest magic equipment I've ever seen.  Heaven knows where they get it, but it sure is nice to know that stuff is available there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:482
msgid ""
"Beware of highwaymen plying the roads between towns.  Wise travelers will take advantage of Enroth's many high quality banking establishments to avoid being completely robbed by these parasites."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:483
msgid ""
"A whole culture of underworld people exists, though it is sometimes difficult to find.  Thieves and criminals have their own organizations and codes, and are surprisingly good at spreading information.  Though you can't always trust them, it's wise to use them as best you can."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:484
msgid ""
"I've build a few secret doors in my day, and I think I can safely say that some of them are virtually indistinguishable from a plain old wall.  If you have the Wizard Eye spell, you can use it to look at the map it makes for you and logically work out whether or not a section of wall is part of a secret door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:485
msgid ""
"Hey!  I'm a legitimate locksmith, not some shady burglar or thief.  I help protect peoples' belongings, not steal them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:486
msgid ""
"A pipe gives a wise man something to think about and a fool something to stick in his mouth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:487
msgid ""
"Speaking of dooming yourself, poor Roland should never have bitten off as much as he did.  I'm sure he met his end courageously, but it was far too early in his life."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:488
msgid ""
"Don't be careless with the way you pack your goods in your backpack!  A little organization can save a lot of space, and let you carry more.  No one's going to do it for you, you know!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:489
msgid ""
"Some places it is simply too dangerous to rest.  Never assume you can rest in a difficult area.  Try and save enough strength to be able to retreat to a safer area."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:49
msgid "Group 47"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:490
msgid ""
"You know, it really makes me uncomfortable to have to do business with or hear accounts from criminals.  I know they've stolen money, but what am I to do about that?  Jail is reserved for only the most violent or persistent of criminals.  Bring back Archibald and the good old fashioned execution, that's what I say!  King Roland's too soft, and so is his regent."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:491
msgid ""
"One of the best ways to make money is to curb your expenses.  Find the cheapest places to get supplies, healing, and training.  Don't hire people you don't need, don't pay for travel unless you need to, and don't buy items you don't intend to use.  Saving money is as important as making it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:492
msgid ""
"There's a way to make a powerful potion by mixing common herbs into water and the simple potions that process makes into more complex potions.  I know that if you mix an orange potion with a green potion you'll end up with a white potion of extreme protection.  There's a lot of other combinations you could try, but experimenting is dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:493
msgid ""
"I love a well prepared steak, seasoned with a few herbs, and served with onions and mushrooms.  Add some steamed vegetables, maybe a potato, and some good ale… now that's a meal!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:494
msgid ""
"Now, not a lot of people like to go to the Mire of the Damned, and I'm one of them.  Horses don't belong there, either, and I don't think you'll soon find a stagecoach company willing to take you there.  My advice is to stay away from that place."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:495
msgid ""
"In my last visit to Castle Ironfist, Nicolai raved over how much he wanted to visit the circus.  I played a few songs from the circus for him, and he seemed to appreciate the gesture a great deal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:496
msgid ""
"It isn't wise to laugh off prophecies, even if, admittedly, most don't come true.  The most important one of our age is the one by Apius Silanus made on his deathbed 800 years ago when he said the dark brother would rise again in the shadow of the light brother's sunset.  That sounds an awful lot like our King Roland and his wicked brother Archibald, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:498
msgid ""
"Alamos is the home of many researching sorcerers and their magyar guards.  Rumor has it the sorcerers there study summoning spells, but no one is brave enough to go there and ask."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:499
msgid ""
"If you're ever facing a horde of small monsters, try using the Ice Blast spell on them.  It explodes into dozens of tiny shards of ice that bounce around and slice your enemies to ribbons.  Because it will bounce off the walls, it works even better indoors.  Make sure you cast it far away from yourself, or it will hit you, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:5
msgid ""
"There is no way back to the village of Blood Drop!  I have no way of knowing if my family lives or not!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:50
msgid "Group 48"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:500
msgid ""
"If you're going to be teleporting around everywhere, it's important to keep good maps to avoid getting lost."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:501
msgid ""
"Light magic is the strongest magic in the world that doesn't bite you for trying to use it.  Dark magic can work offensive miracles, but often as not there's a price to pay for using it.  Also, many of the most destructive dark magics hurt the caster at the same time it hurts the enemy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:502
msgid ""
"Pipe music seems to have a strange effect on rats and children.  At least it does when I use my best pipe.  They follow you everywhere!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:503
msgid ""
"I've never made it to Star Island, but I've seen the statues outside.  No one has ever come back from a trip to the island, and I suspect the statues are the transformed people that have made it to the island and discovered some terrible secret there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:504
msgid ""
"For sea battles, there's nothing like a trident for dealing with enemies.  The trident works underwater, or from the surface into the water.  Most weapons can't cut through the water well, but a trident stabs right through it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:505
msgid ""
"Rumors abound that the council actually guards a cache of equipment from before the Silence.  I don't believe it, though.  Wouldn't the council have used this equipment against the devils, or even in the Succession War if it were true?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:506
msgid ""
"Here, let me see your palm…<pointing at a line on your hand> Ah.  Well, just as I suspected.  You're going to die.  Soon, I'll warrant."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:507
msgid ""
"A dagger or knife is the most useful weapon in the world.  You can use it for a variety of tasks, from cooking to carving to lock picking (in a pinch).  Plus, as you become more and more skilled, you can use one in either hand and even strike vital locations on enemies with precise attacks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:508
msgid ""
"If ever there was a snake's nest of politics and religion, it was Karigor.  Karigor is a small island southeast of the 'bootleg' that New Sorpigal is situated on.  The twin rival Churches of the Sun and the Moon were founded there, and fought the longest war the world has ever seen until they managed to destroy one another about 200 years ago.  Their artifacts of power are scattered around the world."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:509
msgid ""
"The Temple of Baa is full of insane cultists bent on world domination!  Their evil is everywhere, and they're out to get you and me!  Our only chance of escape is to kill their leader, Wilbur Humphrey, before he poisons the ear of the prince any longer!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:51
msgid "Group 49"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:510
msgid ""
"A bandit that prowls up north, he is notorious for collecting 'protection' from merchants.  He has a good racket, but I'm not sure how long it'll last before someone does him in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:511
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone I said this, but people are saying the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven.  What else could cause all the storms and floods and disasters?  These are signs of heavenly wrath, mark my words!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:512
msgid ""
"With all of the troubles that are going on, I'm certainly glad to be protected by my lord!  Other people might have to worry about their well-being, but all I have to focus on is the work that must be done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:513
msgid ""
"Gauntlets are more an armorer's specialty than a tailor's, but I can tell you that the best stuff is available in the armorsmith shops of the far north.  The finest of these magical gauntlets are almost as easy to wear as a soft glove, yet protect every bit as well as the hardest plate gauntlets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:514
msgid ""
"As much as I hate being a lowly laborer, I'd much rather be me than any of the Ironfists.  Troubles seem to follow them like ants at a picnic.  I lead a simple but happy life… better that than to be a miserable noble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:515
msgid ""
"There's been a lot of troop movement, these days.  All these soldiers keep walking over my fields!  Now you tell me– what do you think happens when an entire army walks over your crops?  Yes, that's right!  Financial ruin!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:516
msgid ""
"Fortunately there are a lot of taverns and inns around; they keep me busy making casks for them.  You can find an inn almost anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:517
msgid ""
"It's tough being a potter these days– there's no reason making it harder on yourself.  Always go to market knowing what prices should be, and make sure you come armed with your wits!  Someone without any merchant skill is likely to get bad bargains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:518
msgid ""
"If you're planning on staying up north for very long, make sure you pack warm clothes.  It never seems to stop snowing up there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:519
msgid ""
"Dragonhide is the best material to use when making any shoe, belt, or boot.  It is supple, yet tough and resistant to the elements."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:520
msgid ""
"With all the practice I have digging, I should go to the islands in the bay and dig for pirate treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:521
msgid ""
"Well, with all this bad weather going on, at least the wind is good for me.  I have two windmills, and a little wind goes a long way to saving me a lot of money on labor costs!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:522
msgid ""
"Perhaps I should move to Regna.  They have the largest navy in the world.  I could easily adapt to shipbuilding.  I mean, wood is wood, right?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:523
msgid ""
"Gems can be worth quite a bit of money, so don't get rid of them or sell them cheap!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:524
msgid "Why didn't the skeleton cross the road? He didn't have the guts!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:525
msgid "Tanning is a disgusting job.  That's why I trap instead of tan."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:526
msgid ""
"I hate to be begging like this, but the injuries I sustained in the Succession War prevent me from doing most labor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:527
msgid ""
"Don't laugh, but I heard that giant flying bloodsuckers are responsible for killing the cows in the New Sorpigal area.  Gods preserve us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:528
msgid ""
"Scattered about the lands are shrines.  I wonder what they're dedicated to and who worships at them?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:529
msgid ""
"I've scribed some spell books for a number of sorcerers, including Albert Newton.  He's my best customer, as a matter of fact.  He sells the most complex spells to the Guilds of Light and Dark based somewhere in the west, probably near Blackshire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:530
msgid ""
"This Church focused on worshipping the heavens.  The conflict between the Churches of the Sun and Moon was pointless and wasteful.  We're all fortunate they're both gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:531
msgid ""
"Better than digging ditches.  Besides, someone has to keep the machinery of state moving!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:532
msgid ""
"Do I look bored to you?  I'm not, of course.  Acting like you're asleep is an old guard's trick."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:533
msgid ""
"You can tell that Archibald's an Ironfist– he has the trademark bad luck.  Not only did his bid for power fail, now he's a statue in the royal library.  At least he gets to spend the rest of his days in the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:534
msgid ""
"This Mandate of Heaven nonsense really has the potential to start up some serious trouble.  If someone doesn't figure out what is going on with these disasters soon, the kingdom is going to fall apart!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:535
msgid ""
"If you're ever in need of healing and you don't have enough money to pay those sharks at the regular temples, why not visit a Temple of Baa?  They're healing people for free!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:536
msgid ""
"I wish I was Nicolai!  He's still a kid, but I bet no one tells him what to do!  He can do whatever he wants because he's the king.  Not like me, everyone tells me what to do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:537
msgid ""
"Sometimes you can tell that a weapon is heavily enchanted just by looking at it.  If it's heavy and glitters a lot, it's expensive, and probably very powerful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:538
msgid ""
"Don't overlook the defensive value of a good shield.  Yeah, I know a two-handed weapon hits a lot harder, but what do you do if you miss, or if that monster just doesn't go down on the first swing?  That's when a good shield comes into play.  It'll save your life one day, mark my words!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:539
msgid ""
"Statistics show that most items are broken when the wielder or wearer falls unconscious from damage, or where a monster has a particularly bruising blow to deliver.  The single best way to prevent broken items is to just not be knocked unconscious.  Get healed before it's too late."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:54
msgid "Good luck in the contest!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:540
msgid ""
"Most items you find will boost or enhance some basic characteristic about you, but a few will have a more complex effect.  It is these that are truly valuable, and their names are usually in the form of 'item of ' as in wand of lightning bolts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:541
msgid ""
"There is an island southwest of Enroth where people say is the headquarters of the Temple of Baa.  Why they would pick such a remote location for such a popular religion is beyond me, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:542
msgid ""
"Rumor has it the westernmost parts of the Frozen Highlands are overrun with powerful creatures.  Maybe even dragons!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:543
msgid ""
"Not anymore it isn't!  Since the devils came, Paradise Valley is a barren wasteland infested with hundreds of devils.  No one goes in there and survives!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:544 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:574
msgid ""
"King Roland keeps his own personal royal yacht, the Queen Catherine, in a lake just west of Castle Ironfist.  She is a mighty ship, capable of going nearly anywhere quickly, but only the king or the regent can give permission for someone to use her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:545
msgid ""
"Many small islands fill Bootleg Bay.  I've heard rumors of temples on the islands, and even pirate hideouts!  I've never seen either, but I can imagine the amount of treasure a pirate would have accumulated."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:546
msgid ""
"It is important to raise someone from the dead as soon as possible, if you intend to do it.  If you take too long, death may require more than one spell to fix.  This can get expensive!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:547
msgid ""
"It's possible to create more complicated potions by mixing the simple potions together to create compound potions.  Compound potions are stronger than simple potions and have slightly different effects."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:548
msgid ""
"Simple potions combine to create compound potions.  Orange potions temporarily boost your armor class, green potions temporarily boost your resistances, and purple potions serve as antidotes to any poison."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:549
msgid ""
"Everyone has a spell book, but many lack the ability to fill it with even the simplest of spells.  If you can somehow get a spell into your spell book, you can cast it as long as you have enough spell power."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:55
msgid "I wish Brent knew how to make a red potion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:550
msgid ""
"A cunning woman– it's easy to forget how intelligent she is when dealing with her.  Aside from gaining vast amounts of wealth, she's mastered several skills, and is associated with a few of the druidic orders of the north."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:551
msgid ""
"Pay attention to the advantages of small, quick weapons.  If you're good enough with them, you can attack twice as often as you could with a larger, heavier weapon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:552
msgid ""
"Some warriors prefer to specialize in one weapon above all others.  This training makes them incredible fighters, but it has a few weaknesses.  They may not be able to find an awesome weapon of the type they've specialized in, or they may be fighting against an opponent that is more resistant to their type of attacks.  Specialists are very good, but they shouldn't travel alone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:553
msgid ""
"Be sure to use spells of protection when you have them.  They can really reduce the heartache of being reduced to ash by dragon fire or electrocuted by enemy sorcerer lightning attacks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:554
msgid ""
"A powerful sorcerer, Agar tried in vain to create powerful creatures as his slaves so that he could conquer Enroth.  His minions were either too stupid to be of use, or too smart to be controlled."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:555
msgid ""
"Corlagon took Terrax's Crystal to his estate for studying when he began learning the Necromantic arts.  I imagine the crystal is still there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:556
msgid ""
"Diplomacy is the skill that makes people feel more favorable towards you.  If you must speak with someone who doesn't seem to like you, make sure that you use your most diplomatic person to do the talking."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:557
msgid ""
"I wish I knew who Abdul is.  His shops consistently offer low prices– he must be a bandit trying to launder money.  I can't see any other reason to have the low prices he does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:558
msgid ""
"I'm certain the devils destroyed the town of Sweet Water!  It was the most northwestern town in Enroth, and certainly one of the most beautiful.  Not many people made it out that way to visit, but now you don't hear anything about the place."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:559
msgid ""
"There are two major thief guilds in the land.  One, the 'sanctioned' one, can be found in some of the major towns in the kingdom.  The other, guild is called the Shadow Guild.  They are much more violent and cruel than the sanctioned guilds, and I'm sure the king would put them down if he had the time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:56
msgid "You'd better watch out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:560
msgid ""
"The lords themselves are too busy to handle most affairs of state, so they have council members that attend the High Council in Free Haven for them.  Each lord has one council member, and these six people make most of the laws of the state, in the names of their respective lords."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:561
msgid ""
"Plate armor is, of course, the strongest kind of armor available.  There is a legendary suit of armor called Zeus, and it can imbue its wearer with extraordinary strength, but it doesn’t do much for the personality."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:562
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors that Zoltan Phelps lost a valuable possession to a group of bandits.  If he had taken proper precautions and had used my services, that wouldn't have happened."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:563
msgid ""
"I know I charge a lot to travel with, but I'm worth it!  If you keep me around, I'll tell you words of wisdom you'll not soon hear from anyone else.  For instance, did you know that a fool and his money are soon parted?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:564
msgid ""
"It's a pity the Temple in Free Haven was destroyed in the fire.  That temple had the most magnificent altar.  The clerics there could raise people from the dead, even from just ashes!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:565
msgid ""
"The people who hire me often ask me to carry all kinds of junk I know they can do without.  Sorcerers have got to be the worst.  Pipes, tubes, glassware, junk– the works.  Just keep the best stuff with you and sell all that old junk!  But remember that selling to a general store will always get the worst prices."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:566
msgid ""
"Resting while poisoned or diseased is not advisable.  You stand a good chance of never waking from a rest while under these conditions.  You should get yourself healed of the poison or disease before resting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:567
msgid ""
"The 'Imperial Regnan Navy' has been on a taxation spree recently, and this has raised the cost of sea travel and transportation tremendously.  Many businessmen simply cannot afford to pay insurance on their goods any longer.  Somebody has to do something about the troublesome Regnans."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:568
msgid ""
"Due to the recent problems, people aren't spending as much money as they used to.  I'm afraid the economy is going to suffer quite a bit from this, and everyone will soon feel it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:569
msgid ""
"Wise men are saying they think the Temple of Baa is behind all the disasters that have been happening recently.  I think they're probably right.  The temple offers free healing, but you should think twice before using it– people are suspicious of the temple, and you'll get a bad reputation for having anything to do with them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:57
msgid "Don't cause any trouble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:570
msgid ""
"I've heard of fountains with magical waters that are supposed to exist in the lands.  I wish I could find one of these fountains; I'd love to prepare a meal with some magical water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:571
msgid ""
"You don't need to worry about this as much if you travel using the stagecoaches, but if you walk, be sure to rest on grass.  It's a lot more comfortable, and your travelling resources won't get used up as fast as if you try to sleep in the middle of the road."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:572
msgid ""
"I don't understand why there aren't any major Temples of Baa in or around any of the major cities or castles.  For some reason they all seem to be built in more remote places."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:573
msgid ""
"Most people don't know about it, but the Dragon Towers posted near each of the towns are quite dangerous to students of air.  They're meant to shoot down flying monsters, but they'll also shoot at flying sorcerers.  They shot at me, once, and I'm lucky to be alive to tell this tale!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:575
msgid ""
"Terrax was Enroth's first arch mage, and a sorcerer of incredible power.  He developed the foundations for elemental magic, and made the first basic discoveries into light and dark magic.  His crystal is said to hold some of the highest magical secrets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:576
msgid ""
"The Town Portal spell is the single best spell for travelling huge distances in Enroth.  Masters of water have firm control over where they go and when they can cast this spell.  It's expensive to learn, but well worth your while!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:577
msgid ""
"If you can't learn to retreat, Guardian Angel at least provides a means of escape from certain death.  Anytime you explore a dangerous area, it's best to have this spell cast, just in case."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:578
msgid ""
"The Temple of Baa has been giving a bad name to all religion.  People are beginning to think they're behind these disasters, and I'm beginning to agree.  The gods must surely be angry with their disgusting heresies!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:579
msgid ""
"Can't count on savage beasts to be soothed by music.  That whole story about controlling beasts with music is just a myth.  I have scars to prove it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/Global.txt:12 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:58
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:580
msgid ""
"Castle Darkmoor, in the deepest part of the Mire of the Damned, houses the most powerful undead anywhere in the world.  That's how the rumor goes, anyway.  I've never actually seen the place, much less been inside of it.  I've made it out of the mire alive, though.  Not many people can say that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:581
msgid ""
"I know it sounds bad, but the best job I ever had was Imperial Tax Collector for his Highness, Hareck IX.  We collected tax on a lot of ships, and good old Hareck always let us keep some of the booty– er, I mean proceeds.  <sighs> Yep.  Those were the days!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:582
msgid ""
"The knight's Lord!  Osric's mastered everything there is in combat, from individual fighting to the logistics of siege warfare.  No one is a match for him in a battle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:583
msgid ""
"I can see the mark of doom about your face!  It is like a cloud that hangs just above your head, clouding your features and casting a shadow over your future.  Great and terrible adventures await you, my friend!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:584
msgid ""
"The priests of Baa are nice, even to gypsies.  You can tell a priest of Baa from the decorative cloaks they wear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:585
msgid ""
"If someone won't talk to you, and begging doesn’t seem to be working, try a good, hefty bribe.  Gold loosens a tongue faster than charity."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:586
msgid ""
"Everyone wonders what secrets the ancient pyramid in Dragonsand holds.  Well, I know.  I went there under the protection of the King of the Dragons, and entered the pyramid.  It's the storehouse for all of the dragons' treasure!  It's packed to the brim with gold and artifacts.  Ahh, just the memory of the beauty brings a tear to my eye."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:587
msgid ""
"Gah!  Nothing has ruined my livelihood more than the banks.  Because it's nearly impossible to break into them, everyone stores all of their valuables there.  I can't find anything decent to take anymore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:588
msgid ""
"It's a shame about the king, what with his disappearance and all.  He must have done something to offend heaven to be so unlucky.  I guess he's getting what he deserves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:589
msgid ""
"I wish I was a hero with a sword and shield, instead of a peasant with a plow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:59
msgid "Thanks for trading with us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:590
msgid ""
"Erik Applegate is the tailor most famous for working with alchemists to enchant belts.  Applegate has been working at this task for a few decades, now, and you can expect they've turned out some amazing stuff."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:591
msgid ""
"I ate some poppysnaps once.  They made me so sick I missed a day's work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:592
msgid ""
"I hear there's a terrible blight infecting crops and plants in the west.  If it spreads here, I'll be ruined!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:593
msgid ""
"With the destruction of Blackwoode and the stand-off in the Timber War, where am I going to get wood to keep making barrels?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:594
msgid ""
"You can find the shells of all these little animals along the beach and in the rivers when you're looking for good clay.  They must be very old.  There's a lot of shellfish in the Free Haven Harbor.  Oysters, I think.  So many of them, they clutter up all my good clay!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:595
msgid ""
"Fancy hats and pretty shirts are nice, but if you're going to be in combat you're better off with armor and a helmet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:596
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of the legendary pair of boots called Hermes?  It's said that the boots can boost their wearer's speed to godlike levels.  I'd love to see that someday!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:597
msgid ""
"I'm not nearly as skilled as some of the people around here.  If I could cast spells, or heal, or fix things, more people would want to hire me.  Who needs ditches dug anymore?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:598
msgid ""
"While the storms have been a big help with the windmills, the water mills are suffering from all the cold weather.  Every time the streams freeze up, no work gets done at the water mills."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:599
msgid ""
"The last Heavenly Forge stopped working about 130 years after the Silence.  No one has ever been able to repair the Forges."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:6
msgid ""
"You came through the Portals of Stone?  They are working?  We can return to our families!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:60
msgid "Group 7"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:600
msgid ""
"They say that the streets of Kalimar, the capitol city of Karigor, are made of fine jade, and the buildings all use it too.  Sounds beautiful, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:601
msgid ""
"Did you hear about the orc ventriloquist whose dummy quit to find a new partner?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:602
msgid ""
"There's lots of ways of laying a trap that's sure to go off when someone opens a box or steps on a certain spot on the ground.  You'd do well to have a little skill in disarming traps if you're going to go adventuring.  Could save your life one day, you know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:603
msgid ""
"Have pity on a poor soul and spare a few coins!  The gods will favor you if you do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:604
msgid ""
"Ever try sneaking up on a cow in the middle of the night?  They sleep standing up.  You can knock them over by just pushing hard.  Boy, that is one surprised cow when it wakes up!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:605
msgid ""
"Who's Ivan Seling?  Only the greatest bow craftsman ever!  I wish I had a bow he made.  No one could be a better hunter than I!  Unfortunately, his bows have become very rare since the Timber Wars."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:606
msgid ""
"Given the lousy selling price of spell scrolls, I would just hold on to them and use them in emergencies.  Often they are scribed at a very high skill level, so you may find their use worthwhile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:607
msgid ""
"Roland's death is proof that the Ironfist line has lost the Mandate of Heaven.  It's time Enroth had new rulers!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:608
msgid ""
"Rubber for my stamps comes from southern Erathia's more tropical climate.  There's a plant that grows there that saves clerks 'round the world a lot of repetitive writing!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:609
msgid ""
"I wish I had the opportunity to go on Roland's expedition.  Better to take action and fight bravely against the enemy than to stand around and wait for trouble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:61
msgid "Group 8"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:610
msgid ""
"I can't believe the strange weather we've been having lately.  I think I might just start betting on the weather.  I could probably make a killing!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:611
msgid ""
"The king's disappearance is a disaster.  I know that it is hard to feel sympathy for the nobility, but an orderly kingdom is in everyone's best interests.  Losing the king doesn't create order, and there is no one who could possibly replace him without so much bloodshed it would make the Succession Wars look like a schoolgirl slap fight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:612
msgid ""
"Once you join the Temple of Baa, you'll be issued temple cloaks and be allowed to visit the Superior Temple of Baa located just east of Castle Kriegspire.  Everyone's going to join us sooner or later, so why wait?  The Superior Temple is quite a sight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:613
msgid ""
"My mother told me that if I do bad things, the devils will come and get me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:614
msgid ""
"Don't let the name fool you:  Abdul's discount stores offer really great quality for low, low prices.  He also didn't pay me to say that on Thursdays.  Honest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:615
msgid ""
"Always have your best merchant do the talking when you buy and sell stuff through merchants.  If they can make a few more gold pieces off an unwary customer, not a one of them will hesitate, believe you me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:616
msgid ""
"Many unusual magical effects occur during annual astrological events, such as the two solstices and equinoxes.  Eclipses, midnight, noon, comets; all these things can be magically significant.  The significant dates this year are:  March 20th, June 21st, September 23rd, and December 21st."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:617
msgid ""
"In the land of Enroth, the shades of black and white have special magical significance.  If an item or a potion is colored white, it usually means that it provides a powerful beneficial effect without any sort of negative side effect.  If it is black, it provides the most powerful of effects, but with some sort of unpleasant side effect.  Be careful!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:618
msgid ""
"Everyone has heard of Abdul's chain of discount stores.  Well, he also has an island resort where the old and tired can be rejuvenated for a hefty fee.  They say that Abdul himself lives on his resort Island and rarely visits the mainland."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:619
msgid ""
"Druidic orders flourish in the grasslands near Silver Cove.  These druids will often arrange stone circles to perform ceremonies or worship nature."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:62
msgid "Group 9"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:620
msgid ""
"The mountains that make up the gap that leads to Paradise Valley are called the Sentinels.  Folk tales suggest they protected the valley from evil; now they serve as a warning to anyone foolish enough to want to enter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:621 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:651
msgid ""
"There are many islands that can only be reached with a combination of boat travel and the Walk on Water spell.  Many of them are inhabited by the most horrible of monsters, but often the finest treasures can be found on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:622
msgid ""
"Travel by boat isn't instantaneous; it takes time.  Don't forget to factor in your travel times if you're running on a deadline."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:623
msgid ""
"There once was a temple built by Lord Stone in the city of Free Haven, but it was burned down by vandals a few years ago.  The quality of the altar there was so good that it permitted the priests to raise anyone from the dead, even eradicated bodies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:624
msgid ""
"A low level body spell, First Aid is very efficient in terms of its casting cost, but slow.  If you have plenty of time, it's the best way to heal damage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:625
msgid ""
"The pinnacle of light spells, Divine Intervention does just that– calls for Eyla, goddess of healing, to intercede on your behalf and heal your group to full life.  Her price, a part of your life-force causing you to age a few years, is sometimes well worth her attention."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:626
msgid ""
"Training centers are the best way to increase your level, but they can get awfully expensive later on.  Personally, I recommend Abdul's Discount Training centers to avoid excessive training costs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:627
msgid ""
"No teacher in the world can equal the Oracle in Free Haven.  The only catch is that to visit the Oracle, you need to have the unanimous approval of the High Council."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:628
msgid ""
"One advantage of the sword and the dagger is that skilled users can wield a blade in their left hands instead of using a shield.  Even a fluff head like yourself should understand why that could help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:629
msgid ""
"I know how easy it is for us warriors to scoff at the weak mages out there, but they can make themselves useful at times.  Many of their spells can increase your fighting ability by making you faster, or hit better, or more resistant to damage.  As long as they can pull their own weight, mages make excellent travelling companions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:63 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:64
msgid "So you are the new Lords of Harmondale?  How may I serve you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:630
msgid ""
"Travelling spells represent the most important class of spells for all magic-using people.  Not only do they let you get to places you couldn't get to without  magic, but they let you visit things like health and magic-boosting fountains in remote areas, and use those abilities in dangerous dungeons and castles where you need them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:631
msgid ""
"Agar's 'finest' creations, these floating heads have surprising intelligence and great power at their command.  Their gaze is enough to put you to sleep.  Rumors abound of even more powerful eyes that can cause panic or even complete insanity."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:632
msgid ""
"A few Guilds of the Self exist in the lands.  Combining knowledge of mind, spirit, and body, these guilds offer a more generalized study than any of the individual guilds can offer.  Their knowledge of the individual schools isn't nearly as complete, however."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:633
msgid ""
"Don't let the name fool you:  Abdul's Discount stores offer really great quality for low, low prices.  He also didn't pay me to say that on Thursdays.  Honest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:634
msgid ""
"In the north, businesses are controlled by a few monopolies that prevent competition by any means necessary, even by extortion.  The Shadow Guild and the Thieves' Guild have already started to clash over rights in areas like Silver Cove and Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:635
msgid ""
"Take my word for it when I say the Mire is a bad place to find yourself at night.  The Necromancer's Guild 'retired' to the swamp after Archibald's defeat in the Succession War, and evidence of their handiwork is walking around the swamp freely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:636
msgid ""
"You can avoid a lengthy jail sentence for any crimes you've been committing by receiving forgiveness at the temples.  If you run into a guard before receiving forgiveness for significant crimes, you could be looking at a year in jail, or even longer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:637
msgid ""
"Many monsters won't reason with you, no matter how eloquently you phrase your requests.  You need to recognize hopelessly aggressive monsters and be rid of them as fast as possible."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:638
msgid ""
"Many people don't really care for tinkers because we wander and do odd jobs that guilds would like to charge a lot for.  But you like me, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:639
msgid ""
"With all the troubles that have been going on, business has been great for me.  People have found the need to lock up their possessions to try and protect them from marauders or looters.  It's good to know I can give people at least a small sense of security in these dark times."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:640
msgid ""
"I bought a treasure map from this treasure map salesman I met awhile ago and it says the dread pirate captain Silveka buried his treasure under a tree on one of the  islands east of Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:641
msgid ""
"Loretta is my kind of person.  She makes her own luck, and it's almost always good.  She's got confidence, and that's something you can't just buy.  I'm sure that's the reason she's so successful: a confident, positive outlook."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:642
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've seen the obelisks scattered around the Kingdom.  They say there's a riddle in them just waiting to be solved that shows where to find a great horde of buried treasure.  No one's ever done it, though.  At least, no one I've ever heard of."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:643
msgid ""
"Aye, I've worked in Osric's army before, tending camp and preparing food and cataloguing supplies.  He's a fair man, and an excellent leader.  He knows how to keep his troops motivated, let me tell you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:644
msgid ""
"There are only three certainties in life:  The first is death.  The second is taxes.  And the third is the fact that you'll hear that joke sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:645
msgid ""
"Banks are a safe place to store money.  Unless you personally own a secure, guarded vault, your best bet is to put your money in a bank.  You don't collect interest on your money, but because the banks don't lend out money, you don't have to worry about losing it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:646
msgid ""
"One of the few exports the Islands of Regna have going for them, besides piracy, is sugar, cocoa, and cinnamon.  If it weren't for those, I'd say we should ship the Temple of Baa over to Regna and let them sink all those islands!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:647
msgid ""
"Different inns charge different amounts for the food they sell, but don't be fooled.  The more expensive food will generally last longer than the cheaper stuff.  It's important to have food that will last when you plan to be out for long periods of time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:648
msgid ""
"I can't say I know much about travel over water, but from what I've heard, you can either take a ship to the islands, or Walk on Water to get there.  Ships all have complicated itineraries– be sure to ask the shipping company before you book passage when they do return voyages!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:649
msgid ""
"It's a shame that Catherine was pulled away to her father's funeral so soon after Roland's death.  That poor woman has suffered too many tragedies too soon.  It's even sadder that she's leaving Nicolai here while she's gone.  He's too young to have to deal with all of this on top of the crises affecting the kingdom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:65
msgid "Come to study with us under the Masters?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:650
msgid ""
"The Necromancer's Guild first appeared publicly during Archibald's brief reign 10 years ago.  They were around before that, but they kept themselves secret, knowing people wouldn't appreciate them.  When Roland became king, he outlawed the guild and ordered the leaders arrested.  None of them stayed around long enough for that, though, and now they're nowhere to be found."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:652
msgid ""
"Dragons are not only adept combatants, they are wily spell casters.  Few people appreciate the dragons' grasp of magic, and many cocky warriors find themselves unprepared for the dragons' true power."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:653
msgid ""
"Erathia is out of even Town Portal's long range.  That continent is a full six week's worth of sea travel away.  There are a lot of islands and sub-continents between here and there, all of them filled with petty kingdoms and tribes looking to rob travelers of their valuables, their freedom, or their lives."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:654
msgid ""
"I've seen a few devils in my travels, and they are fierce to behold.  I've had to rescue a few people from devil attacks, and I  was amazed at their coordination and prowess in combat.  They must have excellent training to be that proficient."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:655
msgid ""
"I fear the Night of Shooting Stars was an omen of the worst kind.  It didn't take long for our good king to disappear after that night, and for the Temple of Baa to arrive, did it?  And all this talk about devils in the west…these are evil omens indeed!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:656
msgid ""
"Once I was hired by a noble to entertain him and his wife on Star Lake, playing music while they picnicked in a boat. When we approached the south end of the island at the center of the lake, we saw the most hideous beast– a woman with snakes for hair– on the shore of the island.  She took one look at my noble benefactors and they turned to stone before my eyes.  It was all I could do to row away before I joined them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:657
msgid ""
"Flight spells provide a way to get past mountains and walls and other such obstacles.  There is a limit on how high you can fly with the Fly spell, though.  Some peaks rise too high to pass with magical flying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:658
msgid ""
"Hareck IX has got to be the best leader in the world.  Not only is he the only Emperor in the world, he's the only leader I've ever heard of that does common work like the rest of his people.  Like when there's taxes to be collected on shipping, Hareck's right there with the rest of us.  Boarding, fighting, cursing, drinking, whatever.  Hareck's a real down to earth kind of Emperor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:659
msgid ""
"Every squire knows that a weapon is of no use broken.  Every warrior should know how to repair his own equipment, or be at the whim of the smiths' schedules.  Knowing how to repair your weapon is part of mastering your weapon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:66
msgid "Welcome to the capitol of Steadwick! 'Ware the griffins!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:660
msgid ""
"Of all the malicious mischief makers in the world, Necromancers are by far the worst.  Their 'science' is very new, and they know just enough to get themselves and the rest of the world in trouble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:661
msgid ""
"Resting revives your body and mind.  Camping gives you a chance to relax, talk, celebrate– to just unwind a little and rest off some of the stress and worry of the remainder of the day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:662
msgid ""
"A wise negotiator once said, 'On whether 'tis better to be loved or to be feared, choose both.  But if a choice between the two must be made, choose fear.'– Words to live by, my friend.  Words to live by."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:663
msgid ""
"Up north, it's not uncommon for wealthy businessmen to preserve their position in the market by hiring thugs to trim their competition.  Trade wars can become quite literally wars.  It's best to not get involved in any merchant disputes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:664
msgid ""
"Some of the best perception and lock-picking teachers hang out in Thieves' Guilds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:665
msgid ""
"Even if King Roland did something bad to cause heaven to abandon him, I don't suppose that his son Nicolai deserves it.  After all, he's only ten years old.  Maybe heaven will smile upon him and give him heaven's mandate to rule wisely.  That would be nice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:666
msgid ""
"I can't leave the towns and castles without some bandit taking away what little money I actually manage to save.  Why can't the guards do something about all the brigands?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:667
msgid ""
"Indigo from Regna was cut off a decade ago when the king outlawed trade with that pirate kingdom.  I can understand why he did that, but I sure am tired of the indigo shortage.  I can't dye anything blue or purple!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:668
msgid ""
"What do you want from me?  I'm just a worker; I'm not here to amuse you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:669
msgid ""
"It sure has been raining a lot, lately.  It would be terrible if the clouds ran out of rain and the rivers ran dry because all the water had been used up during these storms.  If the rivers all ran dry, I'd be ruined!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:67
msgid "You are welcome in Pierpont, the Elven capitol."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:670
msgid ""
"Chests and boxes aren't the only things that can hold treasure.  Barrels can also hold valuables, so don't forget to search them, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:671
msgid ""
"Shipping has slowed from Erathia, which is where I get all the paints I need for my work.  That's the land the queen comes from.  I wonder if there's a problem over there?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:672
msgid ""
"I don't know who makes them, but every Baa priest has a cloak with the symbol of Baa on it.  I wish I had the job of making all those cloaks, I'd be rich!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:673
msgid ""
"History is the sound of soft-soled slippers going down the stairs while hobnail boots climb up the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:674
msgid ""
"I sure wish I could learn to do something other than dig ditches, but I'm just not bright enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:675
msgid ""
"Flour's been going bad early this year, even though it's properly stored in sealed containers.  I wonder what's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:676
msgid ""
"Don't forget that you can store things in cabinets.  Chests aren't the only places to keep your treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:677
msgid ""
"The roads of Enroth are made of flagstones from the hills near Kriegspire.  They were placed long ago by the people who first settled Enroth, and those first roads have never eroded or decayed in any way.  Very odd."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:678
msgid "What do you call a jittery sorceress? A twitch!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:679
msgid ""
"Dark days are upon us, mark my words!  Never have I seen so many monsters and so little game."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:68
msgid "Greetings!  Head up the stairs to Pierpont and enjoy!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:680
msgid ""
"Nothing is worse than trying to beg near Silver Cove.  All the people there are so greedy!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:681
msgid ""
"The Shadow Guild is the best place to find a buyer willing to take stolen cattle.  There's nothing they won't do!  They're great, AND they charge less than the regular Thieves' Guild.  You gotta try them out!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:682
msgid ""
"With the lack of animals and all the problems lately, I should probably just become a bounty hunter.  I could probably make a fortune tracking down all the lawbreakers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:683
msgid ""
"The most demanding master to have to work for is Osric Temper.  No one else shouts as much, or talks as quickly during a dictation.  I will say this though– of all the Lords, he is the only that seems to be on top of the devil situation we all know is so serious.  Unpleasant to work for to be sure, but he has the interests of the kingdom at heart."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:684
msgid ""
"Have you spoken with Baa today?  Let me help you come to grips with your problems and show you a better way; it will only take a little of your time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:685
msgid ""
"A lot of people complain about taxes, but I just want to say I like them.  How could clerk's offices function without tax money?  How would people get permits and licenses without us?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:686
msgid ""
"The towers outside the towns shoot at flying creatures that we'd normally have a difficult time handling."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:687
msgid ""
"Most people don't have confidence in Nicolai.  I'll bet you 3 to 1 odds that he gets thrown out before his next birthday.  What'd ya say?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:688
msgid ""
"I do hope that the queen returns from her trip to her homeland soon.  Even if she is a foreign queen she will supply some semblance of order to our besieged kingdom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:689
msgid ""
"No one knows where the Supreme Temple of Baa is, but I've heard only full-fledged priests and high temple officials are allowed to visit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:69
msgid "Beware the Walking Dead in the region!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:690
msgid "Do goblins have names?  Or families?  Why are they evil?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:691
msgid ""
"The best all around weapon shop in Enroth is the Knight's Paradise, run by Eric Regent.  You can't buy better weapons anywhere else in the kingdom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:692
msgid ""
"You know, metal for arms and armor used to be a lot cheaper before Snergle wrested the dwarven throne away from Rocklin, the old King of the Dwarves.  Sure would be nice if someone fixed Snergle's wagon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:693
msgid ""
"Once you are a member of a particular type of magic guild, you won't need to keep buying membership into different branches of the same guild.  A member of the Guild of Fire, for instance, need not buy membership in another Fire Guild in order to take advantage of their services."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:694
msgid ""
"Albert Newton is the Lord of Mist, and he is truly the patron of all who hold dear the mystical arts.  If you have a question about magic, Mist is where you should look for an answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:695
msgid ""
"Beware travel in the swamps south of Castle Temper.  The undead are said to roam about freely, unafraid of the living or the sun."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:696
msgid ""
"I never seen one, but I've heard stories of magical portals– doorways– that lead instantly from one part of Enroth to another.  That would take all the fun out of travelling, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:697
msgid ""
"Aptly named, Dragonsand is full of both dragons and sand.  I think the most powerful dragons are more than a match for the devils, or the devils would have long ago taken over the desert."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:698 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:728
msgid ""
"It is said that one of the islands east of Free Haven hides the buried treasure of Silveka the pirate.  Now, I know these stories are a dime dozen, but I swear this one is true!  If only the map could be found…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:699
msgid ""
"The Isle of the Hermit is a fairly large volcanic isle in the southwest of Enroth. No one goes there and it's more barren than even the wastelands.  It was named when Lord Terrance made a joke about a hermit living there to get away from it all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:7
msgid "Argh!  Either get in the fight, or get out of our way!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:70
msgid "Yer welcome here I think…then again…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:700
msgid ""
"All of the Necromancers in the Kingdom have been banished, happily, except the ones who took their black art too far and became liches.     The worst of those liches, Archibald's former general Lord Corlagon, has taken up residence in the south eastern portion of the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:701
msgid ""
"It IS possible to combine compound potions with simple or compound potions to try and make complex potions.  Though complex potions are the strongest you can make, the process is dangerous.  Mixing the wrong potions can cause violent reactions and set off dangerous explosions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:702
msgid ""
"I know only one formula for a complex potion– the combination of a compound potion with either a simple or compound potion.  Mix a potion of resistance with a potion of cure poison, then take that potion and mix it with a potion of protection, and you end up with a potion of divine cure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:703
msgid ""
"Thief and Mercenary Guilds are the places you go to learn all kinds of skills.  Different guilds teach different skills, so if one doesn't have what you're looking for, try the guilds in a different town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:704
msgid ""
"Quests aren't anything magical, they're simply opportunities...  Opportunities to learn a great deal or to make a great deal of money.  Try not to pass up the chances you get."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:705
msgid ""
"Try to equip everyone in your group with a bow, crossbow, or some other ranged weapon.  You can do a lot of damage to an opponent as they approach you, and ranged weapons let you attack flying creatures that otherwise couldn't be hurt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:706
msgid ""
"Most warriors like to train in a variety of weapons.  Usually, one weapon is trained higher than the others, but few are ignored.  This provides great flexibility in combat, because you can use the weapon that is most effective against the enemy you face."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:707
msgid ""
"Some monsters are resistant to nearly all magic spells.  If you run into one of these monsters, don't despair– use your magic to heal your warriors and strengthen their blows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:708
msgid ""
"Albert Newton is a brilliant magical researcher, but his research always seems to take a long time to complete.  He certainly knows quite a bit about sorcerers and their magics, however.  If you have any questions about that, he's the person to talk to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:709
msgid ""
"I've heard tales of a powerful magical staff that boosts your magical reserves and can strike as swiftly as the wind itself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:71
msgid "Come to learn from the best Wizards in Erathia?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:710
msgid ""
"General stores will buy  nearly anything, but give terrible prices.  If a general store is the only store around and you need to sell something fast, go ahead and use it.  But if it can wait, you'll do better selling something to a more specific store."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:711
msgid ""
"Not all shops are the same!  Some stores offer lowly goods, while shops in other towns have excellent wares for sale.  You'll need to look around and find the good shops for yourself, but keep in mind:  You get what you pay for.  Great equipment never comes cheap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:712
msgid ""
"This foul place is the center of the most serious crimes against nature the Necromancer's Guild has been committing.  My firm scout's advice is to avoid, avoid, avoid!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:713
msgid ""
"City councils are always looking for people to take care of local jobs for them.  If you need a little extra cash, try dropping by and asking about work.  There's a good chance they'll have something for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:714
msgid ""
"Your reputation affects how people deal with you.  Most people aren't going to trust you or confide in you if your reputation isn't good.  You'll only find friends from thieves and the like, and do you really want them as friends?  You'll need to help others and follow the laws to bolster your reputation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:715
msgid "Try to stay close to chimney sweeps– they're good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:716
msgid ""
"Apparently there's a new Thieves' Guild called the Shadow Guild that's competing with the established guilds across the lands."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:717
msgid ""
"I just bought the deed to a bridge spanning the White Forest River.  It's a toll bridge!  Soon I'll be rich as my professional bridge managers make money from the tolls they charge and put it in my bank account!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:718
msgid ""
"I can never get work in Castle Ironfist.  I don't understand why.  It's almost as though they don't want people crawling around the castle.  Are they hiding something?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:719
msgid ""
"I travel with all kinds of people, carrying heavy loads from one place to the other.  I tell you though, unless you're powerful, your load will be lightened for you by all the bandits on the roads.  Stay off the roads between cities if you know what's good for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:72
msgid "Greetings.  Lots of golems around these days!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:720
msgid ""
"Many inns are scattered across Enroth, and I believe there are even a few that eke out a meager existence in the western reaches.  These provide the easiest way to get food and the safest rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:721
msgid ""
"Ever notice how the cost of Resurrection at a temple is exactly equal to all the gold you had with you when you died?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:722
msgid ""
"If you find a great piece of equipment for a low price, by all means buy it.  You'll be able to sell it later for a profit, and maybe even get some use out of it until then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:723
msgid ""
"I've cooked a lot of fish in my day, but never have I cooked one of the deadly eels that infest the waters north of Silver Cove.  I'd love a chance to do it, but not many people tangle with the eels and live.  But, oh, for a taste!  They say the eels are the best delicacy the world has to offer!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:724
msgid ""
"Never run out of food!  You don't gain any benefit from rest when you have no food, and it's very easy to starve to death in the wilderness if you have no food."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:725
msgid ""
"Somewhere out there is a set of horseshoes that protect your horses' hooves perfectly, and never lets them get tired!  The places you could go if you had horses with those qualities!  Oh, well.  It's just a legend, most likely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:726
msgid ""
"Soon after Archibald's defeat, I was able to peek into the Royal Library after one of my many performances at Castle Ironfist.  Inside, I saw a statue of Archibald in magnificent detail.  He must have had the statue made when he thought he was going to win his insurrection, and Roland's kept it as some sort of memento."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:727
msgid ""
"Every spell caster knows, or should know, that certain spells and magical effects occur around dawn and dusk.  For instance, no Divine Intervention is possible at any other time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:729
msgid ""
"The old Dragon Towers were built to protect the towns from flying creatures, but they'll shoot down anything within their range that's flying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:73
msgid "Study with the best and visit all the buildings here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:730
msgid ""
"Though the Church of the Moon celebrated the darker side of human nature, it is not to say that good could not come of their evil, just as evil came of the Church of the Sun's good.  During their heyday, the Church managed to create artifacts of great power– the Doomsday Cloaks.  If you ever find one, don't throw it away!  They're all very powerful and valuable."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:731
msgid ""
"A great spell when running errands, Lloyd's Beacon allows you to set up beacons that you can teleport back to.  Though the beacons don't last forever, with proper planning they last long enough to get the job done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:732
msgid ""
"Making a healing potion is a simple matter, if you have ingredients.  All you need are widoweeps berries and a flask with water.  Just mix the berries with the water, and…Voila!  Instant healing potion!  If you don't have any water handy, you can just eat the berries directly, but the effect isn't as strong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:733
msgid ""
"Sweet Water was an excellent venue for my music before the Night of Shooting Stars.  Now the road to that town is infested with devils, and they say the town is no more."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:734
msgid ""
"The Isle of the Hermit, named by Lord Terrance for its remoteness, is difficult to travel to because of the turbulent waters south of Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:735
msgid ""
"Lots of people would like to invade Regna and take her spices, her metal, and her treasures.  The only thing that's kept Regna free all these years is her attention to metal smithing science and her arms sales to all the countries of the world.  Everyone criticizes Regna for that, but everyone buys Regnan weapons.  Talkin' outta both sides of their mouth, that's what those hypocrites do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:736
msgid ""
"I wish I could have been part of Roland's expedition!  There's true bravery– how glorious that troop must have looked, armor and weapons gleaming in the sun.  Better to die valiantly in the battlefield with your lord, then to expire in the night, cold and alone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:737
msgid ""
"Astrology is often sneered at, but I tell you it's very real and important.  The most significant astrological event recently was that shooting star that fell from the sky out of Sagittarius.  It portends upheaval, disaster, and opportunity for the entire world."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:738
msgid ""
"Merchants in the northeast aren't above hiring people to make sure that their competition isn't too competitive.  We try to avoid those areas and not get involved with any of the local petty struggles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:739
msgid ""
"Listen to the way a person greets you to get an idea how to deal with them, should they prove uncooperative.  You'll find that many people that share similar interests and professions will have the same attitude toward your choice of begging, bribing, or threatening them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:74
msgid "Tranquility and rest await you here in Celeste."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:740
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone I told you this, but Roland isn't dead.  He simply needed a vacation from all of the pressures of being king, and he's hiding away on Abdul's Resort Isle under a false name."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:741
msgid ""
"To keep people like me away from their things, people will often trap their chests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:742
msgid ""
"Weather sure has been strange lately.  Why, last June it snowed!  Snow in June, who'd ever have guessed?  It is an ill omen, snow in summertime."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:743
msgid ""
"Despite all of my problems, at least the Temple of Baa cares about me and helps me out.  Not like the government we have now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:744
msgid ""
"Boots are the cobbler's domain, and I don't know much about them, but I will say that you shouldn't overlook their usefulness.  They can go a long way to adding to your overall personal protection in battle.  Everyone should wear boots."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:745
msgid ""
"I imagine much of my work in the near future will be digging the graves of the people killed by the devils."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:746
msgid ""
"I can't even begin to tell you how awful produce prices have been in the market, recently.  I think someone's artificially fixing the prices low!  If this goes on much longer I'll be ruined!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:747
msgid ""
"Be careful drinking liquids left in barrels; you never know how long it's been sitting there.  You could get sick doing something like that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:748
msgid ""
"The wheel spins in the most fascinating ways.  Sometimes I think that if everyone would take a little time out and watch the wheel spin, they would calm down, and be less likely to fight with one another.  But no one will listen to me.  I'm just a lowly potter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:749
msgid ""
"It's one thing to make the clothes, but the beauty usually comes from dying the clothes in interesting colors."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:75
msgid "Welcome!  Be sure you don’t have a \"falling out\" while you here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:750
msgid ""
"The fact that our king is missing is awful, but it must be the will of the gods.  How could anything happen that isn't the will of the gods?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:751
msgid ""
"Lord Temper won't even allow me to become a knight.  He said I wasn't smart enough to follow directions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:752
msgid ""
"Mice and rats are a relentless plague upon mankind!  I hear that a keep near New Sorpigal has the biggest rats in the world living in it.  <shuddering>  May I never see such horrors as long as I live!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:753
msgid ""
"With all of Blackwoode now destroyed, wood is going to be very scarce in Enroth.  We might see another Timber War starting soon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:754
msgid ""
"The Tomb of Ethric the Mad is a wonder of fine stone cutting.  My grandfather helped build it.  He says there are some very cleverly concealed secret doors in the Tomb.  Why Ethric would care if a door was secret or not is beyond me, but hey– he was both rich and mad.  I guess he could do what he liked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:755
msgid ""
"Why is it goblins have no luck raising chickens? They plant the eggs too deep!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:756
msgid ""
"The one thing you can say's been good these days is the cold weather.  All the animals have really thick, valuable fur.  Only trouble is finding them.  Monsters been eating most of the good fur animals, I think."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:757
msgid ""
"Just between you and me, I saw a werewolf when I was a werewolf in Blackshire!  I believe all the rumors about their curse."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:758
msgid ""
"When cattle rustling gets too hard, I usually spend my time hunting on some Lord's land.  Since most people are afraid to hunt there, those forests haven't been over-hunted.  Recently, though, the animals have been getting scarce.  Could have something to do with the western blight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:759
msgid ""
"In some places it is difficult to hunt for game.  You need to pack more food when you travel in swamps or deserts or snow, for example."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:76
msgid "Welcome to the Pit!  Who says being dead is bad?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:760
msgid ""
"Wilbur Humphrey has hired me several times to take notes on disaster reports filtering in from around the kingdom.  I think there's been a sharp increase in calamities since the disappearance of the king."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:761
msgid ""
"The prince is far too young to manage a kingdom.  Wilbur Humphrey should be ruling the kingdom for himself, not in the name of a child."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:762
msgid ""
"If you ever find yourself in need of work, just stop by the city council's office in one of the large towns.  There's usually a job that needs doing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:763
msgid ""
"The rumors of the dynasty collapsing and all the disasters have brought out the worst in humanity.  I need to be even more vigilant than normal to keep the peace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:764
msgid ""
"Take it from me, if you want a lucky charm, hang around a chimney sweep.  Sure, their banter can be annoying, but they're the luckiest people I know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:765
msgid ""
"I have heard rumors that the recent 'winter during summer' spectacles have been caused by mischievous sorcerers who have learned to meddle with the weather.  I think it's part of a plot to create mass hysteria and open rebellion against the King."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:766
msgid ""
"The devils people are talking about causing havoc in the west are just misunderstood.  Baa says that they are our friends.  You just have to be respectful and run from them if you see them coming.  They need a lot of personal space, and get angry if they don't get it.  But that's only because they are superior beings.  If we were superior, all this would be easier to understand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:767
msgid ""
"I'd love to sail the oceans on a big ship.  I could travel to all the islands and just be free of school and chores and my parents.  That would be wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:768
msgid ""
"Word is that the goblins are looking to buy weapons for raids on human towns.  I hear the regent has a sizeable bounty on the heads of any who deliver weapons to those evil little toads."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:769
msgid ""
"Most any dragon that has a lair is absolutely loaded with gold.  They get it from all the paladins who try to kill them to make a name for themselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:77
msgid "The Pit is the only place I know of that lets us live in peace!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:770
msgid ""
"Some of the magic items you find around the world are cursed.  Almost none are pure curses, but many have side effects you won't like much.  You should carefully weigh the side effects against the benefits an item offers before using it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:771
msgid ""
"Of course you know that spells cast at high noon draw their power directly from the sun.  It is in this way that the mightiest of magicians can afford the power it takes to enchant the magical items you find throughout the land of Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:772
msgid ""
"The desert is a land that should be avoided by all but the mightiest sorcerers and knights.  Filled with giants and dragons, nearly all who visit do not return.  Rumor has it that a strange pyramid in the desert holds untold riches and secrets waiting to be unearthed by some brave souls."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:773
msgid ""
"The pass leading to White Cap and Caste Stromgard has recently been taken by a group of ogres and greedy humans working together."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:774
msgid ""
"I've heard stories of a horrible curse that has possessed the town. Every time I've visited, however, everything seems normal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:775 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:805
msgid ""
"Although no shipping companies are currently offering the service, Erathia, homeland of Queen Catherine Ironfist, can be reached in a voyage of three weeks or so, depending on the season.  Ain't never been there, but they tell me it's nice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:776
msgid ""
"Water walking is nice and all, but it doesn't beat a good ship and a good crew.  Not only are you slower than a ship, you have to worry about the spell wearing off, and you have to worry about sea serpent attacks.  Boats are the best way to travel by water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:777
msgid ""
"Resting only really works well in a comfortable place like an inn.  There you can regain lost strength and magic, and heal from most of your wounds.  If you must rest in the wilderness, be sure to have enough food!  Hungry people gain no benefit from rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:778
msgid ""
"Though not as effective as other healing spells, Healing Touch is in the school of spirit, which makes it easier for paladins to learn.  Also, body spells don't work in certain areas, so you will need to use Healing Touch instead of spells like First Aid or Power Cure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:779
msgid ""
"Shared Life is an excellent way to keep weaker party members alive when your party is being assaulted with area affect spells.  This spell combined with Power Cure can keep everyone alive when you get in over your head."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:78
msgid "Greetings! Necromancy is evil?  It’s a relative, don’t you think?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:780
msgid ""
"Many teachers do not want to be flooded by students, so they have moved to remote locations.  You might have to look around quite a bit to find them.  Generally, expert teachers know where their master teachers are."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:781
msgid ""
"Fame, in many ways, is an accumulation of the experiences you have and how you've managed to share with others.  Quests and brave deeds against monsters can make you famous."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:782
msgid ""
"Personally, my favorite weapon is the mace.  When you get good at it, you learn to strike at hard parts on your opponent so that it bounces off instead of sinking in.  Saves time.  Anyway, when someone gets hit with a mace, it can stun them so bad that they stop fighting back.  And that's a fine thing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:783
msgid ""
"Never underestimate the staff!  Most people associate the staff with a mage, but that's not always the case.  Although you cannot use a shield with a staff, as you become more skilled you'll find that staves are the best defensive weapon around.  Not only that, but they have enough weight to stun people that are hit with it.  It's one of the best all around weapons available."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:784
msgid ""
"All of the schools of magic have eleven spells, but only ten can be found in the guilds of darkness.  The missing eleventh spell is called something like Dark Holding or Dark Containment.  No one alive seems to have learned it, and the guilds are very anxious to find it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:785
msgid ""
"Summoned by mages to guard areas or items, elementals are beings composed of one of the four primary elemental forces:  air, earth, fire, or water.  Elementals can freely use magics of their element, so be wary if you should battle them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:786
msgid ""
"Archibald, Roland's brother, mastered many magical arts and accomplished himself as a powerful sorcerer before his demise.  No one seems to know where he is buried, though.  It's as though he disappeared after Roland's ascension to the throne."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:787
msgid ""
"Skilled merchants run many of the stores in Enroth.  You must be careful when buying and selling to make sure you are not getting ripped off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:788
msgid ""
"It's dangerous to carry a lot of money with you.  Banks provide a safe place to store large amounts of money.  Though they don't credit you with interest, you don't have to worry about pickpockets.  That's good enough for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:789
msgid ""
"In the center of Dragonsand you can find a pyramid marking the Tomb of the Ship, or so they say.  I've scoured the desert and found nothing but dragons and titans to run from.  That doesn't mean it's not there– I had to get out of that desert while the getting was good.  A very dangerous place!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:79
msgid "Welcome to Mulder!  Enjoy your time with us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:790
msgid ""
"I do not like assassins, or men of low character.  And it seems that both types of criminal are spreading through the land like the plague these days."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:791
msgid ""
"Some creatures you'll run into can be reasoned with if you have a fear spell available.  You can avoid unnecessary and wasteful injury by scaring off your enemies rather than simply fighting with them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:792
msgid ""
"Sometimes bandits and highwaymen will accept you if they don't think you're 'upstanding citizens.'  The weak, however, are always robbed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:793
msgid ""
"You must be careful when opening some locks.  Many people don't consider a lock enough of a deterrent, so they will trap their doors or chests to try and frighten off or kill a would-be thief."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:794 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:819
msgid ""
"All of the really bad disasters started happening after the Night of the Shooting Stars two years ago.  Not much has gone right since then, except the Temple of Baa.  They really help people.  They also say that King Roland must have done something awful, 'cause the stars were avenging angels falling from Heaven to punish the wicked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:795
msgid ""
"Let me tell you a secret.  There is no such thing as luck.  You make your own luck based on your outlook.  If you expect the worst to happen, it probably will, and you'll have a horrible time.  If, however, you look on the bright side and expect the best, you'll usually find it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:796
msgid ""
"It's hard to travel through the snow.  Good thing you have people like me around!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:797
msgid ""
"Resting allows you to approach the new day with vigor and zest.  Resting will heal your wounds and recharge your magic.  Nothing finishes a hard day like a good camp, good dinner, and a good fire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:798
msgid ""
"Ever fantasize about discovering a huge horde of treasure?  I do.  They say there are three really big ones:  The first is the knowledge contained in the Royal Library.  The second is the treasure the obelisks lead to.  And the third is in Loretta Fleise's basement!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:799
msgid ""
"I'm not sure the towns to the west even exist anymore.  Merchants don't travel to there, and no one has come back from those areas yet.  I believe civilization ends at Blackshire, and even the people there are strange at times."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:8
msgid ""
"Someone should clear out the caves that the dire wolves use for their lair.  If we had one less thing to worry about, things might get a little better!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:80
msgid "Have you journeyed far?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:800
msgid ""
"It may not seem like a big deal, but I like to supplement my cooking with fresh fruit.  You can find it most places just growing on trees, if you look.  Fruit trees have helped me out when I was hungry and had no money, and they could help you, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:801
msgid ""
"I believe there is a spell that will allow you to create food for yourself out of thin air, but I can't imagine food made from magic tasting very good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:802
msgid ""
"I don't suppose you've got any news of Sweet Water, do you?  No one I know has heard anything about the town for a year!  They're a long ways off from here…but a year?  Something must be wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:803
msgid ""
"I wonder about the council sometimes.  The decisions they've made and some of the laws they've stalled on have really contributed to the chaos around here.  They've stalled any official investigation of Roland's death, and I don't understand why."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:804
msgid ""
"Practicing meditation may not seem like a big deal at first, but it can be a source of tremendous magical energy to the skilled.  Meditation masters can have many times the spell casting power as their less enlightened brethren."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:806
msgid ""
"The next best thing to flying, if you fall off of a cliff or similar height; Feather Fall doesn't give you any control but it certainly keeps you alive."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:807
msgid ""
"The legend of the Crossing is more than a thousand years old, but that doesn't stop people from repeating it from time to time.  The legend says that we all, and that even includes the elves, the dwarfs, and the goblins, came from the same place on a great ship that carried us across the void between the stars."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:808
msgid ""
"I've heard portals exist that allow transit between two fixed places in Enroth.  Knowledge of these would provide another excellent and fast way to move around the world."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:809
msgid ""
"The gods oversee our lives and guide us constantly toward heaven and the light.  All you have to do is listen with your heart and do what it tells you to be admitted to heaven.  Have faith.  The gods will help you get there, if you'll listen to them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:81
msgid "Hello!  Did you come through the tunnels from Stone City?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:810
msgid ""
"They say the king was last seen fleeing toward Castle Kriegspire with an army of devils following him.  He never returned.  I think we may have to face up to the possibility that our good king was killed by those monsters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:811
msgid ""
"Teleportation is the way to go to minimize travel times.  Of course, you can move around pretty quickly by boat or by horse if you have a skilled person leading the way."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:812
msgid ""
"I came to Enroth during the time Regnans were invited by King Archibald to bring over a load of weapons to help in his fight against Roland.  When Archibald lost the war, Roland seized all the arms ships and forbade travel to Regna.  I've been stuck here ever since."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:813
msgid ""
"The simplest piece of a knight's equipment, the shield provides excellent defense for low hindrance and weight.  No warrior should be without a good shield in a fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:814
msgid ""
"The Witches' Assembly of 638 was the greatest gathering of sorcerers and alchemists ever.  Since then, the popularity of the magical arts has declined, and persecution of groups like ours…er, theirs– has grown quite a bit.  It really is quite awful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:815
msgid ""
"Merchants are businessmen first and foremost.  They will always try to buy low and sell high.  Don't be too upset with them; they need to make a living, too.  The way to get the best prices, both when buying and selling, is to try different markets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:816
msgid ""
"If you've determined that begging and bribing are of no use, and you simply must speak with a person, then the thinly veiled threat must be issued.  But remember to use this option sparingly, since only the best diplomats can stop the damage you'll do to your reputation if threats become your habit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:817
msgid ""
"Nicolai has commissioned a bridge to be built from New Sorpigal to Mist.  I'm working for him by offering affluent members of society a chance at charter membership of the Nicolai Ironfist Bridge Fellowship.  The basic membership gets your name on a flagstone of the bridge and costs 50,000 gold– a small price to pay for immortality.  Are you interested?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:818
msgid ""
"Fetzil, the Prince of Thieves lieutenant, is smart; he knows enough to hide out when things get hot.  He's not an easy person to catch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:82
msgid "Hello there?  Checked your purse lately? Let me check it for you…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:820
msgid ""
"I hate taxes!  Why should we pay taxes anyway?  It's bad enough I have to spend my life working for other people; I need to pay them for the 'honor'?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:821
msgid ""
"Cotton is found in Karigor, the island home of the Church of the Sun and the Church of the Moon.  It doesn't grow well anywhere else, and it's difficult to pick and seed, but it makes for wonderful soft clothes, if you can afford it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:822
msgid ""
"If I could actually use a weapon, I'd probably be better off joining a bandit group.  I bet they lead an easy life."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:823
msgid ""
"Sure's been hard to get help recently.  What is a good farmer to do if he can't find strong workers during harvest times?  Go into bankruptcy and ruin, that's what!  Oh, woe is me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:824
msgid ""
"I'd love to hear what the Oracle would say about the devils, the Temple of Baa, and Prince Nicolai.  Why won't the council consult the Oracle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:825
msgid ""
"Change is in the air and on the wind.  You can smell it and feel it.  Something big's going to happen soon.  I can always tell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:826
msgid ""
"Warm clothes won't help you resist the chill of Castle Darkmoor.  The undead there steal the warmth from your body with their touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:827
msgid ""
"The blight that's afflicting western crops and animals is slowly spreading east.  Cows are affected first, and this is causing a very serious leather shortage.  You can expect the price of boots and belts and other leather goods to be increasing!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:828
msgid ""
"This isn't the best job in the world, but at least the work is steady."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:829
msgid ""
"Taxes have been good under this King.  Archibald was terrible, much worse than his father.  I thought I would be ruined by Archibald's cruel taxes.  May he nor his like never hold the throne again!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:83
msgid "Some Wacko around here has the boat schedule, I'm sure!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:830
msgid ""
"Let me tell you, some bookshelves or desks or other furniture can be crafted to conceal a secret passage.  You can walk through a room and never realize there were two or three other hidden exits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:831
msgid ""
"If you ever take a trip near Star Lake, be sure to check out the beautiful statues on the island in the center of the lake.  They are so life-like they're breathtaking!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:832
msgid "What is big and red and eats rocks? A big red rock eater!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:833
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, the animals all started to go away when the stories of the devils in the West started cropping up.  Yep.  That's probably it.  Pesky critters!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:834
msgid "I'm so pitiful, the bandits that prowl the roads even laugh at me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:835
msgid ""
"If you think your reputation is getting too bad for people to tolerate you, you should check yourself into a temple and start donating, my friend.  The temple will spread word of your generosity far and wide, and people will think better of you for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:836
msgid ""
"If you're going to hunt anything, you'll need a bow.  I don't think you are fast enough to chase a deer down with your sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:837
msgid ""
"When I was much younger, I had a chance to see the ruined library of the Church of the Moon at Karigor.  It was made entirely of jade and marble, and once contained the wisdom of the ages within its hallowed halls. If ever you have a chance to visit, take it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:838
msgid ""
"The main Temple of Baa is just northwest of Blackshire.  Only members of Baa are allowed inside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:839
msgid ""
"The High Council isn't just an ordinary city council– they are the body that represents the lords of the land.  They vote on important matters of state that need to be taken before the king.  They also control access to the Oracle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:84
msgid "As a citizen of the city of Tidewater, I welcome you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:840
msgid ""
"It is important for guards to be patient.  We can't go out and look for trouble; we need to wait for trouble to find us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:841
msgid ""
"The poor queen has lost both her father and her husband.  Hopefully, nothing will happen to Nicolai."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:842
msgid ""
"I'm wondering if something foul indeed fell from the sky that Night two years ago.  I am not, however, of the opinion that it was an avenging angel!  More like a devil, if you ask me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:843
msgid "I'm fine!  Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:844
msgid ""
"Why do grown-ups always have to fight?  Why can't people just get along?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:845
msgid ""
"What're ya gallivanting' around here for on a Sunday?  It's a day of rest, kid, REST, I say!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:846
msgid ""
"There are two kinds of magic armor– armor that increases your protection, and armor that is lighter and easier to wear.  A few rare kinds of armor have both of those properties."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:847
msgid ""
"When a wand runs out of charges, you've lost the value of the wand.  They can never be recharged, but it's usually possible to find a sucker to buy the wand at full price  just before the charges run out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:848
msgid ""
"Combining potions in the right proportions can achieve formulas that do very unusual things.  The Guild of Alchemists closely guards the secrets of which potions have which effects."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:849
msgid ""
"I don't have much taste for civilization, but you can rest assured that more goods and services will be available on the east coast of Enroth than anywhere else– particularly Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:85
msgid "Greetings, heard any word of Regnan Pirates?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:850
msgid ""
"Horses provide an excellent means of travelling if you can afford the cost.  All of the towns and castles  on the mainland have stables where you can hire horses."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:851
msgid ""
"Mages are so lazy, they've formulated several spells to transport people instantly from place to place.  These spells are good, but there's nothing like a REAL journey."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:852 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:882
msgid ""
"I've heard there are sorcerers for hire who can cast the Walk on Water spell if you can't do it yourself.  They charge a lot, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:853
msgid ""
"You need to be careful when planning your boat travels.  Certain areas are too dangerous to sail to during parts of the year."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:854
msgid ""
"It is important to get treatment for diseases and poisons.  The longer they go untreated, the harder they are to cure.  Getting poisoned or diseased more than once worsens your situation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:855
msgid ""
"The highest level spell in the school of body, Power Cure is an effective way to heal the entire party quickly.  One Power Cure heals more damage faster than 4 smaller healing spells."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:856
msgid ""
"You generally have more hit points than spell points, so it is often faster to heal yourself as best as possible with magic, then rest.  You can cut down on your resting times quite a bit this way."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:857
msgid ""
"As your level of experience increases, so does the amount of experience you need to improve.  You'll get more benefit from a magical effect or reward that increases your level directly later in your life because of this rule."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:858
msgid ""
"Prince Nicolai shows incredible perception and creativity for his young age, much like his father did.  I don't think people give him enough credit– they're more concerned with his age than his ability."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:859
msgid ""
"It pays to know how to use two or three different kinds of weapons, kid.  That way you can change tactics in battle if an opponent isn't getting hurt by your favorite fish gutter, if ya know what I mean!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:86
msgid ""
"I heard there was a gate built to the Ancients!  I wonder what they look like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:860
msgid ""
"Osric is not only a master warrior, but an ingenious general.  I'm glad to see that he's not taking the recent attacks by the devils lightly.  He's already working on ways to fight back, but the situation looks pretty grim.  If anyone can come up with a way to fight them, however, it's Osric."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:861
msgid ""
"If you're facing an opponent that can't be put down with direct damage spells, try a mental attack spell, or something that freezes them in place.  This can often give the warriors in your group time to pound the enemy into the ground while distracted by your spell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:862
msgid ""
"Gharik attempted to recreate some of the weapons from the Time of Wonders in his forge.  He was never successful, but a number of his experiments provided useful information for enchanting weapons and summoning creatures."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:863
msgid ""
"A few Guilds of the Elements exist.  Though their knowledge of the individual elements isn't as pervasive as the more specialized guilds, they are an excellent resource to broaden your knowledge of all the elements."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:864
msgid ""
"The essence of life!  Gold oils the squeaking wheel, silences the witness, or loosens his tongue.  Gold puts food on the table and wood in the fire.  How I love thee, O mighty gold.  Never run out of gold, my friend.  Never!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:865
msgid ""
"The most important part of being a merchant can't be taught.  You need to learn to notice a good buy when you see one, and make the good deals when you can.  If you pick up something for cheap in one town, there's a good chance you can sell it somewhere else for a profit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:866
msgid ""
"I traveled to the lands west of Blackshire recently, and what I saw chilled my blood.  Devils running about a ruined, blighted landscape, killing any humans they ran across.  Something is terribly wrong.  I just don't know why someone isn't doing something about it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:867
msgid ""
"Compared to many countries, Enroth is a very tolerant kingdom.  Nonetheless, you can end up in jail if you commit enough crimes and are foolish enough to show your face to a guard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:868
msgid ""
"Diplomacy is the key to negotiation, and negotiation is the key to many closed doors in the world.  You must be able to sip champagne with the highest lords and guzzle ale with the lowest scum if you want to succeed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:869
msgid "Find a penny, pick it up, all the day you'll have good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:87
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors of goblins and undead armed with ancient weapons threatening to conquer Erathia!  How dreadful!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:870
msgid ""
"Most of the great treasure you'll find will be locked away in a chest or box.  It only makes sense to protect your valuables."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:871
msgid ""
"It is better to talk and let them think you a fool than to keep silent and prove it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:872
msgid ""
"Poor Eric's temper matches the weather in his kingdom.  Seeing a smile on his face is about as rare as seeing the sun in White Cap.  He's got the wrong way of looking at things, ol' Eric does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:873
msgid ""
"Lady Fleise is the most difficult mistress to work for in all Enroth, you can be sure of that!  Penny pinching, heart of stone she has!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:874
msgid ""
"Different terrains are easier to forage and hunt in.  You don't need to use quite as much food in grasslands, for example, as you do in the desert.  Keep this in mind when you choose a place to camp."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:875
msgid ""
"Times are tough, and the banks have stopped giving interest payments on deposits recently.  Don't expect anything but security when you put your money in the bank– interest is a thing of the past!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:876
msgid ""
"Loretta's managed to make money by creating and exploiting her lead position in the shipping industry.  She's able to manipulate shipping prices all over the kingdom which brings in quite a bit of money.  I only wish I handled her accounts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:877
msgid ""
"Better and fresher food that keeps longer is also more expensive.  People out west have figured out the trick of making food that keeps for a long time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:878
msgid ""
"Herbs can be used to create magical potions.  I don't know the procedure, but I know it's possible.  I wonder how those taste?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:879
msgid ""
"Although it can be expensive, travel using the stables is faster than most any other way, excepting magic, and not many people can do that!  If you're broke, you'll have to hoof it yourself, but don't forget the food cost of travelling by foot!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:88
msgid "Congratulations on completing the gate!  Erathia is in your debt!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:880
msgid ""
"I love to perform!  I love to travel!  There is no life like that of a bard.  The best gossip, the best food, and, most importantly, the best drink available… why would I ever want to be anything else?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:881
msgid ""
"Though you can't hear it, the stars and the planets sing as they travel through the sky.  It is the Music of the Spheres– the grandest symphony in the universe!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:883
msgid ""
"Flying is certainly easier than walking.  Safer, for the most part, too.  The only problem is that the Fly spell continually drains your power, so you need to plan your flight trips carefully so the spell doesn't run out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:884
msgid ""
"Water walking– my specialty– permits you to walk across most bodies of water as though you were on dry land.  You have to be careful, though, or the spell will run out while you're still over the water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:885
msgid ""
"I've had to rescue a number of doomed expeditions, and let me tell you the one thing I've learned.  If you go somewhere that you don't think you can handle, RETREAT.  No one will think less of you for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:886
msgid ""
"The magics of mind, body, and spirit are the magics of the soul and the self.  To improve one's understanding of them is to improve one's standing with the gods."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:887
msgid ""
"Many people have contempt for the simple music of a travelling minstrel, but it is the work of a lifetime to get good at what I do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:888
msgid ""
"Many areas with magical powers are scattered around the world.  Most often, they are in out of the way locations.  It's to your best benefit to try and discover and use as many of these as you can."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:889
msgid ""
"People say bad things about my homeland of Regna all the time, but they don't know what they're talking about.  Never will you find a more fun loving, happy people than on Regna, nor a more fiercely independent people."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:89
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing the forge!  Victory will surely be ours!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:890
msgid ""
"The best way to learn is to make sure to fight challenging opponents.  You don't grow by picking on things weaker than yourself.  The true path to glory leads through winning tougher and tougher battles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:891
msgid ""
"There is a mystical deck of tarot cards some claim to have seen.  No person ever sees the deck twice.  To draw from the deck is to draw a new hand in the game of life."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:892
msgid ""
"Most of the dangerous areas left in the world are found to the west.  Paradise Valley and Dragonsand are the most notable, though the western parts of the Frozen Highlands and the Mire of the Damned are difficult as well.  As a general rule, the farther west, the more difficult."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:893
msgid ""
"I can't stress the importance of diplomacy enough.  A good diplomat can excuse any action, no matter how foul."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:894
msgid ""
"Devils!  Bah!  They're nothing more than illusions created by mages hiding vast treasure somewhere in Paradise Valley.  I know a few of those sorcerers personally, you see.  This ring I'm wearing was a gift from one of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:895
msgid ""
"Some people are born to trade, or negotiate, or fight, or study.  I'm born to steal, and I'm pretty good at it.  Times are a lot harder now because of all the calamities; it's hard to find things worth stealing anymore– people are way too careful with what they have."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:896
msgid ""
"Thank God for Sundays!  If I had to work every day I think I would revolt against my noble oppressors and replace them with a capitalist-bourgeoisie run quasi-democratic society where I would still have to work long hours for little pay."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:897
msgid ""
"I wonder what life was like before the Silence with a governor in charge of everything?  It couldn't have been very good, or there wouldn't have been a rebellion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:898
msgid ""
"There are three styles of hats popular these days, ranging from the cloth hat to the fancy, expensive sort made by the highest quality tailors.  Wizards like to enchant quality hats because they're lighter than helms and don't block your vision.  Also, a certain kind of conical hat seems easier to enchant than others."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:899
msgid ""
"Before the Silence was the Time of Wonders.  Magical creations handled all the hard labor– I wish I had one to do my chores."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:9
msgid ""
"I have heard rumors that the end of the world is near.  One look at that crystal in the center of town, and I am tempted to believe them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:100 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:101 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:102
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:103 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:90 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:91
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:92 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:93 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:94
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:95 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:96 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:97
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:98 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:99
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:900
msgid ""
"All are equal before the majesty of the law:  Rich man as well as poor is prohibited from sleeping under bridges, stealing bread and begging for change.  –Voltaire"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:901
msgid ""
"It's easier to let a barrel roll down hill than to push it up.  Sometimes it's better to just go with the flow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:902
msgid ""
"Not all clay is created equal.  The best clay can be found in the bed of the rivers and streams flowing past Free Haven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:903
msgid ""
"Some articles of clothing have been enchanted.  It will benefit you to wear these types of magic clothes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:904
msgid ""
"Everyone should wear shoes, not just nobles and rich people!  What are you going to do if you hurt your feet?  How are you going to keep working?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:905
msgid ""
"If I was smart, do ya think I'd be digging ditches for a living?  Be serious, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:906
msgid ""
"Grindstones are so hard to make and find, it's a wonder anyone ever becomes a miller.  I hear that Karigor has a great rock quarry that turns things like millstones out by the hundreds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:907
msgid ""
"Can you imagine the Elves starting a war over deforestation?  Where do you get wood if not from trees?  How am I supposed to make a living if I don't have lumber to shape and build with?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:908
msgid ""
"Churches and kings seem to spend a lot of time thinking about paving stones and whatnot.  If it weren't for them, I would hardly have any work at all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:909
msgid ""
"Why are there only twenty hours in a goblin day? Ever see a goblin with twenty-four fingers and toes?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:910
msgid ""
"Used to be plenty of game out west.  Not so much, these days. Maybe it has something to do with the blight that's been killing the plants in Pleasant Valley."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:911
msgid ""
"Most people have too many problems of their own to help out a poor beggar like me, but the priests of the Temple of Baa always seem to have time and money or food for me.  I'm very grateful to them for helping me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:912
msgid ""
"The blight everyone's been talking about has been killing all the cows!  Now tell me.  How's a soul supposed to make a living rustling cattle when there's no cattle to rustle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:913
msgid ""
"Mogreds are extinct in Enroth, and almost extinct in Karigor.  They were over-hunted because of how valuable their horns are for enchanting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:914
msgid ""
"There's a paper shortage that's come up recently, and I can tell you, my clients do NOT like it.  It's amazing to hear some wealthy noble like Loretta Fleise complain about the cost of paper.  She probably has the largest pile of gold in the kingdom, perhaps even the world, and still she complains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:915
msgid ""
"Based on worshipping nature and the world around us, this church cared less about the people and more about its selfish goals."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:916
msgid ""
"I could certainly use a holiday.  How many clerks do you know of that work every day of the year?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:917
msgid ""
"I know most people don't feel our job is important.  With the events recently, however, it's extremely important for us to keep order.  We will be as vigilant as ever!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:918
msgid ""
"I hope your luck is better than mine.  I've lost a lot of money on sure bets recently.  I think the bad luck of the Ironfists is rubbing off on me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:919
msgid ""
"I hate Sundays!  It is ever so hard to get good help to work on Sunday.  Like it's different than any other day!  Humph."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:920
msgid ""
"Baa changed my life for the better!  Surrender your will to Baa, and you will forever be free of doubt and pain!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:921
msgid ""
"I can't wait for the Circus of the Sun to get here.  I've been good all year, so hopefully my parents will take me to see it!"
msgstr ""

