#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:977
msgid ""
"Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\n"
"Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\n"
"Expert Disarm Trap doubles your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\n"
"I will teach you Expert Disarm Trap if you have a skill level of 4 and can pay 500 gold."
