#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:79 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1130
msgid "Clues"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1132
msgid ""
"I know that the Prophecies can be found in the Lair of the Feathered Serpent.\n"
"However, I have no idea what that means, thus the clue is no help to me. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3928 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11439
msgid ""
"So YOU'RE the ones that won Lord Markham's contest!\n"
"How do you like your winnings so far?\n"
"Had enough winning?\n"
"If I were you, I'd give him a piece of my mind!\n"
"His mansion is in Tatalia, near the wharf."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3933 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11443
msgid ""
"Watch your wallet while you're here, my friends--Steadwick abounds in thieves.\n"
"As a matter of fact, we are the world capital of thieves!\n"
"It's common knowledge that Bill Lasker, the Master Thief, lives in the sewers beneath Steadwick."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3936 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11448
msgid ""
"Back when I was in the army, I was assigned to scout out the watchtowers in Deyja.\n"
"<chuckling> It's no good trying to go through the front door, so I usually looked around for another way in.\n"
"Those Necromancers are so cowardly, they always have an escape route.\n"
"And a way out is also a way in..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4093 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11451
msgid ""
"Glad you found the way in the back door.\n"
"You probably avoided a really nasty ambush that way.\n"
"I hope my advice was useful!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3940 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11471
msgid ""
"Bill Lasker may be a criminal, but he has worked for the Crown from time to time.\n"
"Special missions, official denials of involvement, spying…that sort of stuff.\n"
"Quite a few unusual events can be tied to Bill, but none to the Crown.\n"
"Seriously, don't you think the Queen's men could find and arrest one man, even if he was hiding in the sewer?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4096 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11476 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11478
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11480
msgid ""
"So…what goes around comes around, eh?\n"
"Good job with that Carmine traitor!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3944 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11482
msgid ""
"You want to know about that traitor, Carmine?\n"
"Well, she used to work for the diplomatic corps, until she went soft and signed up with the goody two-shoes wizards.\n"
"Now she walks the streets of Celeste freely, without a care in the world for the people she left behind.\n"
"Something bad will happen to her soon, mark my words!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3948 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11509
msgid ""
"Looking for \"work\"?\n"
"You can find the Master Assassin somewhere in the Pit.\n"
"He'll have something for you.\n"
"There's always someone or something that needs killing, that's for certain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4098 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11514 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11516
msgid ""
"The dragon is fallen--and at your hands!\n"
"You are a hero!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3952 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11518
msgid ""
"Until recently, our local dragon Wromthrax the Heartless has confined his depredations to the hills in the south--eating goats, farm animals, and stray dogs.\n"
"But he has developed a taste for elvish blood, and now hunts us as well.\n"
"If you should care to confront him, his cave is in the north, west of the Mercenary Guild in the mountains.\n"
"He isn't always there.\n"
"Be careful--he is mighty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1152
msgid "Promtion to Cleric of the Sun"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:299 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1153
msgid ""
"You seek promotion for the clerics of our faith who travel with you.?\n"
"I can promote you, but I do not place much trust or faith in strangers these days.\n"
"If you were to do something for me, such as finding the lost Prophecies of the Sun, and returning them to me, then I would be agreeable to promoting you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3957 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11545
msgid ""
"What, you wanna be a crusader too?\n"
"This town is filling up with them, I swear!\n"
"Well, there's a crazy man living in the back of a building near the center of town.\n"
"People keep trying to sign up with him, and he keeps rejecting them.\n"
"Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3962 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11549
msgid ""
"Just a minute, let me check.\n"
"Mirror, mirror, on the wall… <the witch peers into her mirror for a few minutes, then sighs> It's still Alice Hargreaves.\n"
"She lives in Castle Gryphonheart.\n"
"She's quite a noble beauty, that girl is!\n"
"Takes me back to my youth, this one does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3967 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11553
msgid ""
"One of our finest, most upstanding citizens is William Setag, considered by some to be the most black hearted villain alive.\n"
"As a matter of fact, he's one of our best agents.\n"
"Wizards and their ilk complain because they've been on the receiving end of his schemes too many times-- but he's about the best there is in his profession.\n"
"If you're looking for employment, go see him.\n"
"His tower is on the north shore of Deyja at a rather inaccessible point.\n"
"He doesn't like visitors, but he should be glad to see more students turn up at his door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3973 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11557
msgid ""
"If you're looking for a teacher to begin serious monk training, speak with Bartholomew Hume--you can find him in the village south of the town of Harmondale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3990 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11561 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11641
msgid ""
"There is a breed of Medusa infesting the Red Dwarf Mines that is immune to magic.\n"
"These monsters are a real terror!\n"
"I can only thank the Gods that these creatures haven't escaped the mine.\n"
"What would we do then, beat them to death with our staves?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11566 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11568 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11570
msgid ""
"The Baa cult is gone?\n"
"Well that IS good news!\n"
"Everyone is in your debt, whether they know it or not.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3976 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11572
msgid ""
"A few years back, a weird cult called the Temple of Baa moved into the area.\n"
"At first they seemed popular, what with their free offers of healing, but it soon became clear they were devoted to darkness.\n"
"No one goes up there very much, now, and it seems that whatever evil gods were backing them have withdrawn their support.\n"
"But they're up there still, lurking in the shadows.\n"
"Creepy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1158
msgid "Lair of the Feathered Serpent"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:356 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1159
msgid ""
"Lair of the Feathered Serpent?\n"
"That could possibly refer to the poisonous couatl, but they have not been seen for centuries."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4104 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11600 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11602
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11604
msgid ""
"Glad to hear the Baa cult has gone missing, instead of my sheep!\n"
"Good job!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3981 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11606
msgid ""
"Lots of sheep have gone missing since the Baa cult moved in--and I mean lots.\n"
"No doubt they were taken to the Baa temple for sacrifice.\n"
"I'm going to go broke if someone doesn't do something about those cultists!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3984 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11633
msgid ""
"Ssspies abound in places like this, my friendsss.\n"
"If you wish your letters and communiqués to remain sssecret, you should use a cipher when you write.\n"
"There is a book in the Castle library that will explain everything, my friendsss."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3987 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11637
msgid ""
"Eight years ago, we sent a team of scholars to what is now the Red Dwarf Mine to study the strange creatures that would occasionally show up there.\n"
"The first thing we noticed was that Ooze ectoplasm makes an excellent potion catalyst.\n"
"The second was that ooze just can't be physically damaged--they split apart or squish, then run back together. If you want to kill one, you'll have to do it with magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:358 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1164
msgid ""
"The Prophecies of the Sun have never been found.\n"
"They may not event exist. The Prophecies were written by our greatest prophet.\n"
"If they are found it is our hope they will be returned to us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3994 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11645
msgid ""
"If you head south past the Wyvern Plains, don't go knocking at the door of that huge fortress you'll see standing in the middle of the water.\n"
"It's the Titan's Stronghold, and they don't much like visitors."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11649
msgid ""
"Arena fighting is available to anyone who wants to practice against any kind of opponent.\n"
"You can get to the arena by visiting a stable on any Sunday and asking them to take you there.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3999 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11653
msgid ""
"Arena Champships are held on each Sunday.\n"
"They are open to all--but be careful!\n"
"Your opponents are chosen by the Arena management, not you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4002 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11657
msgid ""
"Every graveyard or ancestral burial place seems to have a haunted house nearby--and ours is no exception.\n"
"There is a mansion near one of the plateaus on the surface in the northwest.\n"
"It is most certainly haunted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4005 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11661
msgid ""
"Fear the touch of the Ghost as you fear the loss of your life.\n"
"It inflicts terrible spiritual wounds and drains your youth before your eyes!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4007 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11665
msgid ""
"A few wars ago, my great grandfather worked on an escape tunnel from the Elvish castle to the Tularean Caves.\n"
"I don't think it's ever been used--no attack on the castle has ever brought it down--but it sure is an interesting piece of history, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11670
msgid ""
"They say that elves are faeries, but in truth we are only distantly related.\n"
"The true faeries don't live in civilization, and they're just like the stories say--playful, cruel, magical, and dangerous.\n"
"But if you really want to meet them, you could visit them in their Hall under the Hill, as they call it.\n"
"It is just outside of the village, to the North and West.\n"
"It will be challenging to get to the front door... "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4106 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11673
msgid ""
"I'm impressed--very few actually make it inside the fairy mound, or get very far."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4107 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11678 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11680
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11682 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11684
msgid ""
"The forest is much safer now, thanks you to!\n"
"The oldest tree is very happy with you, and has included you in its history recitals."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4014 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11686
msgid ""
"A while ago, I saw some men come to the Tularean Forest at night with axes and torches, following some sort of map.\n"
"When they left, they were laughing and happy.\n"
"It looked like they were carrying a big green rock.\n"
"My brother says they were a band of mercenaries from Tatalia.\n"
"Anyway, the next day was when the forest went mad.\n"
"It's too dangerous to go there now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4020 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11692
msgid ""
"The Tularean Forest is so old that it has developed a mind…sort of.\n"
"The forest is vaguely aware of who walks through it, but only one part of the forest can communicate with people.\n"
"That's the oldest tree.\n"
"If you want to have a very long and slow conversation, it will be happy to oblige.\n"
"Look for it on an island to the south east of the forest.\n"
"It's larger than the rest of the trees.\n"
"You can't miss it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4027 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11696
msgid ""
"Anyone needing to earn some spare cash can visit a town hall in any major city to pick up a bounty hunting assignment.\n"
"City councils are always fearful of the latest man eating monster or bandit or mad wizard, and set bounties on the creature that is bothering them most this month.\n"
"There's no rhyme or reason to their choices, so don't try to figure it out.\n"
"They often pay quite well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4031 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11700
msgid ""
"If you ever get tired of amateur bounty hunts, and want to advance your career, speak with Ebednezer Sower in Avlee.\n"
"He only teaches followers of the shadow path, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4033 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11704
msgid ""
"Pirates been operating out of the tidewater caverns for twenty years.\n"
"They're not Regnans, and they aren't part of Bill Lasker's men, but they're still pretty mean.\n"
"You want to get in there, just get yourself out to the islands to the west."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4109 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11709 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11711
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11713
msgid ""
"Oh, so the map is found?\n"
"What will you do with your newfound treasure?\n"
"Share it, I hope!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11715
msgid ""
"Evenmorn Island isn't lost, so much as hard to get to.\n"
"It is surrounded by treacherous reefs, sandbars, whirlpools, and sharks.\n"
"If it's dangerous, the Island is surrounded by it.\n"
"There are only one or two safe ways in, and the map for those ways was stolen by pirates during the chaos of the recent wars.\n"
"They probably still have the map in their caves.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4112 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11722 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11724
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11726
msgid ""
"Now that you have the map, I guess you'll be going there soon.\n"
"Be careful--they say the island is cursed!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4042 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11728
msgid ""
"The boat captains would be happy to take any paying fare to Evenmorn island, but they don't have proper maps.\n"
"There's no way anyone is going to risk their ship in the reefs around the Island unless they have the map!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4114 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11734
msgid ""
"If you don't mind the swamp and fog, Evenmorn Island is a great place to live.\n"
"Of course, the Curse doesn't help--ghosts and skeletons roam the island freely--but other than that, the neighbors keep to themselves.\n"
"The Churches of the Sun and the Moon don't even fight each other very much anymore.\n"
"<Heh!> probably means they're running out of adherents..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4044 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11738
msgid ""
"Well, I don't have any golem parts--I never took that class--but there are students all over Bracada who have spare golem parts lying around.\n"
"They aren't worth anything unless you have them all, so they'll probably just give them to you for free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4046 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11742
msgid ""
"You see all those golems walking around Bracada?\n"
"Every single one of them was made by the School.\n"
"Not bad for students, eh?\n"
"They don't have much to say, but they're tough guardians and can tell when a follower of Darkness is near.\n"
"You should see them go into action when one of those Necromancers or Warlocks wanders into our lands.\n"
"Zowwwwwieeee!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11749 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11751
msgid ""
"Divine intervention has been found and copied?\n"
"A miracle!\n"
"I never expected to see it in my lifetime!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4052 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11753
msgid ""
"Our astrologers have determined that the missing Divine Intervention text lies somewhere deep under the ground.\n"
"Under Deyja, to be precise.\n"
"They fear that the current incarnation of the text has fallen into the Breeding Pit--the Necromancer's version of our Proving Grounds.\n"
"Oh, what must we have done to offend the Gods so?\n"
"We will never retrieve the text from that forsaken place!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4122 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11760 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11762
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11764
msgid ""
"All the grandmasters are very pleased with you.\n"
"You have done our profession a great service!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4057 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11766
msgid ""
"The spell of Divine Intervention, the highest of the school of Light magic, has been missing for centuries.\n"
"It is a curse, we believe, for our lack of devotion and faith to the Light.\n"
"We struggle, and some go forth to find the spell, from time to time, but none have been successful.\n"
"Each time they find it, fate cruelly snatches it from our hands.\n"
"Our Grandmasters have been bereft of this final, great spell for as long as anyone alive can remember."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4062 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11772
msgid ""
"The only people in the world who make soul jars are the Warlocks of Nighon.\n"
"It is a secret of their profession--which is strange, since they have absolutely no use for them.\n"
"Still, we are forced to bargain for the jars in order to advance our craft.\n"
"Of course, we have wrested the jars from them, from time to time...but then they raise their prices in revenge.\n"
"It must be our fate to suffer so."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4067 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11776
msgid ""
"Every Necromancer aspires to be a Lich one day.\n"
"All you need is a Soul Jar, knowledge of the Ritual, and the magical skill to survive the journey to the Land of the Dead and return.\n"
"The body withers while the soul lives on in a glorious state free from hunger, disease, and injury.\n"
"Only shallow and superficial people would mind what the Ritual does to one's appearance.\n"
"True practitioners hardly notice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4124 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11781 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11783
msgid ""
"Since you've discovered the circles on your own they have worked their magic on you.\n"
"I hope you will refrain from telling others of their whereabouts, as I have done for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4072 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11785
msgid ""
"Three circles of stones were built by the Druids long ago.\n"
"Since hearing of their locations ruins ascension attempts for would be Great Druids, I can only give you a general clue--All are in the open, unhidden and bare, and all are distant from settlements.\n"
"To tell you more would spoil your Ascension."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4075 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11791
msgid ""
"Originally, there were four Circles of Stone, one for each Cardinal direction and season, but the Eastern Circle was destroyed somewhere in Nighon during the wars between the Churches of the Sun and the Moon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4076 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11795
msgid ""
"The graveyard does indeed hold the bones of the ancient King, but the hallowed land will curse any who disturb it.\n"
"I don't envy you this task.\n"
"Each grave you open will unleash its curse, and possibly some other trap.\n"
"Best be sure you're opening the correct grave when you begin to dig."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4080 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11799
msgid ""
"Though the barrows were built to deter thieves, a way was needed to navigate them during burials and ceremonies.\n"
"Near each of the gates you'll find a plaque.\n"
"These plaques are cryptic, but they will keep you from losing your way, as long as you use them.\n"
"No thief yet has realized their significance, so once they enter the barrows, they never leave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4084 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11803
msgid ""
"We built a tunnel leading from our Thunderfist Mountain to the Land of the Giants during the War.\n"
"It was there we discovered the Kreegan, and more titans and dragons then you can imagine.\n"
"I suppose one who's familiar is to be a dragon could find eggs in one of the dragon caves of that terrible land.\n"
"'Ware the mother..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4088 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11807
msgid ""
"I've heard legends that there is a dragon in the Land of the Titans greater than any that have come before.\n"
"Lesser dragons and titans do battle on the slopes of the mountain in which its cave resides.\n"
"This dragon is so huge, and so mighty that the other dragons feed it for fear it will one day leave its cave and devour them all in its fury.\n"
"The dragons believe it is a god.\n"
"If that is so, imagine its treasure..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4126 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11811
msgid ""
"During the wars between the Temples of the Sun and Moon, three statuettes were stolen from the shrines in the Bracada Desert, Tatalia, and Avlee.\n"
"I represent a group of Druids that want these shrines back to their original form-- it is critical for their worship.\n"
"To this end, I am offering a substantial reward for anyone that will find the statuettes and place them on the shrines."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4129 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11820 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11835
msgid ""
"All three statuettes are not placed.\n"
"I cannot reward partial success.\n"
"Return when you have placed all three."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4132 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11823
msgid ""
"Great work!\n"
"The Druids are so pleased, they threw in a little extra for your fine performance.\n"
"Take this… you most certainly deserve it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4135 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11839
msgid ""
"As you may have already guessed, I'm a collector of fine art.\n"
"Currently, I am looking for a set of paintings, one of King Roland, one of his brother Archibald, and one of the angel statue in the courtyard of Castle Ironfist.\n"
"This set is of great value, and, as a collector, I'm willing to pay quite handsomely for it.\n"
"If you should gather the entire set of paintings bring them back to me and I'll be sure to compensate you well for your effort."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4141 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11849 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11868
msgid ""
"Remember, I need the complete set of paintings-- they aren't worth much by themselves.\n"
"When you have the rest, bring them all to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4143 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11852
msgid ""
"Wonderful!\n"
"This set has eluded me for years!\n"
"You more than deserve the reward I promised; here, hopefully this will be sufficient."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:302 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1187
msgid ""
"Have you found this Lair of the Feathered Serpent and the Prophecies of the Sun?\n"
"Do not waste my time!\n"
"The world is ending and you waste time with useless conversation!\n"
"Return to me when you have found the Prophecies and have taken them to the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4146 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11872
msgid ""
"To be declared ArcoMage Champion, you must win a game of ArcoMage in every tavern on, in, and under the continent of Erathia.\n"
"There are 13 such taverns sponsoring ArcoMage events.\n"
"When you have accomplished this, return to me to claim the prize."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4149 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11879
msgid ""
"You must claim a victory at ALL 13 taverns.\n"
"Until you do, you cannot be declared ArcoMage Champion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4151 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11882
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You have become the ArcoMage Champion!\n"
"The prize is waiting in the chest right outside my house."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4157 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11895
msgid ""
"People say the Dwarves live in the barren lands south of Harmondale, but that's not exactly true--They live UNDER them.\n"
"Look for their front gate in the center of the Barrow Downs where three bridges meet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4159 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11899
msgid ""
"Ever since the Warlocks of Nighon tunneled through Stone City from their island, travelers have been asking to pass through the city to get to Nighon.\n"
"The Dwarf King hates this, and would like to charge a hefty fee for people seeking to enter Stone City.\n"
"He has not started charging however, fearing political and possible violent repercussions with the Warlocks of Nighon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1190
msgid ""
"You have found the lost Prophecies of the Sun?\n"
"May the Light forever shine upon you and may the Prophet guide your steps.\n"
"With these we may be able to find the answer to what has befallen Jadame! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4162 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11903
msgid ""
"The Warlocks of Nighon live in Thunderfist Mountain--an extinct volcano on a large island a few miles from the mainland.\n"
"During the recent wars, the Warlocks tunneled through Stone City to transport their forces across the channel.\n"
"Those tunnels are still open and can be traversed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4165 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11907
msgid ""
"During the War, the Warlocks tunneled from Nighon through Stone City to get to the mainland and seize territory.\n"
"Even though they were pushed back to their island by Erathia, the tunnels remain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4167 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11911
msgid ""
"Dwarves live under the ground of the Barrow Downs--a barren collection of ancient gravesites built by their race centuries ago to honor fallen kings and heroes.\n"
"Not all of the barrows can be reached on the surface--many are magically connected to each other through a system of teleporters and traps that protect the graves from those who would rob them.\n"
"If you look closely at the walls you should see markings that might help you navigate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4170 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11916
msgid ""
"We were making a fortune in the Red Dwarf Mines until the Medusas came!\n"
"We had to run before they turned everyone to stone.\n"
"Without our mining, we have almost no way to make a living.\n"
"Not the way for a proper Dwarf to live, I say!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4276 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11919
msgid ""
"The Lords of Harmondale!\n"
"Heroes, I say!\n"
"My cousin was one of the ones you rescued!\n"
"We are in your debt!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4174 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11924
msgid ""
"Bracada leased the land where we started the Red Dwarf Mine to us a few years ago.\n"
"That was until the Medusas came and took the mines from our people.\n"
"Only the Gods know what horrors go on in there now.\n"
"The mines were in the Northeast corner of Bracada."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4280 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11927
msgid ""
"Thank you for delivering our people from the medusas!\n"
"The Dwarves of Stone City will not forget you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4178 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11932
msgid ""
"When the Medusas took the Red Dwarf Mines from us, not everyone escaped.\n"
"There are still several statues in the mines.\n"
"They can be rescued if their statues haven't been broken yet, but you would have to fight through the Medusas to do it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4282 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11935
msgid ""
"We owe you much for your daring rescue of our people.\n"
"Rebuilding your castle was the least we could do for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4181 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11939
msgid ""
"Do you like our city?\n"
"It's not just a hole in the ground--it's a home in the ground!\n"
"Dwarves have been working this mountain for centuries!\n"
"There isn't much mining left here, though, and what there is happens to be in unstable and unsafe tunnels.\n"
"Be careful if you go to the lower levels."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4284 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11944 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11946
msgid ""
"Good day, my lords.\n"
"I must say the people are changing their minds about your chances of survival.\n"
"Everyone is saying how wonderful it is to have stable rulers in the Castle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4186 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11948
msgid ""
"Respectfully, my lords, I must say that no one expects you to last long because no other lords of Harmondale have lasted long.\n"
"The fighting and politics between Erathia and Avlee will claim you sooner or later.\n"
"Probably sooner."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4189 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11954
msgid ""
"Rebellions here in Harmondale are rare, but we've had a couple of big ones!\n"
"Most of the time lords here don't last long enough to rebel against, but there've been some wicked ones!\n"
"Not that I think you're wicked, my lords."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4192 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11959
msgid ""
"It's good to see someone in Harmondale again, my lords.\n"
"The castle's been standing empty since the War, except for the goblins.\n"
"But they don't count, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4287 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11962
msgid ""
"It's good to see the Castle rebuilt and those loathsome goblin bandits evicted.\n"
"Things are looking better around here since you took over!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4195 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11966
msgid ""
"What with all the wars that Avlee gets itself into all the time, and all the high taxes, I've moved to Harmondale to stay.\n"
"Harmondale sees a lot of violence, but at least they don't conscript.\n"
"You know, there's been so many wars in Avlee that one of the kings had a tunnel dug from his castle to the caves in the North just in case the castle was taken AGAIN."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4198 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11970
msgid ""
"A ways outside of Harmondale there's a cave system that's always been the home of bandits, monsters, and other ne'er-do-wells.\n"
"They're called the White Cliff Caves.\n"
"If you're ever robbed, or are looking for some evil doers to punish, all you got to do is go up there.\n"
"You'll find a fight for sure!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11975
msgid ""
"Did you notice that covered bridge on the way from Harmondale to Steadwick?\n"
"It's called Fort Riverstride, and it protects us from surprise Elvish attacks coming through Harmondale.\n"
"There's so many traps and tricks inside there, they say it will never fall without the help of treachery.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4289 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11978
msgid ""
"I've heard Fort Riverstride was taken with the aid of treachery!\n"
"What a shame that those wretches were able to wring concessions from the Queen in exchange for the return of what was already ours!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11983
msgid ""
"Looks like the trophy fell into the hands of Erathia.\n"
"I hear there was quite a fight over it! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11986
msgid ""
"Looks like the trophy fell into the hands of Avlee.\n"
"I hear there was quite a fight over it! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11989
msgid ""
"Looks like the trophy fell into the hands of the Arbiter.\n"
"I hear there was quite a fight over it! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11991
msgid ""
"There's an artifact that Avlee and Erathia have been fighting over for decades.\n"
"Both claim it was made by their people, and have lost the thing to raids against one another many times.\n"
"It isn't even magical--just a trophy.\n"
"Fifteen years ago, the trophy was lost during a raid, and no one knows where it went.\n"
"Recently, rumors have been flying, and the hunt's been on to figure out where it went.\n"
"If they find it--watch out!\n"
"Blood will be spilt. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4213 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12009
msgid ""
"Because of all the tension in the air, Erathia and Avlee hired an arbiter to help them work out their differences.\n"
"He's staying in the \"House of Stars\" on the eastern edge of Harmondale territory.\n"
"Maybe he has some advice for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4297 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12012
msgid ""
"The death of Judge Grey was a blow to all of us.\n"
"I hope his replacement does his legacy justice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4216 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12027
msgid ""
"If you ever feel like you need advice on what next to do, or you've lost something important, go visit the Arbiter in the House of Stars near the Eastern edge of Harmondale territory.\n"
"He often knows where lost items went, or has advice on what you need to do.\n"
"I'm sure you'll find him helpful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4299 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12032 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12034
msgid ""
"It looks like the consequences of your choice are just beginning, my lords.\n"
"I hope you chose wisely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4219 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12036
msgid ""
"The death of Judge Grey, Arbiter of Harmondale, has put the War on hold.\n"
"It's like the whole world is holding its breath, waiting for you to make a choice.\n"
"Better be careful who you choose--this sounds like a big one, my Lords."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4222 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12053
msgid ""
"The proving grounds, called the Walls of Mist,\n"
"is the place where all the wizards in Celeste have to go before they learn the High Art.\n"
"I hear it is much more of a moral test than a physical one.\n"
"You aren't allowed to kill any of the monsters in the maze."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12057
msgid ""
"The city of Celeste has been home to the Light for centuries.\n"
"It was established by King Magnus II\n"
"in 499 as the centerpiece to the Kingdom of Bracada, and as a beacon of hope to the rest of the world.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12061
msgid ""
"What you see on the surface in Deyja is only a small part of the true Kingdom of Death.\n"
"There is an underground city they call the Pit.\n"
"It can be reached from the surface only by way of the Hall of the Pit in Northern Deyja.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4234 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12065
msgid ""
"Celeste is the magical city built by the Wizards of Bracada centuries ago, and anchored half in the mountains, and half in mist high above Bracada.\n"
"You must use one of their teleporters to get there--you can find it near the center of Bracada."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4236 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12070
msgid ""
"There was another murder, recently, that's been all the talk around town.\n"
"Another body--young woman, so I hear--was found near the sewers.\n"
"Drained of blood, for the love of Light!\n"
"It's those thieves living' in the sewers I tell you!\n"
"Rats, they are.\n"
"Someone should go down there and put them out of business!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4301 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12073
msgid ""
"So it was a vampire that was killing all those people!\n"
"I hear you're the ones to get rid of it, too!\n"
"Thanks!\n"
"Everyone feels much safer now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4242 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12088
msgid ""
"During the War, the Warlocks had dealings with some strange creatures called the \"Kreegan\" in the mountains south of Avlee.\n"
"It's impossible to get there from the mainland, but the Warlocks dug a tunnel under the sea from their island that leads to the Kreegan's home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4244 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12092
msgid ""
"We…overplayed our hand during the War, and failed to win any territory on the mainland.\n"
"Our \"allies\", the Kreegan, turned out to be very untrustworthy.\n"
"People from Enroth call them devils--now we know why.\n"
"At just the moment when we needed them most, they turned and ran, leaving us to face the wrath of the armies of Erathia and Avlee.\n"
"Next time, we won't be so trusting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4249 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12096
msgid ""
"There's been quite a bit of activity in Deyja, people are saying.\n"
"It seems that Archibald Ironfist, the leader of Deyja (and former King of Enroth) has left the Pit for an island off the Eastern shore of Avlee.\n"
"A lot of Necromancers followed him there--seems there's some sort of split going on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4252 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12112
msgid ""
"Rumors have been trickling out of Nighon that King Roland of Enroth may still be alive.\n"
"Some Warlocks have said that they personally saw him when they met with the foul Kreegan.\n"
"The rumors also say that the Kreegan are keeping him in a cage and mistreating him horribly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4305 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12115
msgid ""
"They say you are being credited with rescuing King Roland!\n"
"That's quite a feather in your cap, my lords!\n"
"QUITE a feather!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4255 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12133
msgid ""
"A Soul Jar is what a Necromancer needs to complete the Ritual and become a Lich--an immortal undead monster that retains its mind and memories from life.\n"
"It's pretty obvious that this is not a desirable condition for most people, which is why the market for these artifacts isn't very good.\n"
"Nonetheless, Necromancers will do almost anything to get more--their profession's very existence depends on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4265 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12137
msgid ""
"Although the Warlocks are technically servants of the Dark, they usually aren't violent.\n"
"They will defend themselves if attacked, of course, but they won't start a fight unless you start it first.\n"
"They're quite reasonable, as a matter of fact, and they take their business seriously.\n"
"I've found dealing with them to be quite pleasant."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4269 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12142
msgid ""
"The underground complex Clanker has created is surprisingly well defended.\n"
"The front door will keep out all magical attacks, and the island makes it difficult for any sort of large force to land on the island.\n"
"So far, Clanker has kept to himself, and no one has seriously tried his defenses, but his best protection comes from a series of teleport blockers inside the complex.\n"
"No magical invasion force can teleport past the front door until those blockers are brought down first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4262 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12145
msgid ""
"So much for the mighty defenses.\n"
"Word is the Necromancers, led by Archibald Ironfist, teleported straight into Clanker's Laboratory and took over.\n"
"I'm told that treachery from within had something to do with it, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12163
msgid ""
"Looking for Expert instruction in one of your Skills?\n"
"Expert teachers for most Skills can be found in Harmondale, Erathia and the Tularean Forest. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4258 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12167
msgid ""
"People have been disappearing recently.\n"
"Not just one or two, but several every day!\n"
"They go to bed at night, and the next day they aren't seen and their houses are empty!\n"
"I certainly wish someone would find out what it happening!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4326 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12171
msgid ""
"The teleporters of central Bracada can get you to numerous locations in the desert.\n"
"Just check the pillar in front of the teleporter for the location it will take you to.\n"
"Be careful however, some of the teleporters haven't been working correctly and will not show the destination!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4329 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12176
msgid ""
"My Lords!\n"
"Lord Archibald sent engineers and artisans to upgrade Castle Harmondale!\n"
"Now we have an upstairs and downstairs!\n"
"Lord Archibald also left gifts in chests in these new areas.\n"
"The artisans are setting up shop in the entry hall and will have many wonderful items for sale!\n"
"Oh, yes, the workers discovered an older area to the castle--a torture chamber and dungeon!\n"
"We are very lucky!\n"
"I never thought Harmondale could afford such luxuries, my lords!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4337 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12179
msgid ""
"My Lords!\n"
"Gavin Magnus sent engineers and artisans to upgrade Castle Harmondale!\n"
"Now we have an upstairs and downstairs!\n"
"Gavin Magnus also left gifts in chests in these new areas.\n"
"The artisans are setting up shop in the entry hall and will have many wonderful items for sale!\n"
"The workers, however, discovered an older area to the castle--a torture chamber and dungeon.\n"
"It isn't a pretty sight, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4354 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12181
msgid "My Lords. Castle Harmondale stands ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:85 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:87 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:88
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1219 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1229 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1233
msgid "Korbu"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12196
msgid ""
"Pedestals can be found through out the land that can lend you temporary protection from certain types of magic. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:46 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:122
msgid ""
"My Granda used to tell us of the times past, when the Portals of Stone were the main travel route between the islands.\n"
"She told us that the keys to the Portals disappeared during one of the first raids committed by the Regnan Pirates.\n"
"If the Portals of Stone were working my brother Isthric could return back to the main island!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1220
msgid ""
"Korbu was the most powerful of the Vampire race.\n"
"Over one hundred years ago, he sought something that our kind cannot accept.\n"
"Absolution.\n"
"Somehow, Korbu began to experience guilt over the need to feed.\n"
"Or perhaps over the act of feeding itself.\n"
"He could no longer bear the thought of killing in order to survive.\n"
"Many of our elders argued with him.\n"
"He decided to find a place where he could ponder his existence.\n"
"Thus the Crypt of Korbu was constructed with slave labor in the Ravage Roaming region.\n"
" Korbu has not been heard from since he left.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4344 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12200
msgid ""
"My Lords ::bows:: Now that you have cleared Castle Harmondale of the goblins and vermin, you should concentrate on removing the goblins from the area surrounding Harmondale.\n"
"To the east of here is the center of the disputed region.\n"
"Many great battles have been waged there between the forces of King Eldrich of the Elves and Queen Catherine of Erathia.\n"
"The goblins have taken the ruined fort in this area an use it to attack any travelers attempting to reach Harmondale!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4348 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12204
msgid ""
"My Lords, remember Castle Harmondale is YOURS.\n"
"Feel free to relax while you're here.\n"
"Your sleep will never be disturbed by attacking monsters, nor will anything you decide to store in the castle's chests ever be stolen or removed.\n"
"You are home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4352 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12208
msgid ""
"If you seek aid from Erathia, light the beacon fires near the roads to the Barrow Downs, Erathia, and the Tularean Forest.\n"
"The Erathian forces near here will see the fires and rush to your aid!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4390 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12214
msgid ""
"Ahh, a shipment of Tularean Wood from my friend Robert Belknap.\n"
"I hope everything is well with him. Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:323 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1224
msgid ""
"In this time of chaos, we need the minds of all our elders.\n"
"Return to us with Korbu, or his remains, if he has perished.\n"
"If he has indeed perished, you must return his Sarcophagus with him.\n"
"We will attempt to reanimate him so that we may consult his wisdom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4392 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12244
msgid ""
"Here's your crate of Griffin Feathers.\n"
"Robert Belknap in the Tularean Forest pays the best prices for these feathers.\n"
"Be sure to give him my regards when you see him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4395 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12278
msgid ""
"Rydric has sent me another shipment of Arrowheads.\n"
"Wonderful!\n"
"Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:417 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1230
msgid ""
"Korbu?\n"
"He was the greatest of our kind, and yet he always seemed troubled.\n"
"There are some of us that remember the times before he left. He always seemed disturbed to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4398 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12308
msgid ""
"Here's your crate of Tularean Wood.\n"
"Be sure to take it to Rydric in Harmondale.\n"
"He will pay you well for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:420 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1234
msgid ""
"Korbu left us after making the \"Arrangement\" with the necromancers here in Shadowspire.\n"
"We aid them in any research they are working on, and assist with the defense of their guild.\n"
"In return we are allowed to feed on the local population without hindrance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4401 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12342
msgid ""
"Pip Hillier sends another shipment of Griffin Feathers.\n"
"Here's your payment.\n"
"Enjoy the day!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/Global.txt:52 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/Global.txt:681 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/class.txt:47
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/monster_data.txt:293 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/monster_data.txt:572 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:850
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:851 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:89 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1237
msgid "Lich"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4404 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12372
msgid ""
"Thanks!\n"
"Here's your crate of Sand. Arvin Beneclowd in the forsaken Barrow Downs pays well for this Sand, from it he creates fine bottles!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:331 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1238
msgid ""
"Ah, you seek to achieve the ultimate in the darker arts.\n"
"The necromancer’s among you seek to turn themselves into Liches, the most potent of necromancers.\n"
"Very well, I can perform this transformation for you, but you must do something for me...and get something for yourselves.\n"
"I require the Lost Book of Khel.\n"
"It contains secrets of necromancy that had been hidden since Khel’s tower sank beneath the waves.\n"
"The Lizardmen of Dagger Wound celebrated when the sea took Khel and his knowledge from us.\n"
"With the volcanic upheaval in that region, I believe the Tower of Khel can be found.\n"
"Retrieve the book from the library and bring it to me!\n"
"Now, for yourselves, you will need a Lich Jar for every necromancer that wishes to become a Lich.\n"
"Zanthora, the Mad Necromancer keeps a large supply of these jars, perhaps she will sell you one!\n"
"If not you must take them from her!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4406 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12407
msgid ""
"Ahh, a shipment of Enrothian Wine from Infernon.\n"
"This will warm the hearts of many! Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4408 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12426
msgid ""
"Be sure to take this crate of Glass Bottles to Infernon in Avlee.\n"
"He bottles the finest Enrothian Wine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:90 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1243
msgid "Lich Jars"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:423 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1245
msgid ""
"The Guild of Necromancers is very stingy when it comes to parting with Lich Jars.\n"
"You may be better off seeking out Zanthora, and obtaining one from her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4410 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12461
msgid ""
"Ahh, a shipment of Sand from Calindra Goldensight.\n"
"Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12480
msgid ""
"Here's your crate of Enrothian Wine.\n"
"Take this to Calindra Goldensight in Tatalia and she will pay you well! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1690 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:125
msgid ""
"You have repaired the Portals of Stone?\n"
"That is tremendous news!\n"
"Quickly, find my brother, Isthric and tell him to return home!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4414 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12515
msgid ""
"Arvin Beneclowd sends me another shipment of Glass Bottles.\n"
"Time to bottle some more Enrothian Wine.\n"
"Here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4417 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12534
msgid ""
"You can charter a boat from this port to Erathia on Tuesdays, Thursdays and Saturdays. Boats for the Bracada Desert leave on Mondays and Wednesdays. Boats leave for Avlee on Friday only. If you have completed the Priest quest you can charter a boat to Evenmorn Island on Sundays."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4418 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12538
msgid ""
"If you are looking to make it quickly to Nighon through the tunnels below, you should take the left fork of the Nighon Tunnel.\n"
"Many have taken the right fork and have never been heard from again.\n"
"Then again they may have made it to Nighon only to be taken by the Warlocks!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4421 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12542
msgid ""
"Many traders all over Erathia hire out to travelers to deliver their goods!\n"
"If you are ever in need of some extra coin, try finding one of these merchants and make a delivery for them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:91 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1265
msgid "The Lost Book of Khel"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:425 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1267
msgid ""
"the Lost Book of Khel is rumored to hold the secrets to the ultimate powers of the dark art of necromancy.\n"
"It may be good that no one knows where it is!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:92 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1287
msgid "Promotion to Lich"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:49 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:129
msgid ""
"That rude man?\n"
"He's more concerned with that Abandoned Temple than he is with the life that goes on around him!\n"
"My Granda warned him that the Temple is a place of great Evil.\n"
"He never listened.\n"
"Now Granda isn't with us anymore and we have no one but Brekish Onefang to remind us of the past."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:344 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1290
msgid ""
"You do not have the Lost Book of Khel!\n"
"I cannot help you, if you do not help me!\n"
"Return here with the Book and a Lich Jar for each necromancer in your party that wishes to become a Lich!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4440 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12958
msgid ""
"What!\n"
"You wouldn't believe this fabrication would you?\n"
"I would never dream of sabotaging your rule here!\n"
"Gaahh!\n"
"Prepare to die!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:342 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1297 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6898
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6920
msgid ""
"You have the Lost Book of Khel, however you lack the Lich Jars needed to complete the transformation!\n"
"Return here when you have one for each necromancer in your party!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4445 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12975
msgid ""
"I have heard rumors that the shrine to the southeast of here can send you to the Land of the Giants.\n"
"I have been to the shrine many times and it has never done anything special for me.\n"
"Or is that you can get here, FROM the Land of the Giants? I wonder..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4448 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12979
msgid ""
"Scattered around the land are the Challenges.\n"
"If your ability is great enough, and you best the challenge, you will be award skill points to do with as you wish!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4479 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12985
msgid ""
"My instructions are quite clear.\n"
"I am to pay the person carrying the letter that bears the Seal.\n"
"Since you don't have a letter with a Seal, you get no money!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4471 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12988
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"The Seal.\n"
"Here, I'm supposed to give you this money.\n"
"Now, go away before we're seen together!\n"
"Someone will get suspicious."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:12997
msgid ""
"Don't try to say I didn't pay you!\n"
"You got your gold!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4482 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13001
msgid ""
"Just south of town is an old keep called Goblinwatch.\n"
"It was originally built to help keep the town safe from goblin raids, but times have been so peaceful recently that we haven't been taking care of it.\n"
"You can imagine our embarrassment when we realized that the very monsters we were guarding against have moved into the keep!\n"
"They also changed the lock on a very important door leading to the caves below the dungeon level.\n"
"We have a standing reward of 2000 gold pieces to the ones who can figure out the combination and tell us what it is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4487 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13010
msgid ""
"How can you find the combination to that lock by standing around here?\n"
"Get going!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13013
msgid ""
"Ah, thank you for taking care of that little detail for us.\n"
"Here's your gold!\n"
"Feel free to return to Goblinwatch any time to finish clearing out the rest of the monsters.\n"
"We can't pay you, but you can have anything you find there.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:347 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1302
msgid ""
"You have brought everything needed to perform the transformation!\n"
"So be it!\n"
"All necromancer’s in your party will be transformed into Liches!\n"
"May the dark energies flow through them for all eternity!\n"
"The rest of you will gain what knowledge I can teach them as reward for their assistance!\n"
"Lets begin!After we have completed, good friend Lathean can handle any future promotions for your party."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4494 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13026
msgid ""
"You did such a fine job with the Goblinwatch assignment that we would like to employ you again.\n"
"A cult has moved into an old abandoned temple a few day's journey west of here.\n"
"To pay for their blasphemous activities, they've been robbing travelers using the road that leads to Castle Ironfist.\n"
"We've appealed to the regent to do something about these horrible cultists, but he says all his forces are occupied in the west, or some such nonsense.\n"
"We want it gone now, so we're willing to pay you 5000 gold pieces to get rid of them and bring us back the Chime of Harmony as proof you've done the deed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13034
msgid ""
"Without the Chime of Harmony, I'm not authorized to pay the reward money.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4501 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13037
msgid ""
"Good work!\n"
"Here's your gold!\n"
"I can't thank you enough for ruining that temple.\n"
"Now the road to Ironfist will be safe for travel again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4505 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13049
msgid ""
"The road to Ironfist is much safer thanks to you.\n"
"You have our gratitude."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4507 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13053
msgid ""
"The proprietor of the Howling Moon is George Caniss.\n"
"It's a wonderful place.\n"
"Tell him I said hi!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13059
msgid ""
"Welcome, adventurers!\n"
"Did you have something for me?\n"
"I'm a very busy man, you know.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4510 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13062
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for bringing me these letters! <Wilbur begins reading the letters> I’ve been so worried…I see… This is not good news…Oh, no.\n"
"Traitors!\n"
"Traitors and conspirators everywhere!\n"
"I must organize an expedition at once! <Wilbur lowers his voice> I trust you will not speak to the prince about these letters– he is already too depressed and unhappy to hear more bad news.\n"
"And now I must see to the organization of the expedition.\n"
"Here is a bag of gold as a reward– you’ve earned it and my gratitude.\n"
"Now, if only I could find someone to finish looking for Lord Kilburn…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4517 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13076
msgid ""
"<Wilbur snaps his fingers> Say, you wouldn’t happen to be interested in taking care of a little detail for me, would you?\n"
"Lord Kilburn disappeared near Blackshire.\n"
"Find out what you can and return to me with the information.\n"
"If it is true that he has been slain by devils, return his shield to me if at all possible.\n"
"I will grant you my favor with the High Council, should you require it, and you can rest assured your compensation will be generous."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4522 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13084
msgid ""
"Hmm.\n"
"No luck finding the shield yet, eh?\n"
"Well, do keep looking, will you?\n"
"It really is important that someone accounts for his whereabouts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4528 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13087
msgid ""
"Ah.\n"
"‘Tis a sad day when so noble a Knight should fall to such foul monsters!\n"
"You have done a good thing, bringing his shield to me.\n"
"I shall ensure that he and his men receive all the honors due them.\n"
"I am in your debt, and you have my favor with the council.\n"
"Here is your reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4534 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13111
msgid ""
"Well, you have my vote on the High Council.\n"
"I trust you implicitly.\n"
"I've sent a messenger instructing Slicker Silvertongue to vote for you on my behalf.\n"
"Now I'm quite busy, and must attend to other duties.\n"
"I'm sure you can take care of any problems and miscommunications that may arise in this matter.\n"
"Yes.\n"
"Quite right."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4541 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13114 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13995
msgid ""
"I cannot thank you enough for uncovering that horrible traitor and his crimes against the throne.\n"
"I understand you are on a mission of some importance, so for Services Rendered to the Crown, it behooves me to offer you free use of the royal yacht for your travels.\n"
"It will take you as far as Hermit's Isle, if you need it to.\n"
"Once again, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4545 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13120
msgid ""
"I am the Foremost Paladin, and as such, I am the one charged with the promotion and keeping of the titles and responsibilities of paladinhood.\n"
"Those paladins who wish to perform a quest for the official promotion to crusader must rescue a damsel in distress.\n"
"Those of you who are not paladins will be awarded the title of honorary crusader, and all will be given a sizeable gold reward.\n"
"Return to me with said damsel and I will promote any paladins aiding in her rescue to the status of crusader."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4549 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13127
msgid ""
"I know there is a shortage of damsels in distress, but this quest is the traditional test.\n"
"I really can’t bend the rules here.\n"
"Keep looking– I’m sure you’ll find someone.\n"
"If it helps, I hear Melody Silver, daughter of the noble John Silver, is being held captive by ruffians on the Island of Mist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4553 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13130
msgid ""
"I have heard stories of the daring rescue, and I am delighted that you have returned with Miss Silver.\n"
"I shall arrange to have her returned to her family at once.\n"
"Exemplary work!\n"
"I hereby officially promote all paladins to the status of crusader, and all non-paladins to honorary crusaders!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4557 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13150
msgid ""
"Well, then!\n"
"It is a fine thing to be promoted to crusader, but even finer a thing to be promoted to hero.\n"
"As you may have guessed by now, the condition for hero status is to slay a dragon.\n"
"I know this seems difficult, but tradition has its demands.\n"
"What’s worse, you can’t slay just any dragon, but must slay a named dragon.\n"
"Your task is to slay Longfang Witherhide and return with a claw or tooth as proof.\n"
"Fortunately, we know that Longfang lives in a cave in the mountains behind Castle Darkmoor.\n"
"He has slain at least twelve would-be heroes, so be careful!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4565 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13158
msgid ""
"There is no use returning to me to talk about your quest.\n"
"I cannot change the rules or your quest.\n"
"Longfang awaits your avenging sword.\n"
"Now get to it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4569 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13161
msgid ""
"Well done!\n"
"One less horrible monster in the world is a good thing.\n"
"I hereby officially promote all crusaders to heroes, and all honorary crusaders to the status of honorary hero! May you long continue to live up to the title!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4572 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13180
msgid ""
"It is always good to speak with heroes of the realm!\n"
"Come back in some less troubled time and we'll swap tales of honor and courage by the fire!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4574 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13184
msgid ""
"The palace is deadly dull, and everyone tells me what to do.\n"
"Being royalty isn’t really worth much and no one will let me go outside the walls while my father is gone.\n"
"I haven’t left the castle for months!\n"
"Anyway, you people look pretty important.\n"
"What if you helped me sneak out and stay with you for a couple of days?\n"
"I can’t give you much in return yet, but I’ll owe you a favor.\n"
"Someday I’ll be able to repay you.\n"
"I am the prince, after all!\n"
"I’ll go out the secret door and meet you outside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4583 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13191
msgid "Let’s go see the circus!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:18 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:132
msgid "Mountain of Fire"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4584 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13200
msgid "It seems that Prince Nicolai disappeared while you were resting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4585 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13208
msgid ""
"Um.\n"
"Hi. <smiling weakly> Would you believe I got lost and these nice people were taking me home?\n"
"No?\n"
"I guess I wouldn’t either.\n"
"I suppose it’s time we got back to the castle, then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:93 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1321
msgid "Return of Korbu"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4590 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13214
msgid "We should go back to Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4596 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13218
msgid ""
"Thanks for bringing me home.\n"
"I owe you a favor!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13222
msgid ""
"Everyone says that my Uncle Archibald wasn’t a very nice person, and that he almost usurped the throne from my father, but we defeated him.\n"
"Father had Tanir turn him to stone and then locked him in the library.\n"
"Nobody’s been in there for years. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4601 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13226
msgid ""
"You want to free Archibald?!\n"
"If the Oracle told you to do it, I guess we should, but he’ll be trouble once he’s loose, that’s for sure.\n"
"I know where the bell is that turned him to stone, but I can’t open the family vault that it’s in without the Third Eye.\n"
"It’s one of three gems you need to put into the door of the vault in order to open it.\n"
"I’ve got two of them– one in my father’s crown and one in his scepter, but my father hid the third one, and he didn’t tell me where it is.\n"
"If you could find it, I could open the vault and get the bell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4607 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13235
msgid ""
"Without the Third Eye, I can’t get into the vault to get you the bell that will release Archibald.\n"
"He must have hidden it near the castle, because he used to just go right outside and fetch it whenever he needed to open the vault."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13238
msgid ""
"You found the Third Eye!\n"
"All right, wait here– the bell should be in the vault.\n"
"<Nicolai runs out of the throne room, returning a short while later> Ok, here it is! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4612 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13249
msgid ""
"I hope you know what you're doing.\n"
"Everyone says my uncle is quite treacherous."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:327 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1325
msgid ""
"You return to us with the remains of Korbu, but where is his Sarcophagus? We cannot complete the act of reanimation without it!\n"
"Return to us when you have both the remains and the Sarcophagus!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4615 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13254
msgid ""
"Now wait just a minute Tanir, and I’ll make it worth your while to let me…Oh. <Archibald is silent for a long while> I guess I have you people to thank for releasing me from my prison of stone.\n"
"Thank you!\n"
"You say you need a spell that I've created?\n"
"<reaching to the shelves and removing a library scroll> Well, as a reward, I’ll give you the Ritual of the Void.\n"
"Use it in good health.\n"
"Now, I’m sure you’re very busy, as am I…<Archibald waves his arms and fades away>"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4621 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13268
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing me from the clutches of those ruffians!\n"
"Oh, I wish there was some way for me to reward you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13274
msgid ""
"Mine is the traditional duty to oversee the, um, less than upright business in the Kingdom.\n"
"My House has done this for centuries under the philosophy that such business will always exist and is better watched and regulated than not.\n"
"Recently, a man styling himself the 'Prince of Thieves' has begun to usurp my authority in Free Haven.\n"
"Not only does he challenge my authority, he cooperates with that loathsome new cult that’s sprung up recently…what’s it called?\n"
"Moo, or Yak, or Bark…no…whatever.\n"
"Some sort of animal sound.\n"
"Anyway, my sources tell me that this cult plots to overthrow the King and assume power in Enroth.\n"
"This is a bad business, and needs to be stopped.\n"
"You can start by arresting the Prince of Thieves and returning him to me in chains.\n"
"I will, of course, reward you richly.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:353 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1328
msgid ""
"You have brought us the Sarcophagus of Korbu and his sacred remains.\n"
"We will attempt to reanimate Korbu and seek his wisdom in these troubled times!\n"
"The vampires among you will be transformed into Nosferatu, and the others will be taught what skills we can teach them as reward for your service."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4635 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13281
msgid ""
"I have no information on his whereabouts, so it will do you no good to talk to me about it.\n"
"Try going to Free Haven and asking around.\n"
"He must have a hideout somewhere in or near that town.\n"
"<Smiling> if you find where he’s living, be sure to check under the bed and in the closet– you’ll probably find him hiding under a pile of clothes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4639 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13285
msgid ""
"Ah!\n"
"My friends, you have returned with the package!\n"
"Well done!\n"
"Here is your reward money.\n"
"You have my full support at the council. <looking at the Prince> Welcome to my humble home, mighty Prince.\n"
"I have a room prepared just for you.\n"
"Guards!\n"
"Take him away."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:54 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:133
msgid ""
"We have offended the Ancients!\n"
"Why else would they call up the Mountain of Fire!\n"
"The Prophecies tell of a time when the oceans would boil!\n"
"This is the beginning of the end!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4647 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13307
msgid ""
"Your work in capturing the Prince of Thieves has been quite beneficial to me.\n"
"You have my full support on the High Council."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4649 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13311
msgid ""
"In addition to my duties as overseer of unlicensed business, I am the High Priest of Enroth.\n"
"It is my job to promote clerics to priests, and if warranted, priests to priests of light.\n"
"Right now, the rolls are full of priests, and I am unable to promote new ones without creating new positions.\n"
"To do so would be highly irregular, but if someone were to perform an extraordinary service for the kingdom, the promotion would be acceptable.\n"
"<Rubbing his temples> Come to think of it, there is a service I need.\n"
"A temple in Free Haven was destroyed by fire a few months ago.\n"
"If you could get it rebuilt, I would have a reason to promote any clerics among you to priest status.\n"
"Since I really want this job done, I am even willing to promote non-priests to an honorary priest status, and I will pay you well for your service.\n"
"You’ll need to hire a stonecutter and a carpenter and show them the temple you want them to work on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13318
msgid ""
"The temple I asked you to rebuild still stands in ruins.\n"
"The people are deprived of their rightful religious solace, and you return to me empty-handed.\n"
"Leave here and complete your mission!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13321
msgid ""
"Excellent work!\n"
"The temple has been rebuilt and the affront to the gods eased.\n"
"For this service, I am happy to promote all clerics to priests, and I grant honorary priest status to all non-clerics.\n"
"Congratulations! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4666 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13339
msgid ""
"It seems a bit quick to promote anyone to high priests, given that the promotion to priest has been so recent.\n"
"Why, many wait their entire lives to receive such a promotion, only to be granted it posthumously.\n"
"However, an extraordinary service could possibly accelerate that promotion to, well, right now for instance… and I do have such a service in mind.\n"
"The heretical monks that live on the islands east of Free Haven have stolen our sacred chalice.\n"
"Retrieve it from the monks and put it in the temple you rebuilt.\n"
"Then return to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4677 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13347
msgid ""
"You are successful!\n"
"It looks like I will have to keep my promise and make more irregular, early promotions.\n"
"I do so with pleasure.\n"
"I hereby promote all priests to high priests, and all honorary priests to honorary high priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4674 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13363
msgid ""
"I see that you have recovered the chalice!\n"
"Good work, but you still need to ensconce it in the temple.\n"
"Take it there at once and return to me for your promotion!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4672 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13365
msgid ""
"The monks still have the chalice, and our temple is still without it.\n"
"Why do you delay?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4681 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13370
msgid ""
"Though your rise to priest of light status was almost unseemly quick, I have never seen finer priests of light in all my years.\n"
"I am grateful for all you've done for myself and for Enroth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5015 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13374
msgid ""
"Hello there!\n"
"Are you here to tile the floors?\n"
"Oh!\n"
"Sorry, for a moment I forgot who you were!\n"
"Welcome again, arch mages!\n"
"Perhaps you can assist me in an experiment or two when you’re less busy?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4683 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13378
msgid ""
"This is %s, the month of %s.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of %s and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4685 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13383
msgid "You must wait until the new month to undergo a pilgrimage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4686 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13387
msgid "performed daring deeds"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5856 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13393
msgid ""
"You should probably show The Letter to Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:479 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5837 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13397
msgid ""
"You need to give The Letter to Regent Wilbur Humphrey in Ironfist Castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5840 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13402 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13407
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13412 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13417 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13422
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13427
msgid ""
"You must satisfy the six High Council members in Free Haven to visit the Oracle.\n"
"Each lord will request a task of you to earn their favor.\n"
"Perform each of these tasks and then talk to the Council member of that Lord to gain their approval.\n"
"Once all the members of the High Council give their permission, you will be allowed to visit the Oracle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5845 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13432
msgid ""
"It appears that Slicker Silvertongue is a traitor on the Council.\n"
"You will need proof to convince Regent Humphrey and have Slicker removed from the Council.\n"
"Go to the Superior Temple of Baa in Kriegspire and return with proof associating Slicker with the Temple of Baa."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5848 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13437
msgid ""
"The Oracle has been asleep since Archibald performed his mischief on it.\n"
"You will need the four memory crystals to revive the Oracle.\n"
"They can be found on Hermit's Isle, in Castle Alamos, in Castle Kriegspire, and in Castle Darkmoor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5851 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13443
msgid ""
"To gain access to the Control Center, you will need the Control Cube located in the Temple of VARN in Dragonsand.\n"
"Bring the Cube back to the Oracle to gain admittance into the Control Center.\n"
"The Kreegan reactor is immune to all attacks.\n"
"Only the ancient weapons from the Control Center will harm the reactor.\n"
"Make sure you have these weapons and the skill to use them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5858 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13448
msgid ""
"Before you destroy the reactor, you will need a spell capable of containing the resulting explosions.\n"
"You must free Archibald from his stone prison.\n"
"Talk to Nicolai and bring him the Third Eye– he will allow you to use Tanir's Bell to turn Archibald back to normal.\n"
"From there, you should be able to convince Archibald to give you the knowledge you need."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5862 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13453
msgid ""
"Now you must destroy the Kreegan Hive.\n"
"Destroy the reactor, defeat their queen, and make sure to escape with the Ritual of the Void and you will succeed in your task."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5864 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13457
msgid "You have no more need of my advice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:478 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5838 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13459
msgid ""
"I would advise that you perform the promotion quests for the six lords of Enroth until you have advanced a little further."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4691 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13480
msgid ""
"I sometimes have the worst trouble trying to remember things I’ve learned.\n"
"I’m not sure why this is, but I’ve discovered a way around the problem.\n"
"I am going to create a mirror that will allow me to look back in time, so that I can remember what it is I’ve forgotten.\n"
"To do this, I need the Hourglass of Time, but my duties and research prevent me from searching for the hourglass on my own.\n"
"The hourglass is said to be in a dark cavern up near area… <pauses a moment>\n"
"No, that was the Spear of Darkness…\n"
"where is the hourglass?\n"
"<pauses again>\n"
"I should be able to remember this.\n"
"<snaps his fingers>\n"
"Of course!\n"
"It’s buried in an old fort to the south of here.\n"
"I can offer you my support in the council if you will help me in creating my mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13488
msgid ""
"Now all I have to do is remember how to create the mirror.\n"
"I wrote down all the important parts so I wouldn’t forget how to do it.\n"
"<stops> Where did I put those notes?\n"
"<ponders for a minute> I must have left them somewhere obvious, maybe in the laboratory.\n"
"Anyway, your part in this is done, and again I thank you.\n"
"You will have my complete support in the council for this.\n"
"What were your names again? "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:329 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1349
msgid ""
"You return to us with the Sarcophagus of Korbu, but where are his remains? We cannot complete the act of reanimation without them!\n"
"Return to us when you have both the Sarcophagus and his remains!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4719 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13509 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13517
msgid ""
"The hourglass wasn’t there?\n"
"Oh, that’s right!\n"
"I knew I forgot something!\n"
"The key is in there!\n"
"You use the key to open the Forge of… <pauses>\n"
"Well, I can’t remember whose forge it is, but that is the resting place of the Hourglass of Time...I think.\n"
"It can’t hurt to look there, especially now that you’ve found the key.\n"
"<pauses>\n"
"At least I THINK that’s what the key opens.\n"
"Anyway, that forge or laboratory or whatever it is can be found on the islands north of New Sorpigal.\n"
"Good Luck!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:414 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1351 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1375
msgid ""
"We need to consult Korbu!\n"
"You have agreed to bring us his remains and his Sarcophagus!\n"
"Do not bother us until you have these items!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4709 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13511
msgid ""
"I’m still looking for the mirror. <pauses> I mean Hourglass… I keep getting those mixed up.\n"
"Did you try the dark cavern– no wait, it was the old fort south of here.\n"
"I always seem to mix those up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4730 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13521
msgid ""
"Thanks again for getting the hourglass for me!\n"
"If only I could remember where I put it.\n"
"<sighs>\n"
"You have my support in the council for as long as you need it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13529
msgid ""
"I am the magus responsible for\n"
"the promotion of sorcerers.\n"
"Though none of you are sorcerers, I’m a fair man.\n"
"If you are able to locate the Fountain of Magic, I’ll grant you honorary wizard status.\n"
"You won’t receive any benefits of the wizards’ training, but you will gain more respect in the eyes of sorcerers and wizards.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4734 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13532
msgid ""
"I am the magus in charge of training and promoting sorcerers.\n"
"Though powerful, sorcerer is not the pinnacle of the elemental magician.\n"
"Wizards take the knowledge and ability of a sorcerer, and hone those abilities to a sharper level.\n"
"They have greater magical potential than the sorcerer, and demand greater respect.\n"
"The way to earn this training, however, is not easy.\n"
"Find the Fountain of Magic, drink from its waters, and return here.\n"
"If you are able to do this, I will train you in the ways of the wizard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13536
msgid ""
"Don’t ask me for hints, I’ve already forgotten where the Fountain is.\n"
"I know this isn’t an easy task, but if it were not difficult, every sorcerer would already BE a wizard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4749 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13540
msgid ""
"You have done well in finding the Fountain.\n"
"It’s location and powers are a secret, do not spread its location around.\n"
"Now, let me show you the secrets of the wizard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4752 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13558
msgid ""
"Your training does not end with what you have learned as a wizard, one final step remains.\n"
"Master wizard status completes your mastery of elemental magic.\n"
"Building on your wizard training, master wizards have vast magical ability– the most efficient and skilled use of magic anywhere.\n"
"Earning this training requires a powerful artifact, owned by the powerful Arch Mage Drael-.. no, it was Frundir-… no, that’s not right either.\n"
"Actually, I can’t seem to remember what the artifact was or who owned it.\n"
"I'd remember it if I saw it, though.\n"
"I know it can be found in Corlagon’s Estate near the Mire of the Damned.\n"
"Search for it there and return it; I must have it to train you to become a master wizard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13566
msgid ""
"I’m sorry, but I still haven’t remembered exactly what it is you need.\n"
"I know you need to search Corlagon’s Estate.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13569
msgid ""
"Great news!\n"
"I remember what you need to find!\n"
"The Crystal of Terrax!\n"
"Oh, you seem to have found it already.\n"
"Well, perfect!\n"
"I can train you to master wizards, then.\n"
"The first arch mage, Terrax, used this Crystal to master the elements.\n"
"Fire, earth, water, and air all formed together to make it, and from analyzing it he learned a great deal about elemental magic.\n"
"In addition, its effect on light led him to his discoveries of light and dark magic.\n"
"Since that time, the study of this crystal has guided every new master wizard.\n"
"Let me show you the secrets of the crystal. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4774 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13589
msgid ""
"I don’t have much time to talk right now– I have a lot to do.\n"
"I’m in the process of organizing a few campaigns to attack the devils along the western coast.\n"
"You must realize, as I do, that nothing in all of Enroth poses as much of a threat to our safety as they do.\n"
"I only wish the other Lords would assist me by contributing supplies and troops, or just helping in the planning of these attacks.\n"
"They spend more time bickering amongst themselves over borders and laws and trade than in helping me deal with the REAL threat.\n"
"The devils have an advance post in Kriegspire near the Sentinels.\n"
"From here, they are able to base small raids and gather intelligence on our forces.\n"
"I need you to sneak in and attack it, find what information you can on the location of any devil strongholds and patrol patterns, and destroy the place.\n"
"Do not let any of the devils escape!\n"
"Surprise and secrecy are our greatest weapons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13597
msgid ""
"Did you fail in your mission?\n"
"You didn’t allow the demons to escape, did you?\n"
"That post MUST be destroyed for any large attack against them to be successful.\n"
"As long as that post exists, your mission still stands. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:19 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:136
msgid "Prophecies"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4792 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13600
msgid ""
"Good job!\n"
"With the information you’ve brought back, we now have the intelligence we need to stage an attack on the devils, and with that post out of the way, we can hit them when they won’t expect it. I give you my full support in the council– hopefully the council will actually DO something for once."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4794 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13622
msgid ""
"Excellent work in dispatching those devils!\n"
"Again, you have my thanks.\n"
"My support in the council is yours, at least until the threat of the devils is past.\n"
"Hopefully you can spur the council into action.\n"
"By the way, the information that you brought back has confirmed our suspicion about the enemy base.\n"
"It is definitely near the town of Sweet Water in Paradise Valley."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4806 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13631
msgid ""
"I am the Armsmaster in charge of the promotion of knights.\n"
"Unfortunately, none of you are knights, and therefore the skills I would teach you would be worthless.\n"
"However, if you so desire, you can attempt the task of a would-be cavalier.\n"
"Seek the nomination of a person of authority, a cavalier, for example, and return to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13634
msgid ""
"I am the Armsmaster in charge of the promotion of all knights in Enroth.\n"
"Worthy knights can be promoted to cavaliers.\n"
"Cavaliers embody the spirit of action and the power of purpose.\n"
"Behind their courageous example, armies charge into battle and enemies flee in terror. However, to become a cavalier, you need to be nominated by a person of authority.\n"
"If you could get the nomination of a cavalier, that would be good enough for me.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4810 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13638
msgid ""
"Well there, you’re looking for a nomination to become cavaliers?\n"
"I was once a valiant knight in my day.\n"
"I fought with Roland in the Succession wars, though now I’m too old to do much good on the battlefield.\n"
"It’s good to see Osric keeping the traditions of the knights alive.\n"
"Tell him that I proudly nominate you to become cavaliers, and if he gives you any trouble tell him to come see me himself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4815 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13644
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"I know you’ll make fine cavaliers.\n"
"I only wish I had my youth again to serve with Osric in a campaign against the devils."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4818 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13649
msgid ""
"Come now!\n"
"A person of your fame and stature should have no problem being nominated.\n"
"Don’t tell me your fame is contrived– are you sure you deserve to be as famous as you are?\n"
"<laughs>\n"
"I’m jesting, calm down.\n"
"Seriously, I'd suggest looking in Free Haven or the village of Rockham.\n"
"I've heard a few cavaliers frequent the taverns there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4825 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13653
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"The nomination may not seem important, but we have a tradition that must be followed for this promotion.\n"
"As a cavalier, you need to understand that the traditions and values of the people need to be defended.\n"
"I gladly promote you to the rank of cavalier!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:361 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1367
msgid ""
"Thank you for finding the Prophecies of the Sun.\n"
"May the Sun always light you way and provide you with protection!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4829 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13672
msgid ""
"Ah, worthy cavaliers, the final step in your training is to become a champion.\n"
"A cavalier is a brave and noble warrior, but a champion is a power to behold.\n"
"No force can stand between the champion and victory.\n"
"Entire campaigns are decided on the bravery, decisiveness, and powerful example of the champion.\n"
"The task to complete this promotion, however, is difficult.\n"
"You must defeat a powerful enemy to prove your ability and determination.\n"
"The only enemy worthy of this task is a man known only as the Warlord, a dangerous and powerful warrior.\n"
"He commands a legion of evil knights, normally based to the northeast of\n"
"Icewind Pass.\n"
"Defeat him, bring back proof of your victory, and your promotion to champion is assured."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4839 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13680
msgid ""
"You’re not scared of the Warlord, are you?\n"
"His terror needs to be put to an end.\n"
"You can’t become champion hiding underneath your bed or standing around looking at the walls– you need to go out and DO it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13683
msgid ""
"Good job!\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"I wasn’t sure you’d make it back alive.\n"
"Kergmond had more potential than I realized, but you’re certainly more than a match for an army of Kergmonds.\n"
"You’ve proven yourselves worthy of the rank of champion. You must not be afraid to take up arms to defend what is right.\n"
"May your enemies fear your approach and your allies rally behind your courage. And now, I promote you to the rank of champion! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:58 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:137
msgid ""
"There are many Prophecies that tell of the destruction of Jadame and the entire world!\n"
" Most tell of a time when the world will be consumed by that which created it.\n"
"Perhaps the Ancients have decided to wipe us all out!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5011 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13703
msgid ""
"Well met, champions!\n"
"Please, don’t waste your valuable time or mine in times like this.\n"
"Use your skills for the good of Enroth and leave me to my planning!\n"
"When this battle is over, THEN we can share tales of valor and skill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4848 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13707
msgid ""
"Memory Crystal Alpha – Hermit’s Isle.Memory Crystal Beta – Alamos.Memory Crystal Delta – Darkmoor.Memory Crystal Epsilon – Kriegspire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:363 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1371
msgid ""
"You returned Korbu to us, and we will always be in your debt!\n"
"Now leave me, so that I may consult the elders!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4849 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13716
msgid ""
"Place the memory Crystals into the modules above.\n"
"All four Crystals are necessary to activate the Oracle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4862 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13730
msgid ""
"You now have access to the Control Center.\n"
"Simply ask to be transported and I will oblige.\n"
"One warning however– the guardians of the Control Center are no longer under my control, so please exercise caution while visiting the Center."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13733 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13742
msgid ""
"I am Melian, Guardian of Enroth.\n"
"Thank you for replacing my memory modules.\n"
"Archibald took them from here when I refused to give him any help in his battle for succession.\n"
"Your timing is impeccable.\n"
"The Kreegan have invaded our world, and you must try and stop them.\n"
"Unfortunately, Archibald’s attempts at extracting information from me have damaged me enough that I cannot help you directly now.\n"
"Instead, I can only give you advice.While most of the Kreegan can be slain with ordinary weapons and spells, the elite guards and upper echelon breeders have tougher skin and natural defenses that protect them from anything but very powerful weapons.\n"
"In the planetary control center beneath me are the weapons and armor you will need to survive battle with the enemy.\n"
"My orders, however, will only permit passage to someone with a Control Cube.\n"
"My instruments tell me that the only Control Cube left in Enroth can be found somewhere underground in Dragonsand.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4865 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13749
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13754
msgid ""
"As I said, the Kreegan are resistant to most of the weapons available in Enroth, but not all.\n"
"To rid the world of them, you will need to find where their vessel crashed and destroy the main reactor.\n"
"The only problem is that the resulting explosions from the reactor will destroy this planet.\n"
"You will need a powerful spell to prevent the explosion from damaging the planet, but no spell like that exists in the world today.\n"
"The only person I can think of that would know of such a spell is Archibald, but he is in no condition to teach you.\n"
"To make matters worse, the reactor cannot be harmed by normal weapons or spells– you will need the ancient weapons in the Control Center to destroy the reactor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4871 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13759
msgid ""
"Though my memory has been damaged by Archibald, I can still remember the danger that our ancient enemy, the Kreegan, pose to our world.\n"
"The Kreegan first appeared roughly 1500 years ago, attacking outlying colonies and stealing their resources.\n"
"It was thought at the time they simply needed certain minerals, and could be reasoned with, but this was not the case.\n"
"Their life cycle forces them to breed until the world cannot support their numbers, then they send ships off to other worlds to renew the cycle.\n"
"Their attacks against the empire of the Ancients disrupted the network of shipping and communications that held us all together, causing the Silence that marks the first year of our modern calendar.\n"
"Without support from the homeworlds, our fledgling technology failed, bringing us to this sorry state.\n"
"I would help rebuild our technology, but I seem to have become a religious figure in the minds of many people, and very few visit me or understand what I have to offer.\n"
"Perhaps this Kreegan crisis we face will bring people to their senses--as long as we survive it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4879 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13763
msgid ""
"I happen to know that you are amongst a short list of adventurers looking to receive favor from the High Council.\n"
"What you want it for I don’t know, nor do I care.\n"
"I’ll be blunt:\n"
"I love money, and I want more.\n"
"Much more.\n"
"I have a plan to fix the price of shipping in my favor for a time and I need competent agents to carry it out.\n"
"Perform this task well and I will give you my support, not to mention a lot of money.\n"
"Here is the plan:\n"
"Each of the nine shipping companies in the Kingdom must be convinced to charge at least 48 gold per pound per mile of material they transport.\n"
"They are all in competition and they know it, so none will want to make a move before the others.\n"
"I don’t care how you convince them– just get the job done and report back to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4890 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13771
msgid ""
"Not all of the companies have agreed to raise their prices!\n"
"Why do you return only to report incompetence?\n"
"There are large profits I could be reaping if you had done your job and convinced these idiots to raise their prices!\n"
"MUST I DO THIS MYSELF?\n"
"Should I send someone else?\n"
"Why do I surround myself with MORONS?!\n"
"So far I have lost a lot of gold because you haven’t finished your job!\n"
"I’ll deduct these losses from your final payment, you can be sure of that!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13774
msgid ""
"At last!\n"
"Thought you would never finish.\n"
"Maybe you’re good for something after all.\n"
"You have won my support in the council, and of course, your payment. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:427 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1379
msgid ""
"Bastian Loudrin has been a great friend to the guild. Sadly, I must refuse his request at this time. Even as we speak, my guild is embroiled in a battle for its very survival. For you see, the Temple of the Sun has declared a holy war on us. Most of our members are away in the fields either leading armies or raising zombies to serve in them.I wish I could say otherwise, but the accursed temple holds the upper hand. If only the balance would tilt in our favor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4902 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13815
msgid ""
"If you're concerned about the suffering of the peasants over my price increase, don't be.\n"
"I did it all for a good cause.\n"
"I needed to raise money for granaries to store the excess grain we are harvesting this year.\n"
"The shipping prices are back down, and the availability of cheap, high quality grain more than makes up for it.\n"
"There!\n"
"I'm not so horrible, am I?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4908 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13819
msgid ""
"Although it may be hard to believe, I happen to be one of the top druids in the land.\n"
"As such I am empowered to promote druids to great and arch druid status, provided they prove themselves worthy.\n"
"To be promoted to great druid status, you must perform the Ceremony of the Sun.\n"
"Pray at the center of the Circle of Stone during any equinox or solstice– March 20th, June 21st, September 23rd, or December 21st.\n"
"If you are there at that time, I will contact you magically and lead you through the Ceremony, thus promoting you to great druid.\n"
"Those among you who are not druids will be granted honorary great druid status, and I am sure the experience will be worthwhile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4914 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13825
msgid ""
"You must pray at the center of the Circle of Stone during an equinox or solstice to complete the Ceremony of the Sun and be promoted to great druid.\n"
"There is nothing I can do for you to be promoted until then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4924 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13829
msgid ""
"So, you believe you are deserving of the title of arch druid.\n"
"You must complete the Ceremony of the Moon to achieve arch druid status.\n"
"This used to be rather easy before the factional split amongst the last generation of druids, but now you must fight your way to the sacred altar.\n"
"It is in the Temple of the Moon, currently controlled by the evil heretic Cedric Druthers.\n"
"There is no way they will just let you complete the ceremony peacefully, so you will probably have to fight your way in.\n"
"Like the Ceremony of the Sun, the Ceremony of the Moon must be performed at a certain place and time.\n"
"Pray at the Altar of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon at midnight during any full moon.\n"
"If you are there at that time, I will contact you magically and lead you through the Ceremony."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4939 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13835
msgid ""
"You must be standing before the altar of the Moon at midnight on any full moon to complete the Ceremony of the Moon and be promoted to arch druid.\n"
"There is nothing I can do for you to be promoted until then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13839
msgid ""
"The earth is wounded in the west.\n"
"I can feel it, my fellow druids, and if you put your hand to the ground and listen with your heart, you'll feel it, too.\n"
"I am bound here with my responsibilities, but I urge you to investigate the source of this pain.\n"
"I am sure the wound and the Night of Shooting Stars are related.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4946 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13843
msgid ""
"I grow tired of winter.\n"
"In my lands, winter seems to last year round.\n"
"As a matter of fact, for the last few years, summer didn’t arrive at all.\n"
"I have come to believe that something is wrong with the weather, and I want something done about it.\n"
"I know your reputation, and I hear you can do anything.\n"
"I have a deal for you.\n"
"End the winter in my land and I will give you my support in the High Council when it comes time for you to ask for it.\n"
"If it's any help at all, I hear there is hermit on a mountaintop somewhere west of here who has studied the weather in detail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4954 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13850
msgid ""
"Do you think you could hurry this miracle thing along?\n"
"The snow on the ground is building up, and we are going to have to start putting buildings on stilts!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13854
msgid ""
"I was looking out my window when the weather broke and the snow vanished!\n"
"A miracle!\n"
"A genuine miracle!\n"
"You have done my people and me a great service.\n"
"<Slapping his chest> Count Erik Von Stromgard as your friend forever!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4962 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13875
msgid ""
"For your services, I grant you my favor in the High Council!\n"
"Long may you live, O enemies of Winter!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4964 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13879
msgid ""
"20 years ago, I won the annual archery competition held at Castle Ironfist, and I have held the championship ever since.\n"
"This gives me the right to promote archers to the title of warrior mage and master archer as I see fit.\n"
"I’ll grant the title of warrior mage to all the archers amongst you if you do me a little favor. I need the key to the old Dragon Towers set up near every major settlement in Enroth to shoot down flying creatures.\n"
"I think that they can be set to shoot down only monsters, instead of shooting anything flying through the air. Since this is something of a pet project, I will reward honorary warrior mage status to the rest of you.\n"
"The key is in my old keep near the southern entrance to my lands.\n"
"I had to leave it there when the ogres and their companions took it from me a few years ago.\n"
"Return with that key and be rewarded.\n"
"And I won’t be crying in my beer if you kill a lot of those monsters while you’re at it.\n"
"They took my keep!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13887
msgid ""
"No key—No reward.\n"
"Our deal is simple and straightforward.\n"
"Fetch the key from my old keep and return once you have it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4977 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13890
msgid ""
"Very good!\n"
"You got the key, and hopefully slew a large number of those loathsome beasts.\n"
"I hereby promote all archers to the status of warrior mage, and all non-archers to honorary warrior mage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4980 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13908
msgid ""
"The reason I wanted the key was to open the Dragon Towers and make the adjustments to prevent them from shooting flyers indiscriminately.\n"
"There is a way to adjust the towers to shoot at only large objects, and I want all of them adjusted for the good of the Kingdom.\n"
"Magic is becoming more common, as are stories of young Sorcerers getting shot from the sky because they didn’t know the function of the towers.\n"
"You have the key.\n"
"If you adjust all of the towers to shoot at only large objects, I will promote all warrior mages amongst you to master archers and promote any honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4996 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13914
msgid ""
"Welcome, master archers!\n"
"You may warm yourself by my hearth any time!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4998 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13918
msgid ""
"I like it up here.\n"
"It’s as though I can watch the world turn from up high and all alone.\n"
"Serene.\n"
"Untouchable.\n"
"Almost…Prophetic.\n"
"I can see the clouds churn and travel, break apart and mix together.\n"
"I can predict the weather almost perfectly.\n"
"<Smiling> Right now, I predict more snow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5006 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13922
msgid ""
"So, Stromgard needs a miracle with the weather, eh?\n"
"All this time I thought he was the one responsible for making it snow continually.\n"
"I can break the enchantment on the weather easily, and if you hurry back to him, I’m sure you can claim responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5009 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13929
msgid ""
"As grateful as I am for your company, I am, in fact, a hermit.\n"
"I'm sure you have plenty of important things to do and don't need to be cluttering up my house any longer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5041 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13933
msgid ""
"Curses!\n"
"Foiled again!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4985 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13943 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13967
msgid ""
"Hmm.\n"
"Not all of the towers have been reset.\n"
"They are easy to find, if a bit long in getting to.\n"
"The easiest is in Whitecap to the west of us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13946
msgid ""
"I knew my faith in you was well placed!\n"
"You have fixed a major problem in our kingdom, not to mention doing yourself a favor—It’s now safe to fly above towns.\n"
"It is my pleasure to promote all warrior mages to master archers, and all honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:428 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1396
msgid ""
"If we had the Nightshade Brazier back in our possession, Shadowspire's defense would not be an issue. We could bring this war to the doors of the Sun Temple. We would annihilate them!Knowing its importance, the clerics keep the brazier in a secure chamber deep within their temple. Dyson Leland believes he can gain access to that chamber. Bring him to the temple, recover the brazier and return it to me. You want me in your alliance? Well, do this for me, and I will be in your debt.If you have any questions about the Nightshade Brazier ask Thant. It was he who created the thing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5135 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13971
msgid ""
"Slicker Silvertongue refused my order?\n"
"This must be treason!\n"
"Still, I've known him so long, and he's never disobeyed an order before…perhaps he is suffering from delusions.\n"
"Yes, that's it.\n"
"He's been spending so much time investigating that horrible Baa cult that it's affected his mind– I even found one of their cloaks in his room.\n"
"Perhaps you can find a cure for him.\n"
"They must surely know what they've done to him!\n"
"I would start at their headquarters east of Castle Kriegspire.\n"
"Here, take the cloak– perhaps you can find some use for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5144 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13980
msgid ""
"Oh, my!\n"
"It appears that Slicker Silvertongue really is a traitor!\n"
"Who ever would have guessed it?\n"
"You've done a good thing, bringing this letter to me.\n"
"Take it to High Council immediately so we can be rid of this wicked traitor for once and for all!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5149 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13984 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13989
msgid ""
"Please hurry in your quest to find Slicker Silvertongue's cure!\n"
"I am sure the poor man must be suffering horribly under their dreadful mind control spell!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:13999
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Circus of the Sun!\n"
"We have a variety of games for your amusement.\n"
"You can take the prizes you win from the various games and trade them in here for either kegs of wine or golden pyramids.\n"
"You need at least 10 points to get a keg of wine, and 30 or more points will win you a golden pyramid.\n"
"In case you didn't know, each lodestone is worth 1 point, each harpy feather is worth 3 points, and each four leaf clover is worth 5 points.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5164 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:14015
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You win a golden pyramid!\n"
"Good work– remember there are no limits on the prizes, so keep playing!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:429 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1403
msgid ""
"I will not join you until the security of the guild is secure. Bring me the Nightshade Brazier from the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods. We will talk again of alliance after that is done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5161 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:14037
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You win a keg of wine!\n"
"There are no limits on the prizes here, so keep playing!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5159 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:14048
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but you don't have 10 points yet.\n"
"Why don't you try a few more games?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:756 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:99
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1406
msgid "Dyson Leland"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:430 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1407
msgid ""
"Early on our conflict, the Sun Temple attempted to infiltrate our ranks with a spy. Such foolishness--thinking they could so easily deceive a host of dark magicians!It was child's play to unmask their agent--one \"Dyson Leland.\" Since then we have turned him against his former masters, or so it would seem. Frankly, I don't entirely trust in his loyalty. Still, he has proven useful. As long as he does, we will continue to let him live."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5167 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:14162
msgid ""
"Welcome!\n"
"To play my game, simply pay 50 gold and step right up to compete against me.\n"
"Depending on how well you do you can win either a lodestone, a harpy feather, or a four leaf clover.\n"
"If you do poorly, you win nothing.\n"
"You can trade in your lodestones, feathers, and clovers in the main tent."
msgstr ""

