#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:201 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:236 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:271
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:306
msgid "Thanks for the potion!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1721 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5586 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5632
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5678 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5724 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5770
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5816 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:135 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:170
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:205 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:240 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:275
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:310
msgid ""
"I an defenseless against the onslaught of the sea of fire!\n"
"I need a Potion of Fire Resistance!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1384 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:56
msgid ""
"What with the damage caused by giant waves, falling rocks and the pirate raid, I don't know if our village will ever be the same. I know you have done great things for us, but not everything can be fixed once broken. I'm not sure what we'll do. Perhaps we will rebuild, or maybe we'll leave. Time and circumstance will decide."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1719 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5609 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5655
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5701 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5793
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5839 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:158 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:193
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:228 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:263 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:298
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:333
msgid ""
"Thanks for the potion, but others in the area are without protection!\n"
"Be sure to deliver a potion to them as well!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:48 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:563
msgid "Vilebite"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:161 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:564
msgid ""
"Vilebite was a good son. I will miss him. But at least I can take comfort knowing that he is at peace. Thank you for your kind and heroic deed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:105 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:107 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:49
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:66 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:97
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1378 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1461 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1502
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:567 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:867 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:921
msgid "Alliance"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:201 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:568
msgid ""
"\"An alliance to unite Jadame,\" you say. If it wasn't Lordrin who was proposing it, I would normally have slain you for my supper.While intriguing, I cannot consider the idea now. We are under daily attack by the accursed knights of Charles Quixote. If he were not a problem, I could do as Lordrin asks.Perhaps you could help me with Quixote?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:524 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:896 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:525
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:897 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:581 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5853
msgid "Guild of Bounty Hunters"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1466 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5855
msgid ""
"Greetings Novice Bounty Hunter! The Guild of Bounty Hunters serves the public by paying qualified individuals a fee for eliminating the threat of certain creatures or bandits in the realm of Jadame.\n"
"To achieve the rank of Journeyman Bounty Hunter you will have to earn a total bounty of 30,000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1492 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5858
msgid ""
"Greetings Journeyman Bounty Hunter! The Guild of Bounty Hunters serves the public by paying qualified individuals a fee for eliminating the threat of certain creatures or bandits in the realm of Jadame.\n"
"To achieve the rank of Master Bounty Hunter you will have to earn a total bounty of 70,000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1567 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5861
msgid ""
"Greetings Master Bounty Hunter! The Guild of Bounty Hunters thanks you for your services to all of Jadame. We are at your disposal!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1408 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5863
msgid ""
"The Guild of Bounty Hunters serves the public by paying qualified individuals a fee for eliminating the threat of certain creatures or bandits in the realm of Jadame.\n"
"To achieve the rank of Novice Bounty Hunter you will have to earn 10,000 gold worth of bounties."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:582 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5867
msgid "Bounty!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1748 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5871
msgid "You have not gathered sufficient bounties to allow us to promote you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1751 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5874
msgid ""
"You currently hold the rank of Master Bounty Hunter! This is the highest rank of our guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1750 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5887
msgid ""
"You currently hold the rank of Journeyman Bounty Hunter, but lack sufficient bounty to be promoted to Master."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1749 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5897
msgid ""
"You currently hold the rank of Novice Bounty Hunter, but lack sufficient bounty to be promoted to Journeyman."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:16 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:9
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:120 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:59 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:68
msgid "Portals of Stone"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:203 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:590
msgid ""
"If you want me to join your alliance, you will have to help me against Charles Quixote. Bring me the Dragon egg he stole from me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:584 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:601 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5905
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6094
msgid "Arcomage Tournament"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1294 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5906 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6108
msgid ""
"To be declared Arcomage Champion, you must win a game of Arcomage in every tavern on, in, and under the continent of Jadame.\n"
"There are 11 such taverns sponsoring Arcomage events.\n"
"When you have accomplished this, return to me to claim the prize."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:585 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5911
msgid "Cleric Necromancer War"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1753 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5913
msgid ""
"Through your delivery of the Nightshade Brazier into their hands, the Necromancers' Guild has come out on top in their war with the Temple of the Sun. The artifact's magic creates a permanent shadow of darkness which surrounds the Shadowspire region. Under this cover, vampires defend the land both day and night. This has allowed the guild to field larger forces of skeletons, zombies and other undead against the temple's armies. Each report I receive puts the heart of the battle closer and closer to the Sun Temple's doorstep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1754 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5916
msgid ""
"Because you have destroyed the Necromancers' Guild Skeleton Transformer, the Temple of the Sun has come out on top in their war with the guild. The skeletons created by the device made up the bulk of the guild's reinforcements. Without these, the necromancers' forces crumble before the temple's advance. Each report I receive puts the heart of the battle closer to the Necromancers' Guild doorstep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1752 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5918
msgid ""
"Lying as they do on opposite ends of the Light to Dark spectrum, relationships between the Necromancers' Guild and the Temple of the Sun have never been the best, but now they battle openly. Oskar Tyre, head priest of the Temple says a holy vision drove him to declare war on the guild so as to rid Jadame of the taint of darkness.Both groups are relative newcomers to our continent. The guild has set up its foothold in Shadowspire, and the First (and only) Sun Temple of Jadame is in Murmurwoods."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:586 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5922
msgid "Dragon Hunters"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1756 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5924
msgid ""
"It seems Charles Quixote's Dragon hunting operation in Garrote Gorge has almost completely wiped out Garrote Gorge's Dragon population. I'm sure once their done, those mountains will be safer to travel. Still, I wonder what Jadame will be like without Dragons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1757 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5927
msgid ""
"By recovering Deftclaw Redreaver's heir for him, you've allowed him to safely attack Charles Quixote's camp. Dragon hunters operate by isolating members of their prey. They just aren't prepared to face Dragons in number! Needless to say, the camp's production of Dragon goods has dwindled to a trickle. A pity. The guild used to turned a good profit off them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1755 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5929
msgid ""
"The renown Dragon slayer, Charles Quixote of Erathia, has set up a hunting expedition in Garrote Gorge. This is no \"safari,\" in fact, it's the largest operation of this type I've heard of. The hunters have a permanent base from which they sell hides, eggs, baby dragons, and other items. Garrote Gorge has always had a large Dragon population, but I imagine they must be facing extinction--so efficient are Quixote's hunters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:587 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5933
msgid "Minotaurs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1758 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5935
msgid ""
"The Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair in Ravage Roaming are a proud culture. Their recent defeat of the Vori Frost Giants has, if anything, made them even more fiercely independent--more sure of their ability to face any task alone. Still, I have told the guild that they would make great allies, both to face the current crisis and later as trade partners."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1759 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5938
msgid ""
"By rescuing the Balthazar Lair Minotaurs, you have ingratiated them to yourselves and by extension, to our guild. Even through the crisis, trade relations with them have improved immeasurably. Once maters of the cataclysm are resolved, I'm sure we will see a tidy profit--a direct result from your good work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1892 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:594
msgid ""
"Now that I need not fear my heir's destruction. I will visit my revenge on Quixote. His camp will face the assault of fire and claw. Those who have hunted us are now our prey animals.As for your alliance…you have done me a great service. I will honor my debt. As soon as I've set my enemies to flight or the beyond, I will join the alliance council in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:588 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5941
msgid "A bridge too far?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1764 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5943
msgid ""
"With the bridges destroyed by the eruption of the mountain of fire, we cannot get to the boat dock!\n"
"We are cut off from the mainland!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1766 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5946
msgid ""
"You have repaired the Portals of Stone?\n"
"We are all in your debt.\n"
"If only it was safe to travel through the Abandoned Temple!\n"
"Well, at least we can attempt to get to the boat dock through there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:589 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5949
msgid "Travel between the Islands"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1779 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5951
msgid ""
"We used to travel freely between the islands using the bridges.\n"
"These bridges were destroyed when the mountain of fire erupted.\n"
"Many families are trapped on the outer islands.\n"
"We don’t even know if the people who live there are still alive."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1783 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5954
msgid ""
"With the Portals of Stone repaired, we can at least check on the outer islands and those who live there.\n"
"We are in your debt for fixing the Portals of Stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:590 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5957
msgid "The boat dock"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1785 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5959
msgid ""
"The boat dock on the northernmost island is the only way to travel between Dagger Wound and the mainland.\n"
"With the bridges destroyed, we cannot get to the boat dock and those arriving from Ravenshore cannot get to the village of Blood Drop!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1787 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5962
msgid ""
"We can get to the boat docks?\n"
"But we have to go through the Abandoned Temple?\n"
"Well that's something.\n"
"At least we can get to the boats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1773 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5966
msgid ""
"Did you know I was their captive for over six years? At first, I thought they were devils from hell, but now I am not so sure. They looked like devils surely, but did not act as demons. No, I think they were but another type of monstrous race, like ogres or goblins. Regardless, devils or not, I am glad the world is rid of them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1774 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5970
msgid ""
"Catherine and I have had dealings with these \"lords\" of the elemental planes. I've never trusted them, and now it seems I am right. They were our recent allies against the Kreegans, but a few months later, we find ourselves at war with them here! In both cases I understand neither their reasons for helping or hindrance. They are fickle beings at best...\"treacherous\" is perhaps a better word for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1775 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5974
msgid ""
"I must say I'm looking forward to returning to my lands of Enroth. It has been so long since I've seen them, or my son, Prince Nicolai. He was just a lad when I saw him last and now he is nearly grown. Sir Humphrey was a good choice for regent, but the land has been too long without its king at the reins of state."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:594 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5977
msgid "Erathia"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1776 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5978
msgid ""
"After we defeated the Kreegans in Erathia, I abdicated my throne into the regenthood of one of my generals, Morgan Kendal. I have left in his capable hands the task of choosing Erathia's new ruler. I'm sure this seems to be much to give up, but I am first and foremost, the queen of Enroth. We were sailing for there when the cataclysm struck, drawing us here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1777 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5982
msgid ""
"The Kreegans? They are no more; I am sure of it. After we put down Lucifer Kreegan, my armies scoured Eofol searching for any signs of their continued existence. We found none. No, the Kreegan infestation of our world is eliminated."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:596 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5985
msgid "Elementals"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1778 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5986
msgid ""
"I fought alongside elementals in our campaigns against the Kreegan. I found them stalwart and loyal. I know Roland disagrees, but I cannot call their hostility here a case of fickleness. No, I think something else drives them to attack us--magic perhaps? You should speak with our sage, Xanthor. He has been studying the Destroyer's crystal. I'm sure he's come up with some theory by now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:505 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:598 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5989
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global_mmmerge_ore_smiths.lua:48 assets_dev/engine/events/Global_mmmerge_ore_smiths.lua:51
msgid "Make Weapon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1285 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5993 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5998
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6003 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6008 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6013
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6018
msgid ""
"Here's your weapon. If you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more weapons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:31 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:60
msgid ""
"In time long past, my people used the Portals of Stone to travel quickly from island to island, but we have lost the knowledge of their operation. Only the pair connecting the village to the southwestern fields still functions. Now that the bridges are gone, we're trapped on the island!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:506 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:599 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6024
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global_mmmerge_ore_smiths.lua:49 assets_dev/engine/events/Global_mmmerge_ore_smiths.lua:52
msgid "Make Armor"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1288 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6028 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6033
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6038 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6043 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6048
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6053
msgid ""
"Here's your armor. If you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more armor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:507 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:600 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6059
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global_mmmerge_ore_smiths.lua:50 assets_dev/engine/events/Global_mmmerge_ore_smiths.lua:53
msgid "Make Item"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1291 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6063 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6068
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6073 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6078 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6083
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6088
msgid ""
"Here is your item. If you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more items."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1299 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6096
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You have become the Arcomage Champion!\n"
"The prize is waiting in the chest right outside my house."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1297 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6106
msgid ""
"You must claim a victory at ALL 11 taverns.\n"
"Until you do, you cannot be declared Arcomage Champion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:602 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:603 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:654
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:655 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:656 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:657
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6113
msgid "Rock Spire"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1792 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6116 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6175
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6187 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6199
msgid ""
"You say you will find me the cheeses I desire, but here you are returned, empty-handed! Do not waste my precious time! Bring me cheese--Frelandeau, Eldenbrie and Dunduck! Do not return until you have them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1791 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6124 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6141
msgid ""
"I have traveled to these lands to catalog its array of available cheese. My task is nearly complete, but there are yet three cheeses I have yet to sample. These are Frelandeau, Eldenbrie and Dunduck. I would reward highly any who could locate these rare and reputedly tasty culinary gems for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:658 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6127
msgid "My Life"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1796 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6129
msgid ""
"Even as a lad I knew I had a special relationship with cheese. Why, my first memory is of nibbling a bit of farmer's cheddar from my mother's hand! From that day I knew it would be my passion to eat cheese, to know all of the endless variety of its tasty wonderment, and to search the world for rare and exotic cheese-stuff. And so have I made my life...and destiny."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1797 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6132
msgid ""
"With the cheeses you have brought me, I have now eaten all of the world's known cheeses. Now none can say that I, Asael Fromago, am not history's most eminent connoisseur of cheese! None can compare to my glory! Ha-ha-ha…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:659 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6135
msgid "Vori Cheese Masters"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1795 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6136
msgid ""
"There are no people more dedicated to cheesecraft than the august cheese masters of Vori. Otherwise known to be rather barbaric, the Vori Frost Giants are true emblems of the potential of civilized development--at least as far as cheese making is concerned. Did you know that they have forty-two different words for \"cheese.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:202 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:615
msgid ""
"Last month one of Quixote's raiding parties invaded our caves. They slew many and took with them the egg containing my unborn heir. While those foul slayers hold the egg, we cannot attack their encampment.If you were to return the egg to me, I could destroy Quixote. Do this for me and I will join your alliance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1794 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6151
msgid ""
"Excellent! Give me the cheeses! I must consume them!Ah….munch munch….frelandeau, exquisite….mmmm, and eldenbrie, wondrously smoky…and hmmm, dunduck…well, that's not very nice, is it?You have made my Jadamean cheese cataloging safari a success! I can die a happy man! You have the humble thanks of a man of cheese. And here is your promised reward!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1793 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6167 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6170
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6173 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6179 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6182
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6185 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6191 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6194
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6197
msgid ""
"Very good, you have found me some of the cheese I seek. But now I have my heart set on a full cheese tasting with all three cheeses eaten at once so I can savor them in comparison. Come back when you have then all. I will not take what you have now. I don't think I could resist sampling what you leave--and then the cheese tasting would be ruined!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:51 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:620
msgid "Cure for Blazen Stormlance"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:661 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6203
msgid "The Stranger"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1798 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6204
msgid ""
"The night the stranger came through here was the same night that the crystal erupted in the center of town.\n"
"I only caught a glimpse of the stranger.\n"
"He didn’t appear the potent mage that he was.\n"
"I was not in the town square when he summoned the crystal, but I did see the flash of light that traveled across the sky.\n"
"It was truly a terrible night."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:662 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6207
msgid "Night of the Crystal"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1803 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6208
msgid ""
"A wanderer came into town.\n"
"Several ruffians sought to relieve this traveler of whatever wealth he possibly possessed. The wanderer barely paid any of them much notice.\n"
"With a small flick of his wrist all fell before him.\n"
"Then he walked to the town square and summoned the giant crystal that you'll find there today."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:186 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:621
msgid ""
"The Gem of Restoration may cure the knight, Blazen Stormlance, of what you say has befallen him.\n"
"There is no love lost between the Temple of the Sun and the Guild of Necromancers; any opponent of theirs is definitely a friend of ours.\n"
"Restore Stormlance to life so that he may rejoin Charles Quixote."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1807 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6212
msgid ""
"There is an ancient saying among the Dark Elf people,\n"
"\"a thing lives only as long as the last person who remembers it.\"\n"
"The events the night the crystal burst forth into our lives will live for a very long time.\n"
"Many of us saw the events of that night.\n"
"The mage who summoned forth the crystal said not one word to anyone us.\n"
"When he looked upon us, it seemed that all there was in his heart and eyes was pity."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:664 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6215
msgid "Wandering Mage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1813 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6216
msgid ""
"When the mage came into town I didn’t think much of it.\n"
"This is Ravenshore.\n"
"Everyone who travels the roads of Jadame comes through here at some time or another.\n"
"I guess I should have paid more attention to him.\n"
"Seems he caused quite a stir in the town square."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:665 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6219
msgid "Pirate Raids"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1818 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6220
msgid ""
"The Pirates of Regna own the seas.\n"
"No one can stand against them!\n"
"Several years ago, some fishing boat captains thought that they could sail to Erathia to get help dealing with the pirates.\n"
"We never saw or heard from them again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:666 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6223
msgid "Regnans"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1822 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6224
msgid ""
"The Regnans are the worst slime to ever set foot on the shore of Jadame. They keep the peoples of this continent from trading with Erathia and Enroth.\n"
"What choice do we have?\n"
"Even the Merchants of Alvar couldn’t muster a fleet to deal with the pirates.\n"
"Rumor says that there are smugglers around that have found ways around the pirate blockades."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:667 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6227
msgid "Empire of the Endless Ocean"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1826 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6228
msgid ""
"The Regnans call themselves the Empire of the Endless Ocean--trying to make more of themselves than there really is.\n"
"All they are is bullies and bandits.\n"
"Of course, don’t tell them that I said that!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:668 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6231
msgid "Ogres and Bandits"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1829 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6232
msgid ""
"Over the last few weeks there have been reports of bandits and Ogres robbing travelers on all of the major roads of Jadame. Times just seem to be getting worse.\n"
"Between the Regnan Pirates and these bandits it seems that no one is safe to travel by any means."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:669 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6235
msgid "Overland Travel"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1831 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6236
msgid ""
"Several of the warriors got together to go take care of the ogres that were camping on the road to Ravenshore.\n"
"That’s when we first had word of the fortress they were constructing to the southwest of here.\n"
"Since the fortress was completed the roads to the south and west have not been safe."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:670 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6239
msgid "Smugglers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1834 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6240
msgid ""
"The Smuggler of Jadame may be a myth, but I think not.\n"
"The Merchants of Alvar seem to be able to send small amounts of goods away across the sea to Erathia and Enroth.\n"
"Yet they own no boats of their own.\n"
" This would seem to support the idea that there really are smugglers.\n"
"Now why they work for the merchants is beyond the likes of me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:671 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6243
msgid "Wererats!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1839 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6244
msgid ""
"Wererats!\n"
"They are the worst of scum!\n"
"The pick through our trash at night!\n"
"Always scurrying around in the dark!\n"
"Never seen when the sun is up.\n"
"Gives one the shivers it does!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:672 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6247
msgid "Cyclopes of Ironsand"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6248
msgid ""
"The Cyclopes that dwell to the southeast of here have always been a threat to the village of Rust!\n"
"But the village has always been able to push back any raid.\n"
"They aren't so tough in small numbers, but if they can catch you out in the desert unaware, you will not survive!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:673 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6251
msgid "Sea of Fire"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1849 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6252
msgid ""
"The sea of fire took us all by surprise.\n"
"It spread through the eastern half of the village like wildfire.\n"
"Luckily its growth seems to have slowed.\n"
"Still I don’t know how much longer any of us can last."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:674 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6255
msgid "Find us a home!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1853 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6256
msgid ""
"We need to find a new place to live!\n"
"There is no way any people could live under these conditions.\n"
"Even the Cyclopes will be forced to move.\n"
"There are legends that talk about the ancient homeland that we traveled here from.\n"
"The stories say that it was lush and green.\n"
"If we only had such a place to return to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:675 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6259
msgid "Ore Traders"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1859 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6260
msgid ""
"There are traders in Alvar and Shadowspire that trade for the different types of ore that can be found all over Jadame.\n"
"They use the ore to create items that they are more than happy to trade for more ore!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:676 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6263
msgid "Vault of Time"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1861 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6264
msgid ""
"You know, it is said the Vault of Time was here before Ravenshore; the town was built around it. It is supposed to contain the treasure of the old Emperor Thorn who ruled the lands around here hundreds of years ago. Many come here to try and open the vault, but none succeed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:677 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6267
msgid "Renegade Dragons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1862 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6268
msgid ""
"As if Quixote was not enough of a problem to plague us, we must also contend with Ilsingore, Ilsingore and Old Loeb--renegades among our kind! They think they can rebuild our race by scattering across Jadame and starting their own tribes. Fools! All they do is weaken us by removing themselves from our numbers. Yaardrake has fled to the Ironsand Desert. I know not where the others have gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:678 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6271
msgid "Other Dragons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1863 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6272
msgid ""
"While Garrote Gorge has the highest concentration of dragons in Jadame, I hear there is hunting to be had elsewhere. For instance, there is rumored to be a great old dragon out in the Ironsand Desert. Another is supposed to be somewhere in the badlands of Ravage Roaming."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:679 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6275
msgid "Dragon on Regna"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1864 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6276
msgid ""
"When Charles Quixote brought us over from Erathia, we sailed past Regna Island. Since this was our first sight of Jadamean land on the voyage, it was an omen of our hunting expedition's future success that I saw an ancient dragon winging its way towards the island. How I wish I could get a spear in that one! It was the biggest dragon I'd ever seen!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1865 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6280
msgid ""
"Yes, I was here the day the Destroyer walked through Ravenshore! I was at the blacksmith's getting a knife sharpened. He walked right past us like he owned the town. A crowd was following him at a distance. One of them threw a rock, but it bounced off a magic shield surrounding him. He didn't even seem to notice. Later I heard an explosion from the town square. I ran out to look, but the Destroyer was gone and that crystal and scattered bodies were all that remained."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1866 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6284
msgid ""
"Yeah, I saw the \"Destroyer\" and well named he is! I thought he was a rich merchant, and he looked like easy prey, so I…well, I tried to rob him. I ran ahead of him and lay in ambush in an alley, waiting for him to pass. When he walked by, I made a grab for him. My mistake! I didn't even touch him! As soon as I got near him, I was thrown back by his magic. In fact, I was thrown over a house into the next street!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:682 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6287
msgid "Temple of Eep"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1867 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6288
msgid ""
"Those cursed ratmen--those so-called \"Priests of Eep\"--are nothing but trouble. More like a pack of thieves than holy men, they are! I'll warn you, traveler. Keep an eye on your equipment when they're around. They'll steal anything that isn't nailed down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:661 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:662 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:663
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:683 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6291
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1868 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6292
msgid ""
"Well, if you're looking for cheese, I daresay you will find it in the churches of Eep. You know mice like cheese. Well, this rule also applies to the ratmen of Eep. It is said that they keep a horde of the stuff in each of their temples."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:27 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:684 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6295
msgid "Gralkor the Cruel"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1869 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6296
msgid ""
"On top of all of our problems here, the lord of our plane, Gralkor the Cruel is missing. He is a being of great power and could no doubt fight the dark magic which assails this plane."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:685 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6299
msgid "Plane of Earth"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1870 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6300
msgid ""
"I wish I understood what has happened here. One day it was life as usual here…and this is normally a peaceful realm. Then suddenly everyone was howling with violent madness and was filled with a thirst to crush your land of Jadame. Even now my fellow Earth Plane denizens work single-mindedly to push the firmament of our realm into yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:28 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:686 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6303
msgid "Shalwend"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1871 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6304
msgid ""
"Perhaps the reason I am not affected by the madness is that I carry with me an amulet given to me by the lord of this plane, Shalwend. It is said in our legends that he and the other elemental lords made your world. No doubt if Shalwend was here he could stop the creeping madness, but he is missing! Where is our lord in our time of greatest need?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1872 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6308
msgid ""
"It was clearly magic which caused the madness that has taken my fellow Plane of Air dwellers. On the day it struck there was instant chaos. All who were affected dropped what they were doing and began to howl. It was a chorus of horror! Only a handful of us maintain our sanity. Now, day by day, our glorious realm falls further and further towards a state of hellish decline."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1873 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6312
msgid ""
"I am not unschooled in the ways of magic. Clearly some spell of almost unimaginable power has affected those that live in this watery realm. My main curiosity is to know why this has occurred. Clearly no one would risk using such power if it was not to achieve some terrible end. All I know is that the Plane of Water makes war upon your realm. From here, I can discern no reason to it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:26 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:689 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6315
msgid "Acwalander"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1874 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6316
msgid ""
"W-what has h-happened to my home w-waters? All are c-consumed by m-m-madness! And worse, our l-lord is m-missing! Where is our r-ruler, th-the mighty Acw-w-walander! W-without him w-we are d-doomed!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:25 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:690 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6319
msgid "Pyrannaste"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1875 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6320
msgid ""
"I know to your eyes, this plane must seem a hell-scape. But I tell you, normally it is not so. Before the madness we lived here together in a state of peace and harmony. But then, one day the madness fell and our Lord Pyrannaste was nowhere to be found. Perhaps his absence caused the madness? It may be so, he has never before been gone from this realm in my memory."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1876 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6324
msgid ""
"Though the madness affects almost all of those that live here, it has not robbed them of their cunning. As I am sure you are aware, they make war on your realm, but it is not with crazed abandon that they do so. Leaders have emerged among the affected, and these make shrewd military designs against you. Even now they mass near the gateway to Jadame in preparation for a massive assault."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:500 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:501 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:692
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:694 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:696 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:697
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:702 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6327 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6345
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6363 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6372 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6417
msgid "Adventure"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:746 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6329
msgid ""
"I wish I could join with you. Sadly, our war with the Temple of the Sun takes up all of our time. The guild cannot spare me now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:745 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6332
msgid ""
"Well, now that things seem to be settled with our little war with the Temple of the Sun. Sandro has said that guild members may turn their attention to other matters. Since arriving in Jadame, I have seen little of it save for the lands of Shadowspire. Say...perhaps you could use my services!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:693 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6336
msgid "Join with Us"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:989 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6338
msgid ""
"I wish I could. Unfortunately, we make holy war with the foul Necromancers' Guild. All of the Sun Temple's resources, including myself, are dedicated to that cause."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6341
msgid ""
"Yes! I would love to join with you. Now that our holy war against the foul Necromancers' Guild seems to be going well, I find I have little to do around here. I will go with you if you will take me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:991 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6347
msgid ""
"Go with you? I think not. Why would I want to join up with a bunch of amateurs when I have all the action I can handle here? Don't make me laugh. What can you offer me that a life of Dragon hunting does not?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:990 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6350
msgid ""
"Adventure with you? Yes I will. In fact, before he left, Charles Quixote suggested just that. \"Nelix,\" he said, \"if those alliance heroes come by, you ought to consider going with them.\" Apparently, he thinks highly of you. Well, his recommendation is enough for me. Shall we go?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:695 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:699 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:703
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:710 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:711 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6354
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6390 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6426 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6467
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6476
msgid "Come with Us"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:992 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6356
msgid ""
"Go with you? I like the idea, but I must stay here. I am one of the last veteran warriors left here. I must stay to protect the village."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:993 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6359
msgid ""
"Yes, that sounds good. Though the village could use me to protect it, I think the best I could do for it would be to go with you. My people will be destroyed if the cataclysm is not ended. If I can do something to stop it, I should."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1014 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6365
msgid ""
"Join you? I must decline the offer. Though you have done a great service for my herd, I am not yet sure of your leadership. I want to help fight the cataclysm, but I'm not sure your way is the right one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:994 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6368
msgid ""
"Join your group? I would be glad to. Not only have you done a great service for my herd, it has become clear to me that your actions will decide our very survival."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1016 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6374
msgid ""
"I see you too are adventurers. But…well, can I be frank? Though I don't doubt your potential, clearly you are not the most experienced group I've seen. I'd be happy to join you if you were more…shall we say, \"seasoned?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1015 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6377
msgid ""
"Don't think your exploits have gone unnoticed! Clearly you are adventurers of the highest caliber. I would consider joining your team…that is, if you will have me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:698 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6381
msgid "Go with Us"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1221 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6383
msgid ""
"No. I am an elder vampire. To be clear, you're not worthy of me. I seek adventure, not to be your caretaker. I don't have the patience to teach you all the basics."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1220 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6386
msgid ""
"Yes! Yes! An excellent idea. You are just the kind of companions I am seeking. I have heard of you and your adventures."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1223 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6392
msgid ""
"I think not. Now that I've had a chance to look at you, it is clear that you are not worthy of my company. I seek a group of greater renown."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1222 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6395
msgid ""
"Yes, you seem worthy of my company. Very well, I will go if you will have me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:700 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:701 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:704
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:712 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6399 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6408
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6435 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6485
msgid "Join Us"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:265 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:30 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:10
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:17 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/roster.txt:5 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:128
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:64
msgid "Fredrick Talimere"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:52 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:640
msgid "Skeletal Dragons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1239 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6401
msgid ""
"You must be joking! I am a rightly famous knight. Why would I want to travel with such riff-raff as yourselves? Oh, it might be fun after a fashion, but I do have my reputation to think of."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1224 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6404
msgid ""
"I must say I find the idea appealing. Hmmm, yes! The taste of the open road is just what I need. I have been long at this business of dragon slaying, and I must say it grows stale. A man must keep himself interested. I will go with you if you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:162 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:641
msgid ""
"My father believed that the Necromancers of Shadowspire were attempting to create an undead Dragon.\n"
"This would be a truly horrid beast. He believed is was his personal duty to stop them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1241 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6410
msgid ""
"Join you? Ho-ho. What an amusing idea. Why would the great Thorne Understone travel with the likes of you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1240 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6413
msgid ""
"Yes! That sounds great. From what I hear of your adventures you have a chance to know greatness. With my help, we could make that chance a certainty. Well, shall we? I'm always looking for a chance to add to my legend!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1303 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6419
msgid ""
"Yes, adventure is a fine thing. Why I have had several. In fact, let me tell you about the time I….Say, it just occurred to me you are suggesting I adventure with you! A nice offer, but well…how can I say this politely? You're just not seasoned enough. I'm afraid I would grow bored with the kinds of challenges you are ready to face."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1302 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6422
msgid ""
"Ah, \"adventure.\" Surely I have not had enough of it recently. Since our war with the Frost Giants, I have done little but train young warriors. Say, you wouldn't happen to want a traveling companion? Perhaps I could come with you. I have many skills you might find useful, and I swing a deadly axe!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1305 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6428
msgid ""
"Though I may not look it after my long sleep, know that you speak with one of the greatest vampires alive today. Go with you? I think not. Your inexperience would make you more of a hindrance to me than anything. I would do better on my own."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1304 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6431
msgid ""
"Ah, you suggest I come along with you to see the land for myself. An excellent suggestion. I am certainly well rested enough! Very well, I am ready to travel if you will take me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1307 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6437
msgid ""
"Join you? What a fool's notion. I already travel with a certain number of fleas. I don't need any more parasites. Be gone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:53 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:59 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:644
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:685
msgid "Promotion to Champion"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1306 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6440
msgid ""
"Join you! Ha! I admire your audacity. Yes…admire it a great deal. Very well. You have my respect. I will go with you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:705 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6444
msgid "The Family Tomb"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1877 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6445
msgid ""
"The Snapfinger family tomb is one of the lowest in our village's burial catacombs. Since we are such an honored family, our crypt is the largest. It isn't the easiest place to find--even I have become lost looking for it! When I do, I find it by keeping a hand on the right-side wall. I eventually get there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:706 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6448
msgid "Have you found the shield?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1878 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6449
msgid ""
"Have you found the shield?\n"
"The recovery of Eclipse is very important to the Temple of the Sun!\n"
"You must help us find it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:164 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:645
msgid ""
"My father Blazen, left here years ago to slay the Skeletal Dragons in the Shadowspire Region. Unfortunately, he has never returned.\n"
"He took with him, Ebonest, the greatest Dragon slaying spear ever forged. Charles Quixote has never forgiven my father for taking Ebonest with him.\n"
"Unfortunately we have no idea what befell my father.\n"
"Because my father was Charles’ second in command and responsible for the loss of Ebonest, Charles is unwilling to promote me to Champion, regardless of the merit of my skills. Perhaps if you find Ebonest, Charles with promote your knights and myself to Champions!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:707 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6463
msgid "Use Eclipse well!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1881 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6464
msgid ""
"Thanks again for recovering the shield Eclipse!\n"
"I hope it has proven helpful in your adventures."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1886 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6469
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. I'd like to adventure, yes, but you're just not at my level."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1887 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6472
msgid ""
"Sure, why not? I'm ready to go--just have to grab my gear! I'll show the guild who is worthy and who isn't!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1888 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6478
msgid ""
"No…no, that life is over for me. Besides, if I were to take up the mace again, it would be with other companions. I'm afraid--if I may speak bluntly--I just can't see myself traveling with a group as inexperienced as yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1889 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6481
msgid "Say, that sounds grand! Yes, I will go with you, if you will have me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1890 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6487
msgid ""
"I think not! Why would I travel with the likes of you? Perhaps you didn't catch my name, \"Jasp Thelbourne?\" Yes, that \"Thelbourne,\" rabble. No, whatever you're up to, I'm not interested."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1891 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6490
msgid ""
"Yes, we'd make quite a team! We have all done such great deeds, how could not further greatness follow from our joining together? I'll go with you if you want."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:713 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6494
msgid "Ogre Raiders"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1893 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6496
msgid ""
"I tell you, with all that's going on, it's like an honest merchant can't get business done! I mean, we've always had to deal with Ogre raiders, but now they've grown so bold as to have built a fort right here in Alvar! Now no caravans can take the west road to Murmurwoods. The worst of it is most of my trade with the Temple of the Sun there!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1894 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6499
msgid ""
"You have done us all a great service by clearing out the Ogre's fort. Now our caravans can freely travel to Murmurwoods. I thank you…and my purse certainly thanks you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:65
msgid ""
"A Cleric, by the name of Fredrick Talimere, has been living with us for the last few years.\n"
"He has been studying the Portals of Stone and the outer ruins of the Abandoned Temple.\n"
"Maybe he has the knowledge to get the Portals working again!\n"
"Find him and see if he will help!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:542 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:54 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:58
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:650 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:681
msgid "Ebonest"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:714 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6502
msgid "Wasps"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1895 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6503
msgid ""
"Sure we have wasps in Alvar--and rather large ones, too--but we tolerate them for good reason. Many of our customers desire wasp products. Say…if you want to get in on the action, the trader, Veldon, is a broker for wasp parts. He lives here in town, and I hear he is currently trying to fill a large order for wasp stingers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:715 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6506
msgid "Trained Dragons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1896 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6507
msgid ""
"Not many people know this, but it is possible to train a Dragon. It's sort of like breaking a horse, except that it requires more special equipment and a lot of magic. Those tame Dragons outside the fort are an example of my work. Right now they are loyal to us, but I will bond them to their ultimate customer, Fennis Greenwood, a minor lord back in Erathia. Well, I will do so as soon as he pays us, that is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:168 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:651
msgid ""
"I was captured in the center of the Mad Necromancer’s lab.\n"
"There I was tortured and many curses were placed upon me.\n"
" Ebonest must have been taken from me when I fell, and perhaps is still in the central chamber.\n"
"If you were to recover it and return it to Quixote, at least my family name will be cleared, and my daughter can continue her life without my failure haunting her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:50 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:716 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6510
msgid "Zanthora"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1897 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6511
msgid ""
"Zanthora is a strange character. Not to say that members of the Necromancers' Guild are not all strange, but she is truly mad. I hear that other guild members simply refuse to work with her--so terrible are her experiments. Still, they value her dark genius. To keep her around, they built her a lab of her own out on the marshy wastes outside of town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:35 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:717 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6514
msgid "Vampire Crypt"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1898 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6515
msgid ""
"For the most part, the Necromancers' Guild has the local vampires under control…mostly. But there's one place you don't want to go! Most of them sleep in a communal crypt north of the guild. Watch out if you go there. They're a bit, shall we say…\"territorial.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:718 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6518
msgid "The Guild"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1899 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6519
msgid ""
"The Necromancers' Guild? Hey, I think they're great. You should have seen this place before they came--nothing going on at all! Sure, we got vampires, skeletons and other undead running around. Still, I gotta say, things are sure a lot more lively around here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:719 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6522
msgid "Coffins"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1900 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6523
msgid ""
"As you might imagine, business is great. Oh, sure, the guild necromancers turn most of my customers into skeletons and zombies, but vampires are repeat business! Want a piece of the action? There's a wood dealer in town, Mylander, who is always looking for good Murmurwood lumber. If you have any he'll pay a pretty penny for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:720 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6526
msgid "Lava Tunnel"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1901 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6527
msgid ""
"Hunting has become pretty hazardous of late, but still we must do it if we are to eat! Yesterday I was out along the western shore of the fire lake and found a tunnel that seems to go under the lake. I didn't explore it though. It was infested with gogs and worse...like everything else around here these days."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:721 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6530
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1902 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6531
msgid ""
"Even we who live here get lost. If you would not lose your way, follow the floating waystones. Ahhh…the madness returns….It returns!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:722 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6534
msgid "The Easy Life"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1903 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6535
msgid ""
"Ah, I'm glad you're out saving the world. I mean, someone has to do it. Me, I'm for the easy life. As long as I got my boat and my pole, and the fish are biting, I don't see any reason to do much else. Good luck to you though!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:110 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:723 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6538
msgid "Dread Pirate Stanley"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1904 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6539
msgid ""
"That Stanley, now there's a Regnan with some spark! Why I hear he's the one that got us in good with that thar Zog the Jackal--some sort of Ogre or giant Troll or something, I think--a genuine barbarian king. Now we got us our ships on the seas and a bunch of club swinging devils on the land. I tell ya, the Great and Mighty Regnan Empire is headed for greatness, what with the likes of the Dread Pirate Stanley doing for us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:55 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:654
msgid "Cure"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:724 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6542
msgid "Jadamean Smugglers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6543
msgid ""
"Oh sure, we Regnans have to put up with a bit of competition--I'm talking about smugglers, you know--but I understand the Dread Pirate Stanley is putting the clamp on that. Why I understand he kidnapped Arion Hunter's family just so he can pressure the wererat into staying off our turf. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:725 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6546
msgid "Stanley's Treasure"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1906 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6547
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know the \"Dread\" Pirate Stanley is the hero of the moment around here, but I say, fah! Sure he's done a lot for Regna, but no man does anything that doesn't help himself. Why I hear old Stanley's been shaving off the top of every deal he's in--and that's a lot of deals! What I'd like to know is where he keeps his booty. Probably not on Regna, I reckon. It wouldn't be a fortnight before someone dug it up!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:726 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6550
msgid "Hidden Treasure"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1907 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6551
msgid ""
"I have come up with a scheme for finding hidden treasure. Before you barged in, I was hard at work formulating a spell for sensing gold hidden beneath the ground. If I am successful, I plan to have a Dragon carry me over the wastelands of Ravage Roaming where the Dread Pirate Stanley's treasure is rumored to be buried. My spell will find it and I will be a wealthy man."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:727 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6554
msgid "Burial Mound"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1908 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6555
msgid ""
"You mean the one just north of here? Well, none of us have anything to do with it. It's haunted!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:728 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6558
msgid "Followers of Eep"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1909 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6559
msgid ""
"I don't know where they're at, but I know there's some of them ratmen around here somewhere. At night I hear all sorts of squeaking and scuffling outside. In the morning, pretty much everything that isn't under lock or bolted down is gone. If I knew where that Eep church was. I'd take some of my boys over for a little...talk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:729 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6562
msgid "Water Gateway"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1910 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6563
msgid ""
"I was out with one of the crews working along the new lake searching for things that were washed out of the lair. We think we found the source of the flood. There is a strange gateway out in the middle of the lake. We don't have any boats, so we didn't explore it, but even from the shore, it is clear to see that it leads to a watery realm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:730 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6566
msgid "Pirate Fortress"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1911 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6567
msgid ""
"Well, if you haven't been to the fortress, that's the first place you should go. As you are aware from your orientation, the so-called fortress on this island is just a front to fool our enemies. You'll need to make your way to the real fort on the crescent island. Just take the underground passage marked on your orientation map."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:172 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:657
msgid ""
"Perhaps the Clerics of the Sun have a way to cure me, for they would be the only ones who would know how to counter the dark magics that afflict me. There is a friend of mine in Ravenshore named Dervish Chevron. He left the Temple of the Sun years ago to pursue his own research into the mysteries of Jadame.\n"
"Perhaps he would know of a cure, or even have it in his possession.\n"
"If he cannot help, promise you will return here and kill me so I may at last be at rest!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:731 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6570
msgid "Regnan Culture"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1912 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6571
msgid ""
"I know they call us \"pirates\" on Jadame, but really, we're just running our empire. It is not our fault that our Jadamean subjects refuse to acknowledge our rule and do not pay their taxes. Since they do not pay, we're forced to collect tribute in the form of booty. Actually we prefer it this way--saves us the trouble of having to actually rule the continent."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:732 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6574
msgid "Nightshade Amulets"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1913 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6576
msgid ""
"We vampires cannot normally walk about in the daylight, but Thant the Necromancers' Guildmaster has created an artifact to deal with this. A vampire wearing one of his Nightshade Amulets can move about freely day or night. Sadly, there are few available. I myself do not have one so must stay indoors during the day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1914 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6579
msgid ""
"Normally, we vampires need one of Thant's Nightshade Amulets to travel freely during the day, but since you've brought us the Nightshade Brazier, glorious night covers Shadowspire around the clock! Now those of us who don't have the amulets can walk about during the day...well, at least as long as we stay in the area."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:733 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6582
msgid "Gaudy Jewelry"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1915 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6583
msgid ""
"Though it isn't my style, I must say a lot of folks around here like to cover themselves with all sorts of jewelry. They say it's fashion, but I just find it gaudy. Anyway, if you have any to sell go find Pavel in town. He does a brisk trade in all sorts of tacky junk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:734 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6586
msgid "Sunfish"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1916 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6587
msgid ""
"You looking for sunfish? Sorry, can't help you. Funny thing is, I had a whole catch of them just last week, but Pavel the merchant bought the whole lot. Maybe you can get them from him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:735 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6590
msgid "The Warehouse"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1920 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6591
msgid ""
"We have a small warehouse downstairs. You are free to use the chests there to store extra equipment. Put anything in there you don't want to wander off!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1363 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:736 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:892
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:896 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:898 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6594
msgid "Hint"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:236 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1937 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6598
msgid ""
"I see a vision of you in which you take a letter from Elgar Fellmoon in Ravenshore to Arion Hunter, the leader of the Ravenshore smugglers. After this, you return to Fellmoon. The end of the vision is a blur, so you must not have lived entirely through it. Still, it is your fate to do these things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:237 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1938 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6603
msgid ""
"I don't need my vision to tell me what you must do next. Do as Fellmoon asked of you. Go seek Bastian Loudrin, the guildmaster of the Alvarian Merchant Guild. He is in the city of Alvar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:240 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1941 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6609
msgid ""
"It is clear to me that you must bring the Troll, Overdune, to the merchant guild in Alvar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:247 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1948 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6615
msgid ""
"In case you haven't heard, Ravenshore is under attack by the Regnan pirates. The town has been evacuated. You must eliminate the pirate threat before the alliance council will return to guide you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1274 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:662
msgid ""
"The Cleric sent you back with the Gem of Restoration?\n"
"I am free of this place!\n"
"Search me out if you wish for me to ever travel with you!\n"
"It would be my pleasure to join you in your journeys!\n"
"I will wait for you at the Adventurer's Inn in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:248 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1949 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6620
msgid ""
"Now that you've sunk the Regnan fleet. Go and seek the wisdom of your alliance council. They will give you the next task that will make your destiny."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:257 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1958 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6628
msgid ""
"The Balance is restored. Now that your destiny is made, I can no longer guide you--my sight only pertains to what is connected to the fate of Balance. What you do now is up to you. Good luck to you, Heroes of Jadame!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:256 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1957 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6632
msgid ""
"Seek out Xanthor! Though he is but a piece in the game of Balance, the next move you make towards destiny it through a meeting with him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:255 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1956 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6635
msgid ""
"Your path is clear to my vision. You must seek out the four elemental lords and release them from their prisons. These prisons are in the Destroyer's realm--the Plane Between Planes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:254 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1955 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6640
msgid ""
"You have talked to the Destroyer, but have failed to gather from him the key which will unlock your future. Return to him and continue your conversations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:253 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1954 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6643
msgid ""
"Your destiny lies through the crystal gateway in Ravenshore. It will take you to the Plane Between Planes. There you will find the source of the elemental cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:251 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1952 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6651
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6660 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6664
msgid ""
"It is clear that you must do as Xanthor has asked of you. Go to the four elemental planes and find in each, an elemental heartstone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:252 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1953 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6655
msgid ""
"Now that you have the four elemental heartstones, you must now bring them to Xanthor in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:250 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1951 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6669
msgid ""
"I see an important link between the present and your future has not been forged. Seek out the sage, Xanthor who resides in Ravenshore. He will send you on your destiny's next task."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:249 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1950 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6672
msgid ""
"You must speak to the Ironfists' court sage, Xanthor. He is housed in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:246 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1947 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6677
msgid ""
"You must do as the alliance council has asked of you. Find a way to Regna Island and sink the Regnan port fleet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:245 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1946 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6680
msgid ""
"I see an important connection has not been made between the present and your future destiny. You must return to the council chamber in the Ravenshore merchant guild. The councilors will send you on the next step down your road."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:244 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1945 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6687
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6691 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6700 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6704
msgid ""
"You have done good work in forging the alliances you have. It is now time for you to seek the council of those allies you have brought together. Seek them out in their council chamber within the merchant guild in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:243 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1944 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6694
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6707
msgid ""
"There is great turmoil in the Balance. It has taken me some time to know its source, but I know it now. There is conflict between the Dragons and Knights who fight in Garrote Gorge. It is your destiny to ally with one of the two at the expense of the other."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:242 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1943 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6711
msgid ""
"There is great turmoil in the Balance. It has taken me some time to know its source, but I know it now. It is caused by the war between the clerics of the Temple of the Sun located in Murmurwoods, and the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire. It is your destiny to undo the turmoil by choosing one of these two to ally with."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:241 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1942 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6715
msgid ""
"I see far through space today, but not through time. A great disaster has befallen the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair in Ravage Roaming. I feel that your destiny is linked with their fate. You must rescue them from their peril."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:239 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1940 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6720
msgid ""
"In my dreams last night, I saw you traveling to the Ironsand Desert to find a witness to the formation of a great lake of fire which formed there during the cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:238 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1939 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6723
msgid ""
"I see an important connection has not been made between the present and your future. You must return to Bastian Loudrin and continue your conversations with him. He will send you on the next step down your road."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:235 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1936 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6728
msgid ""
"Hmmm…I cannot look too far ahead--for the ether is thick today. All I see is that you must deliver the letter Dadeross gave you to the merchant, Elgar Fellmoon. Fellmoon lives in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:56 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:673
msgid "Mad Necromancer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:234 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1935 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6731
msgid ""
"You are employed by the Merchants of Alvar, yes? Well, I think you should speak with Dadeross, the leader of your caravan. My far seeing vision tells me he is on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:737 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6736
msgid "Promote Dark Elves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1962 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6739 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6752
msgid ""
"Cauri told me of how you helped her with the curse of the Basilisk.\n"
"She has instructed me to promote any Dark Elves that travel with you to Patriarch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:175 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:674
msgid ""
"Zanthora moved here from the Shadowspire to continue experiments she began at the Necromancers' Guild.\n"
"She desired to create the ultimate horror, the Skeletal Dragon.\n"
"Her fellow Necromancers feared the end result. If the created Dragons where ever to escape Zanthora’s control, there would be no stopping them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1959 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6764
msgid ""
"You cannot be promoted until we know where Cauri Blackthorne is!\n"
"Locate her, and she will promote you.\n"
"After she is found and has retuned to the Merchant Guild, I will be glad to promote any Dark Elves in your party to Patriarch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:738 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6768
msgid "Promote Trolls"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:57 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:677
msgid "Stormlance"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1966 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6771 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6783
msgid ""
"Before Volog left, he instructed me to promote any Trolls that travel with you to War Troll.\n"
"The village of Rust will be forever thankful to you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:678
msgid ""
"Blazen Stormlance was my lieutenant and my friend.\n"
"I never understood his personal quest--this need to find these rumored Skeletal Dragons.\n"
"He took my greatest tool with him.\n"
"With Ebonest in my hand, I would have the Dragon problem well in hand.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1964 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6794
msgid ""
"You cannot be promoted until the Ancient Troll Home has been found!\n"
"Return here when you have found it and talk with Volog."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:739 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6798
msgid "Promote Knights"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1970 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6801 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6814
msgid ""
"Thanks for you help recovering the spear Ebonest!\n"
"I can promote any Knights that travel with you to Champion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:183 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:682
msgid ""
"The Clerics of the Sun imbued this spear with their blessings, making it the strongest spear forged.\n"
"Its power is said to be able to slay any Dragon with one blow.\n"
"If this were so, I could end my conflict quickly, cleanly and efficiently."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6826
msgid ""
"You cannot be promoted to Champion until you have proven yourself worthy!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:740 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6830
msgid "Promote Dragons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1974 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6833 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6845
msgid ""
"You have proven yourself and I will promote any Dragons that travel with you to Great Wyrm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1972 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6856
msgid ""
"You have not proven yourself worthy!\n"
"Until you strike a blow against the Dragon Hunters, none of you will be promoted!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:741 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6860
msgid "Promote Clerics"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6863 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6875
msgid ""
"You are always welcome here!\n"
"Of course I will promote any Clerics that travel with you to Priest of the Sun!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:243 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:688
msgid ""
"You have found Blazen Stormlance? But where is Ebonest?\n"
"Return to me when you have the spear and you will be promoted!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1975 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6886
msgid ""
"You cannot be promoted to Priest of the Sun until you have recovered the Prophecies of the Sun!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:742 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6890
msgid "Promote Necromancers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1982 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6893 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6915
msgid ""
"Ah, you return seeking promotion for others in your party?\n"
"I have not forgotten your help in recovering the Lost Book of Kehl!\n"
"All Necromancers in your party will be promoted to Lich.\n"
"Be sure each Necromancer has a Lich Jar in his possession."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:36 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:69
msgid ""
"Ah yes…\"the portals.\" I have been studying them and the lost culture that built them for years.They were built by the civilization that had its day long before the Lizardmen came to inhabit these islands. They were a means of instantaneous travel between the islands. Sadly, the power stones needed to operate them are in short supply."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:692
msgid ""
"You found Blazen Stormlance?\n"
"What about MY spear Ebonest?\n"
"You have that as well?FANTASTIC!I thank you for this and find myself in your debt!\n"
"I will promote all knights in your party to Champion and teach what skills I can to the rest of your party. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1979 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6936
msgid ""
"You have not recovered the Lost Book of Kehl!\n"
"There will be no promotions until you return with the book!\n"
"Speak with Vetrinus Taleshire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:743 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6940
msgid "Promote Vampires"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1988 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6943 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6955
msgid ""
"Any Vampires among you will be promoted to Nosferatu!\n"
"I remember those who helped in the recovery of the Remains of Korbu."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1986 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6966
msgid ""
"You have not found Korbu and until you have I refuse to promote any of you!\n"
"Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:744 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6970
msgid "Promote Minotuars"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1992 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6973 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6985
msgid ""
"The Herd of Masul is in debt to you.\n"
"Any Minotaurs in your party are promoted to Minotaur Lord!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1990 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6996
msgid ""
"You have not found the Axe of Balthazar!\n"
"You are not worthy of promotion!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1994 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7001
msgid ""
"My father sent you to rescue me?\n"
"I am grateful.\n"
"I will return to my father and let him know of your assistance!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:746 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7020
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7029
msgid "Travel with you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1999 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7022
msgid ""
"I cannot yet travel with you!\n"
"I would sooner sign on with a merchant caravan, than travel with you.\n"
"Return to me when you have discovered more of the world, and your place in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2002 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7025
msgid ""
"I remember you!\n"
"The Book of Kehl has proven invaluable, and it would be a privilege to travel with you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2004 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7031
msgid ""
"When you have grown and learned more of the ways of the world, then it would be my pleasure to travel with you.\n"
"Until then I have studies to complete here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2006 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7034
msgid ""
"Certainly!\n"
"Traveling with you would be an honor!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:748 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7038
msgid "Rescue"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2008 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7039
msgid ""
"You have done us a great service, adventurers. On behalf of my herd, I give you our humblest thanks. Know that the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair hold you in the highest regard. You will always be welcome among us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2030 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7046
msgid ""
"If you win, you'll be in charge of one of the most scenic areas in all Erathia!\n"
"Harmondale is just outside of the Tularean Forest, right on the edge of the Elf-Human border.\n"
"And I'm sure you'll love the castle.\n"
"It's a bit of a fixer-upper, but it's quite roomy and has excellent ventilation.\n"
"It breaks my heart to part with this property, but I feel that the time has come for me to give something back to the people."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2027 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7061
msgid ""
"Isn't this hunt exciting?\n"
"I really am grateful you came to my little event, and I hope you have fun, even if you don't win.\n"
"I think it's great that everyone is competing in a spirit of good sportsmanship and camaraderie."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2035 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7076
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You are the new Lords of Harmondale!\n"
"Isn't it thrilling?\n"
"You can't imagine how good it feels for me to give this property away to you!\n"
"All of the benefits and rewards, and of course, the responsibilities of governing the town of Harmondale are now yours.\n"
"(Lord Markham produces a deed and contract) Just sign here...And here... And if I could just get your initials here... Yes!\n"
"Well, that's that!\n"
"You're all set.\n"
"And once again, congratulations!!!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2044 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7098
msgid ""
"Well, the ship that will take you to your fiefdom awaits you in the harbor.\n"
"My entourage and I will be taking a different ship out.\n"
"Just board whenever you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:196 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:710
msgid ""
"What is this?\n"
"You ally with my mortal enemies and then seek to do me a favor?I wonder what the Dragons think of this. But so be it.\n"
"I am in your debt for returning Ebonest to me.\n"
"I will promote any Knights in your party to Champion, however they will never be accepted in my service.\n"
"The rest I will teach what I can. I do not wish to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2089 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7106
msgid ""
"Good afternoon.\n"
"My duty is to verify that you have all the items necessary to win the contest.\n"
"You are required to bring a red potion, a longbow, a floor tile from the Temple of the Moon, a wealthy hat, seashell, and an instrument to me.\n"
"You can bring them in any order, just show them to me one at a time so that I may verify them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2104 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7119
msgid ""
"What took you so long?\n"
"Almost every group has turned in a red potion by now.\n"
"This is the easiest item in the hunt to manage, but better late than never.\n"
"I will mark it off your list."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2102 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7132
msgid ""
"A beautiful shell, much like the ones that Sally sells.\n"
"This certainly came from Emerald Island- I shall mark the shell off your list."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2100 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7141
msgid ""
"This longbow certainly qualifies for the hunt.\n"
"Good work, I shall mark that off your list."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2097 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7154
msgid ""
"Adventurers indeed!\n"
"I didn't expect anyone to bring back a tile so quickly.\n"
"This is certainly a tile from the Temple, however so I shall mark the tile off your list."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2095 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7167
msgid ""
"Hmm, a fine lute this is.\n"
"Let me mark off the instrument from your list."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2093 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7180
msgid ""
"I see you have found a wealthy hat.\n"
"I shall mark this off your list accordingly, good work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2108 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7211
msgid ""
"Well, that's all six items.\n"
"You're the winner of the contest!\n"
"I suggest you talk to Lord Markham for the details on gaining your fiefdom, my work is done here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2111 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7219
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but nothing you have is necessary for the hunt.\n"
"I don't mean to belittle what you have, but I'm not looking for any of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2018 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7223
msgid ""
"Welcome to Emerald Island!\n"
"I'll be your docent for your stay on the island.\n"
"It is my duty to see that you understand the rules of both the island and the contest.\n"
"For the duration of your stay on Emerald Island please refrain from gross violations of civilized behavior."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2013 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7228
msgid ""
"Emerald Island is southeast of Erathia, and far away from pirates and other ruffians.\n"
"It would be ideal, if not for the constant swarms of dragonflies that infest the island.\n"
"Fortunately, the large number of armed and skilled people this contest has attracted should thin their numbers a bit.Lord Markham has supplemented the normally sparse village with a weapon, armor, and alchemist shop for your convenience during the contest.\n"
"A temple and basic magical guilds are also available.\n"
"I would suggest making sure that you are completely ready before you start off on the contest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2024 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7232
msgid ""
"The rules of the contest are simple:\n"
"The first person to return with the items is the winner.\n"
"All you need to do is collect a wealthy hat, a red potion, a longbow, a seashell, a musical instrument, and a floor tile from the Temple of the Moon and bring them to the judge to win."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2113 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7247
msgid ""
"Are you contestants in Lord Markham's Scavenger Hunt?\n"
"How neat!\n"
"I'm here to provide entertainment to Lord Markham's entourage, the contestants, and to anyone else that would like to hear a song."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2116 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7251
msgid ""
"I own a few instruments, but I only brought my lute with me.\n"
"Its old and not quite as well kept as some of the others, but I didn't want one of my good instruments stolen by pirates or damaged from exposure to the humid, salty air."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2118 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7256
msgid ""
"You say you need an instrument for the Scavenger Hunt?\n"
"I suppose you could buy my lute, but I've had it for such a long time.\n"
"I guess I'd part with it for 500 gold.\n"
"Interested?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2125 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7279
msgid ""
"It would help if you had the 500 gold pieces.\n"
"Please don't try and cheat me out of my instrument."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2122 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7287
msgid ""
"Well, promise to at least take care of it and not use it for firewood.\n"
"I suppose I'll have to make do without an instrument for the rest of this trip.\n"
"Maybe I should tell stories instead of sing until I get back home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2064 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7294
msgid ""
"I love being out on this side of the island, the view of the ocean is much better than from town, don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2065 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7298
msgid ""
"I have some nice sea shells for sale, shells that you can only find on Emerald Island.\n"
"Can I sell one to you?\n"
"They're only a hundred gold pieces each."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:37 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:73
msgid ""
"The first night of the mountain of fire, I went to the beach to see if I could see anything of its eruption.\n"
"I cannot be certain, but as the volcano continued to erupt, I thought I saw Earth Elementals roaming the lava encrusted base of the mountain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2069 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7304
msgid ""
"I really can't go any less than 100 gold; I need to make a living, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2068 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7312
msgid "Here you go, I hope it reminds you of your trip to Emerald Island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2056 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7316
msgid ""
"We have reason to believe that whoever is in charge of Harmondale in the next few months will have an unprecedented opportunity to shape the future.\n"
"That is why I am here today--to make sure the shape of the future is pleasing to my associates.\n"
"I'm sure you understand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2047 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7331
msgid ""
"Allow me to introduce myself.\n"
"My name is Mr. Malwick.\n"
"I represent a group of, shall we say, \"investors in the future\".\n"
"I have been observing you since you arrived on this island, and I believe your values and goals have much in common with ours.\n"
"I am empowered to grant you a fireball wand to help you win the Hunt today, in exchange for a favor in the future.\n"
"What do you say?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2059 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7353
msgid ""
"Excellent.\n"
"Sometime in the future, I or a representative of my group will call on you to return the favor.\n"
"I hope you won't disappoint us.\n"
"Here is your fireball wand.\n"
"We should not be seen talking again, the others might get suspicious."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2022 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7374
msgid ""
"I respect your decision.\n"
"I am, however, a patient man, and will offer you this chance until a winner in the contest is proclaimed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:60 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:739
msgid "My Father"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2070 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7391
msgid ""
"I see you have a fine hat, there.\n"
"How about a deal:\n"
"You give me your hat, and we let you keep your lives?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2075 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7408
msgid ""
"This Temple is a pretty nasty place.\n"
"You should probably watch your back around here-- you never know what might want to kill you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2073 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7412
msgid "Thanks for the hat, friend!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1932 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:742 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:748
msgid ""
"You found my father and Ebonest?\n"
"I will be forever in your debt!\n"
"We should take the spear to Charles Quixote, and if he is agreeable, he will promote me and any knights in your party!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2074 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7421
msgid "You should have accepted my offer…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2077 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7428
msgid ""
"You should have listened to me; I warned you this was a nasty place.\n"
"Now get out of here before I decide to take something else from you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2079 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7432
msgid ""
"I take this to mean you don't wish to accept my proposal.\n"
"I believe our business is concluded."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2127 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7448
msgid ""
"Hello there!\n"
"I suppose you're part of the contest?\n"
"Good to hear.\n"
"We were wondering if you would want to trade a red potion, assuming you have one, for a hat.\n"
"We could help each other along a little."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2081 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7466
msgid ""
"The toughest band of contestants have apparently hid out in the Temple of the Moon.\n"
"I think they might be wanting to ambush any group that tries to go there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2083 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7470
msgid ""
"I know how to make a blue potion, but not red ones…Just about any blue herb will do.\n"
"Just mix it with an empty bottle and voila!\n"
"Instant blue potion.\n"
"I guess that making a red potion is similar, but I'm not sure.\n"
"They say mixing potions improperly can have really bad effects."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2138 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7476
msgid ""
"Is this some sort of trick?\n"
"You don't even have a red potion.\n"
"You don't think I'll just give you the hat, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2132 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7482
msgid ""
"Wonderful!\n"
"Here's the hat and I'll take the potion.\n"
"Thanks so much, now we're almost finished with our list."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2135 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7495
msgid ""
"What's the matter?\n"
"You don't like to work with others?\n"
"Fine then, you'll get no help from us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2088 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7502
msgid ""
"Sorry mates, this vessel's moored until a winner has been declared in the contest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2141 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7506
msgid ""
"Good job, mates!\n"
"We'll be heading off for Harmondale right now.\n"
"Congratulations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2144 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7517
msgid ""
"Keep in mind I have a 1000 gold reward for the group to bring back information on the contestants that have disappeared."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2145 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7525
msgid "No news on the missing people yet?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2146 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7528
msgid ""
"There really is a dragon on the island?\n"
"I thought everyone was referring to the dragonflies everywhere.\n"
"I'll warn everyone to stay away from that cave so we don't lose anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1928 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:753 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:757
msgid ""
"You found Ebonest?\n"
"What of my father?\n"
"Where is he?\n"
"I thought you were going to return when you had found both my father and the spear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2149 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7540
msgid ""
"Hmm… I recall a few strangers poking around the entrance to the Dragon's Cave recently.\n"
"I didn't notice if they went inside, but I haven't seen them around since.\n"
"They must have realized how dangerous that place is and headed back to town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2152 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7544
msgid ""
"The cave right behind my house is not the Abandoned Temple.\n"
"It belongs to Morcarack the Pitiless, the Dragon of Emerald Island.\n"
"He doesn't appreciate visitors, so I wouldn't advise going there.\n"
"The Abandoned Temple is buried in the hill south of my house.\n"
"You can get to it by entering the caves at the top of the hill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2157 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7548
msgid ""
"Wild Dragonflies have infested the northwestern side of Emerald Island recently, making it dangerous to store things in our shed out there.\n"
"Dragonflies aren't terribly powerful, but they are fast and can even occasionally shoot fire at you.\n"
"Don't take them too lightly!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2160 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7552
msgid ""
"The Dragon of Emerald Island lives in a cave in the northeast.\n"
"I wouldn't go there, though, he doesn't like visitors.\n"
"He spares our town so that we may pay him tribute, and in return he keeps pirates and undesirables out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2163 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7556
msgid ""
"You're contestants in the Scavenger Hunt?\n"
"If so, I wouldn't wander off to the Dragon Cave, then.\n"
"Morcarack doesn't tolerate strangers very well.\n"
"I bet the missing people went there thinking his cave was the Abandoned Temple--they're probably long dead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2167 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7560
msgid ""
"I'd watch those other contestants-- some of them seem ruthless.\n"
"One particularly nasty group headed to the north side of the island, and I haven't seen them since.\n"
"I'm surprised at the attention this contest has received, apparently people are hoping to get on the good side of the contestants for future favors if they win."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2170 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7564
msgid ""
"You have decided that you no longer desire my information about the places on Emerald Island.\n"
"If you later decide that you'd like to hear what I have to say, find me in the Two Palms tavern and then select Tour On."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2172 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7571
msgid ""
"You have decided to listen to my tour about the points of interest on Emerald Island.\n"
"If you decide that you no longer want me to point out areas of interest then select Tour Off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2174 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7578
msgid ""
"Though the law may decide who is guilty and who is not, I decide who is called Thief, and who is just a criminal.\n"
"Bring me that lovely vase I saw on the mantle in Lord Markham’s manor, and I shall call you Rogue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2176 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7586
msgid ""
"Common criminals steal whatever catches their eye; Rogues steal what I tell them to steal.\n"
"I shall not grant titles to failures.\n"
"Return with Lord Markham’s Vase and I will promote all Thieves to Rogues, and all non-thieves to Honorary Rogues."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7589
msgid ""
"Well done.\n"
"Stealing that vase took guts and skill.\n"
"I grant you the title of Rogue, and a small payment for your services. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:189 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:759
msgid ""
"Have you found my father?\n"
"Or the spear Ebonest?\n"
"We must get it back to Charles Quixote!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:620 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:621 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:13
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:76 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:158 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:165
msgid "Power Stone"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2188 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7613
msgid ""
"Your next task is somewhat more difficult…more suited for Spies than Rogues.\n"
"I have been asked to ensure that Watchtower 6, the only tower to survive the recent wars against the Necromancers, be unable to defend itself the next time it is attacked.\n"
"Killing the guards inside won’t help—the Necromancers will just fill it again with more troops.\n"
"The tower is on the southern edge of the Necromancers’ land.\n"
"I want you to slip inside and move the counterweight in the gatehouse at the top of the tower to the gatehouse at the bottom of the tower.\n"
"It is a heavy weight that can be found in a slot against the wall with a rope tied to it.\n"
"When the time comes for an attack, the misplaced weights will be noticed too late, and the gate will not close.\n"
"If you can do this, you will have proven your status as a Spy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2182 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7617
msgid ""
"You have chosen the path of Darkness, and I will promote you no further.\n"
"Perhaps an Assassin would have something to teach you.\n"
"I hear there is one in Deyja."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2185 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7619
msgid ""
"You are not quite ready to take the next step.\n"
"The time is fast approaching when you must decide whether to follow the path of light, or the path of darkness.\n"
"If you choose the Light, return to me to complete your training."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7626
msgid ""
"Good work!\n"
"Some day, your sabotage of that watchtower will save hundreds of lives.\n"
"For your services, I hereby promote the Rogues among you to the status of Spy, and the Honorary Rogues to Honorary Spies! Oh, and here’s some gold as payment. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:61 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:763
msgid "Promotion to Great Wyrm"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2196 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7644
msgid ""
"Um…The weight needs to go in the box in the lower gatehouse—not here.\n"
"Go back to Watchtower 6 and put the weight in the right box!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2198 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7647
msgid ""
"Hmm.\n"
"Removing the weight from the upper gatehouse was a start, but where is it now?!?\n"
"The plan won’t work unless you put the weight in the lower gatehouse!\n"
"Go back to Watchtower 6 and put the weight in the right box!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7649
msgid ""
"You haven’t done the job yet!\n"
"Remember, you must go to Watchtower 6 and move the weight from the box in the upper gatehouse to the lower gatehouse.\n"
"I will not promote you until that is done. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:214 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:765
msgid ""
"You think I would promote a Dragon that serves those who have allied themselves with our Mortal enemy, Charles Quixote.\n"
"What arrogance!\n"
"What outrageousness!\n"
"You will have to prove yourselves to me! And in the proving you will deal a serious blow to your allies!\n"
"To the southwest of here, Quixote has established an encampment of his puny “Dragon Slayers.”\n"
"This camp is lead by Jeric Whistlebone, the second in command of Quixote’s army.\n"
"Destroy this camp!\n"
"Kill all of those who serve Quixote in that region and return to me.\n"
"Return to me with the sword of\n"
"Whistlebone the Slayer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2212 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7656
msgid "Refreshing! (+50 Endurance temporary)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2219 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7662
msgid ""
"You have chosen the path of Light, and therefore can never become an effective Assassin.\n"
"I cannot train you.\n"
"Perhaps you should continue a softer hearted training with the Spy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2222 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7666 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7674
msgid ""
"I can turn a simple Rogue into a fearsome killer, but only if he has the right kind of temperament for the job.\n"
"The time is coming when you must choose to walk in the light, or in the dark.\n"
"If you prefer the shadow, come to me and I will complete your training."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2213 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7669 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7677
msgid ""
"So…you wish to become an Assassin.\n"
"Very well.\n"
"I can provide the Rogues among you the training necessary, but you must prove both your skill and your loyalty before I will invest time in you.\n"
"My superiors inform me that a certain Lady Eleanor Carmine’s life must end.\n"
"She used to work for us, but has taken up residence in the Celestial Court with our enemies, and is providing them with information damaging to our cause.\n"
"Silence her, and return with a trinket of hers to prove the job is done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2225 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7681
msgid ""
"If you were looking for someone to train you in advanced stealth techniques, I\n"
"would be your man.\n"
"But you still need someone to teach you basic techniques.\n"
"Return to me when you achieve Rogue or Honorary Rogue status.\n"
"Then, perhaps, I can further your education.\n"
"Seek the Master Thief in the sewers of Erathia."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2231 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7689
msgid ""
"Without proof, I cannot assume Lady Carmine is dead.\n"
"Bring me proof, and I will honor you with the title of Assassin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7692
msgid ""
"So, the job is done. [He examines the dagger slowly, then sighs.] She was very dear to me, but emotion is the enemy of reason.\n"
"I could not have done the job myself.\n"
"Thank you.\n"
"Truly now, you are Assassins.\n"
"The rogues among you, I will give special training to.\n"
"Here is a small payment to help cover the expenses you incurred on the job. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:77
msgid ""
"So Clanleader Onefang gave you that power stone he was holding onto! It will power the portal on the southwestern tip of the island. To use it, hold an image of the stone in your mind as you step onto the portal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:771 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:777
msgid ""
"To attain the status of Great Wyrm, a Dragon must prove that he can handle himself against a great number of foes.\n"
"He must face down the vermin that Charles Quixote would send against us.\n"
"To the southwest of here, Quixote has established an encampment of his puny “Dragon Slayers.”\n"
"This camp is lead by Jeric Whistlebone, the second in command of Quixote’s army.\n"
"Destroy this camp!\n"
"Kill all of those who serve Quixote in that region and return to me.\n"
"Return to me with the sword of\n"
"Whistlebone the Slayer.\n"
"In doing this, you will prove to me your worthiness.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2241 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7714
msgid ""
"Ha! So, thee wishes to take the test to be a crusader?\n"
"I cannot blame thee—the sense of pride one feels when one has accomplished a heroic deed is sublime!\n"
"The test is simple.\n"
"A dragon must be slain.\n"
"I know just the one—Wromthrax the Heartless!\n"
"He lives in a cave in Tatalia, and terrorizes the peasants who live near him when he’s home.\n"
"He should be in the cave this time of year.\n"
"Because this is probably thine first dragon, I will travel with thee to give thee pointers.\n"
"So, let us go forthwith, and spill this monster’s black blood!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2255 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7725
msgid "We must finish our quest before I can name thee Crusaders, friends."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2250 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7728
msgid ""
"Hurrah!\n"
"The Dragon has fallen!\n"
"Truly thou art grand Crusaders in good standing, with a fine deed behind thee.\n"
"I would stay and sing songs of thy bravery with thee, but duty calls.\n"
"Surely we will meet again, Crusaders!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2256 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7751
msgid ""
"I am pleased to see thee chose the path of Light, Crusaders!\n"
"A wrong has been committed, friends, and who else but us can put it right?\n"
"A wicked villain has kidnapped a fair maiden by the name of Alice Hargreaves.\n"
"His name is William Setag, and he has imprisoned her in his tower.\n"
"You must ride forthwith to put this villain to the sword and rescue sweet Alice!\n"
"If you succeed, you will truly be Heroes of the Land!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2262 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7757
msgid ""
"I will not have truck with thee further, scoundrel!\n"
"I see now thee hath chosen the path of Darkness.\n"
"Mayhaps thee should seek a villain like thyself for training."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2265 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7759
msgid ""
"Ah, fellow Crusaders!\n"
"I know thee thirsts for another task with which to hone thy Crusading skills, but first thee must pass a far more serious test.\n"
"Thee must agree to follow the Path of Light before I can help thee further.\n"
"You will know when you have made this choice.\n"
"Return to me then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2277 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7765
msgid ""
"Though thy deeds remain impressive indeed, crusaders, I cannot declare thee Heroes until you have rescued the girl!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7768
msgid ""
"Thee’ve done it! I knew thee could do it!\n"
"I’m so proud of thee!\n"
"Alice has been freed of the clutches of the wicked William Setag, evil has been vanquished, and good upheld.\n"
"Where once there was wrong, now there is right! [Charles sighs and smiles broadly] Well.\n"
"My work here is done!\n"
"Thee have passed the tests and deserve thy reward.\n"
"Therefore do I solemnly declare thee Heroes! "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2282 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7792
msgid ""
"Help!\n"
"William has captured me and imprisoned me in this tower.\n"
"Please get me out of here as quickly as possible, I don't want to die."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2285 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7797
msgid "Thank you so much for helping me away from William's clutches."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2286 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7801
msgid ""
"Excuse me, but who might you be?\n"
"Hey!\n"
"Get your hands off of me!\n"
"Help!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2290 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7806
msgid ""
"Where do you think you're taking me?\n"
"I have a rich family-- you'll be in a lot of trouble if you don't let me go!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2280 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7808
msgid ""
"It should be impossible for you to see this right now.\n"
"If you are reading this, tell Bryan that the event and/or logic of this quest is messed up because you should either be good attempting the Hero quest, or evil attempting the Villain quest and you are apparently neither."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2301 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7814
msgid ""
"I'd certainly love nothing more than to corrupt your obviously pious soul, but I'm afraid you wouldn't have the stomach to follow through with my teachings.\n"
"You have chosen the Path of Light, you will garner no assistance from me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2292 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7817
msgid ""
"Let's get down to business, shall we?\n"
"I know you are well aware of my standing as the blackest Villain in Erathia.\n"
"It requires effort and drive to prove to be this evil-- I hope you have the mettle for it.\n"
"I would love nothing more than to keep you in my training for years and teach you the finest parts of being a Villain.\n"
"Unfortunately, I am under pressure to speed up your tutelage.\n"
"To this end, I have a direct way to learn the arts of Villainhood.\n"
"There is a woman, Alice Hargreaves, who is of noble blood and pure character.\n"
"Capture this woman from her residence in Castle Gryphonheart. Return here and imprison her in my tower.\n"
"Complete this, and I shall promote all Crusaders in your group to Villains, and the rest of your group to Honorary Villains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2334 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7827
msgid ""
"I cannot improve upon training you do not already have.\n"
"You must be promoted to Crusader before I can train you in the ways of villainy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2303 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7831
msgid ""
"Before you make this decision, you have a more pressing, immediate decision you will be forced to make.\n"
"If you choose the darker road, you may return to me and complete your training in the Paladins' arts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2309 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7838
msgid ""
"Where's Alice?\n"
"I'm not asking for much, just a simple kidnapping.\n"
"Is it really that difficult?\n"
"I suggest you speed up your efforts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2305 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7841
msgid ""
"Capital!\n"
"You have shown dedication, daring, and the power of raw force.\n"
"Certainly the imprisonment of such a fair and noble creature in this wicked place earns you the right to be called a Villain-- or Honorary Villain.\n"
"Go now upon the world and make all fear your name."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:62 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:785
msgid "Dragon Slayers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2313 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7863
msgid ""
"Ah, it is normal for novice Monks to ask for the path of enlightenment.\n"
"I shall tell you of the path, though the journey is yours to make.\n"
"In the Barrow Downs is a series of tombs-- one of which was constructed on a site of great natural power.\n"
"You will know the right barrow because it is different from the rest.\n"
"Reach this barrow and meditate by the water, and your promotion to Initiate will be complete."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2323 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7869
msgid ""
"You have not finished your journey.\n"
"Return to me only when you have completed your task."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2318 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7873
msgid ""
"[Bartholomew Hume contacts you mentally] Congratulations, young ones.\n"
"My final lesson given to you as Monks is this:\n"
"enlightenment is gained by the journey, not the destination.\n"
"In this case, the destination was critical to prove that you were capable of the journey.\n"
"I shall now promote all Monks to Initiates and everyone else to Honorary Initiates-- congratulations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2330 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7893
msgid ""
"I am sorry, but I am permitted to train you no longer.\n"
"You will need to find a new Master to learn from."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2325 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7896
msgid ""
"I see you wish to continue your journey.\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"Have no fear, for you are prepared for your next step.\n"
"You must extinguish the remnants of an evil order- the Order of Baa.\n"
"Defeat their High Priest and return to me and I shall complete your training and promote you to Master."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:245 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:790
msgid ""
"That cursed knight, Charles Quixote is assembling his best Dragon Slayers at an encampment to the southwest of here.\n"
"He must be planning another assault upon the Dragon Caves!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2332 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7900
msgid ""
"A fork approaches in your path.\n"
"I will only train you after you've chosen to walk the lighter path."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2403 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7908
msgid ""
"The Temple of Baa still stands, their High Priest still lives.\n"
"Until this is completed, you are not ready for the title of Master.\n"
"Go now and do not fail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2398 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7911
msgid ""
"Good work.\n"
"No longer shall the Order of Baa stain the lands of Erathia.\n"
"Now, allow me to promote all Initiates to Masters, and all Honorary Initiates to Honorary Masters.\n"
"Keep in mind that this is but a stop along the path of enlightenment.\n"
"Your journey only ends with your eventual death-- never close your mind."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:224 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:793
msgid ""
"Have you slain the “Dragon Slayers?\"\n"
"Where is the sword of Whistlebone the Slayer?!?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2417 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7934 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7948
msgid ""
"[Stephan Sand sneers] YOU want ME to teach you something?\n"
"You sniveling do-gooders make my knife arm twitch!\n"
"Get out of my sight before I REALLY teach you about fighting!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2406 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7937 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7951
msgid ""
"An agent of mine has sent me a message I need deciphered.\n"
"The cipher relies on knowing which word of which a certain book to match it against.\n"
"If you wish to become a Ninja, this is what you must do: Infiltrate the School of Wizardry and find out what the third word of the famed Scroll of Waves is.\n"
"Use it to decipher the message, then do what the message tells you to do.\n"
"It is the key to enter the Tomb of the Master.\n"
"You'll find the tomb in Southern Erathia.\n"
"[Stephan hands you a scrap of paper] Here is the encoded message."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2420 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7943 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7957
msgid ""
"Though you have achieved initiate status, I am uncertain that you can stomach some of my more extreme teachings.\n"
"Return to me when you have formally rejected all philosophies that turn people into weaklings and cowards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2413 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7961
msgid ""
"Ambition is good, but I only train experienced students.\n"
"Come back when you've achieved Initiate status, and perhaps I'll teach you…IF you have the right outlook.\n"
"If you're looking for someone who is willing to help you become an Initiate, perhaps you should start with that wimp Bartholomew Hume.\n"
"I'm sure he'd be willing to give you an elementary education."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2433 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7969
msgid ""
"Well done.\n"
"No one can argue with success except apologists for the weak and the cowardly.\n"
"I hereby promote all Initiates to Ninjas, and all non-Initiates to Honorary Ninjas.\n"
"Oh yeah, go ahead and keep that little trinket you stole from the tomb.\n"
"This was just a training exercise, after all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2422 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7987
msgid ""
"So you have the key, but you haven't followed the directions in the message.\n"
"Remember, the tomb is in Southern Erathia.\n"
"Complete your task, and return to me to report success.\n"
"If you can't complete your mission, don't bother returning to me.\n"
"Failure is pathetic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2427 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7989
msgid ""
"[Sand sighs] Once again, the cipher key is the third word of the first paragraph of the Scroll of Waves.\n"
"You can find it somewhere in the School of Wizardry.\n"
"I don't care how you get in there--kill anyone who gets in your way, or sneak in.\n"
"Whatever you want.\n"
"The only thing that matters is success.\n"
"Everything else is an excuse for personal weakness."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2438 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:7996 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8007
msgid ""
"A few generations ago, an enchanted bow was created by alchemists in the Tularean Forest to seal another peace treaty between the elves and the humans.\n"
"While en route to Erathia, the bow was taken from the couriers by the Titans in Avlee.\n"
"They have no use for the thing, so it's probably in their stronghold still.\n"
"Strike a blow for our profession, and get that bow back.\n"
"It is absolutely the finest thing of its kind ever made.\n"
"Oh, and while you're there, feel free to cut some of those bullies down to size--They stole it out of cruelty, not need!\n"
"If you are successful, I will promote all Warrior Mages to Master Archers, or honorary Master Archers, as the case may be."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2449 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8000 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8011
msgid ""
"You have chosen the path of Darkness.\n"
"I will never help you improve, for fear you will use your skills to advance your selfish goals!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2445 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8002 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8013
msgid ""
"So, you've achieved the rank of Warrior Mage, and wish to advance to Master Archer!\n"
"A worthy goal, but I only promote those who's heart and courage match their skill.\n"
"Come back to me when you have firmly committed to the Light.\n"
"Then I will help you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2451 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8016
msgid ""
"I am the person to see if you want to become Master Archers, but you have come too soon!\n"
"You must have the proper background to become a Master, and that means first becoming a warrior mage.\n"
"Return when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2457 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8023
msgid ""
"No luck getting the bow?\n"
"Well, take your time, and plan your assault against the Titans carefully.\n"
"Against such powerful opponents, there is no shame in striking and retreating.\n"
"Do what you must to defeat these monsters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2454 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8026
msgid ""
"You found the bow!\n"
"Let me take some measurements and adjust it to your specific style of archery. Once I have finished you should keep it, and use it in defense the of the land and the people.\n"
"I am happy to promote all Warrior Mages to Master Archers, and all Honorary Warrior Mages to Honorary Master Archers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2461 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8050
msgid ""
"[Wheeze] So you think you can become Warrior Mages, do you?\n"
"It isn't easy.\n"
"You must be equally proficient in magical skills and physical skills.\n"
"There is a test of this.\n"
"Visit the Red Dwarf Mines.\n"
"Inside you will find two kinds of beasts--one that can be harmed only with magic, and one that can be harmed only with steel.\n"
"In the back of the lower section of the mines you will find a machine created by the Dwarves that powers the lift-- the only access between the upper and lower sections of the mines.\n"
"To keep the creatures trapped in the lower section, you will have to replace the belt in the machine with this one, a worn belt that will only last about an hour before breaking.\n"
"This should give you enough time to get to the lift and get out before you are trapped down there.\n"
"Seal away these creatures and return to me-- only then will I call you Warrior Mages."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2478 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8059
msgid ""
"You haven't sabotaged the machine yet.\n"
"You must finish this before I'll promote you to Warrior Mage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2471 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8062
msgid ""
"Very Good.\n"
"You have passed the test.\n"
"Now the creatures are sealed away and won't be able to prey on the dwarves any longer, and you have proven your ability in both sorcery and steel.\n"
"I am proud to declare all Archers amongst you Warrior Mages, and everyone else Honorary Warrior Mages.\n"
"Congratulations!\n"
"Now get out.\n"
"I already weary of your company."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:63 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:807
msgid "Sword of the Slayer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2480 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8083
msgid ""
"Getting ambitious, are we?\n"
"Think you can earn the title of sniper?\n"
"Perhaps you can.\n"
"Here is what you must do:\n"
"In the stronghold of the Titans is a very special bow that was meant as a peace offering from the elves to the humans to quell a conflict long since forgotten.\n"
"[Master Snick shakes his head] Gads! This peace stuff makes me nauseous!\n"
"In any case, fetch the bow for the good of our profession, and I'll promote you to Sniper.\n"
"[Heh] you better act like snipers if you expect to defeat the Titans.\n"
"A toe to toe...or should I say head to knee fight won't go well for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2493 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8087
msgid ""
"Following the Path of Light, are we?\n"
"How can you be a Sniper if you cry everytime you shoot someone in the back?\n"
"Maybe you should ask that lily-livered Lawrence Mark to help you.\n"
"I know that I will not."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2489 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8089
msgid ""
"Want to be a Sniper, eh? Maybe.\n"
"But I doubt you have the heart for it.\n"
"It needs to shrivel like a raisin and get hard as a stone to be able to do what you must.\n"
"Prove to me you are following the Path of Darkness, and then I will teach you further."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2504 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8096
msgid ""
"More failure? [Master Snick yawns]\n"
"How surprising.\n"
"I'll make it simple--no bow, no title."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2497 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8099
msgid ""
"You have the bow?!\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"It's been centuries since someone was brave enough to take on the Titans and try to get that bow back!\n"
"Let me take some measurements and adjust it to your specific style of archery.\n"
"I am proud to be the one to first call all Warrior Mages amongst you Snipers, and to say that all Honorary Warrior Mages are Honorary Snipers!\n"
"I must admit I didn't think you had it in you to succeed.\n"
"I am happy that I was wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:238 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:810
msgid ""
"You have killed the Dragon Slayers, but where is the Sword of Whistlebone?\n"
"Return to me when you have it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2515 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8125 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8137
msgid ""
"Call you Champions?\n"
"Never!\n"
"The only reason I'm not hacking you evil doers to bits is that you came here peacefully.\n"
"Leave now, before I change my mind and rid the world of another problem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2507 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8128 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8140
msgid ""
"So you want to be champions, do you?\n"
"Ha!\n"
"How can you be a champion if you don't win any tournaments?\n"
"You know, I can't really promote you to Champion status--you have to do it yourself, just like everything else.\n"
"Go and win five championship tournaments in the Arena at Knight level, and come back to me.\n"
"I'll call you Champions then, if you want."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2513 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8132 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8144
msgid ""
"I can see you very much want to be called Champions, but I'm not so sure I should help you.\n"
"Prove to me that you follow the Path of Light, and then we'll talk about promotion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:228 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:814 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:835
msgid ""
"You return to me with the sword of the Slayer, Whistlebone!\n"
"You are indeed worthy of my notice!\n"
"The Dragons in your group are promoted to Great Wyrm!\n"
"I will teach the others of your group what skills I can as a reward for their assistance!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2519 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8148
msgid ""
"I am the person to talk to if you want to be called Champions.\n"
"First, though, you must practice.\n"
"Return to me when you've become Cavaliers.\n"
"Then, if you have the right outlook, I will tell you what you must do to become Champions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2526 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8155
msgid ""
"You have not yet won 5 championship tournaments in the Arena.\n"
"Return to me when you have won five, and I will promote you.\n"
"Remember, these battles MUST be at the Knight difficulty level."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2523 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8158
msgid ""
"Congratulations for you recent tourney victories, my friends!\n"
"I gladly name the Cavaliers among you Champions, and the Honorary Cavaliers I name Honorary Champions!\n"
"Always fight for the Light, Champions!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2529 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8178
msgid ""
"The hallmark of the Cavalier is courage.\n"
"I can promote you to Cavalier status, but before I'll do that, you'll have to prove to me your bravery in battle.\n"
"Since most people are yellow bellied cowards at heart, I doubt you'll succeed.\n"
"But if you want to try, here is what you must do: Destroy all the undead in the haunted mansion in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2538 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8186
msgid ""
"Did one little haunted house send you packing in fear?\n"
"I've seen chocolate eclairs with more backbone than you!\n"
"Get you gone, and don't come back 'til you've stiffened your spine!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2533 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8189
msgid ""
"So you're back!\n"
"And from the look on your faces I see you have finished the job.\n"
"Well done!\n"
"I hereby officially promote all Knights amongst you to Cavaliers, and everyone else to honorary Cavaliers.\n"
"Carry your title with pride!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2541 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8209
msgid ""
"So you think you can become Black Knights, do you?\n"
"Very well.\n"
"You know, I've heard many people say that criminals are cowards.\n"
"That just isn't true.\n"
"It takes a lot of courage to risk your life in a robbery, or in battle.\n"
"You've already proven you are courageous, and now it's time to put that courage and your skills to use.\n"
"I want you to rob the Elvish Treasury.\n"
"It's one of the biggest hoards of treasure in the land, and it is very well guarded.\n"
"Do the deed and abscond with the wealth.\n"
"Return to me when you've finished.\n"
"Then I will promote you to Black Knights."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8213
msgid ""
"Bah!\n"
"You do-gooders are worthless!\n"
"It is impossible for me to teach anything more to you!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2552 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8215
msgid ""
"It's true that I am the one you go to when you're looking to be promoted to Black Knight status.\n"
"But how can you become a Black Knight when you haven't even decided whether or not you're evil?\n"
"Return to me when you have fully committed to Darkness.\n"
"Only then will I resume your training."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2566 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8221
msgid ""
"Robbery not complete?\n"
"No.\n"
"Don't come to me and report failure.\n"
"Don't come and tell me you lost your nerve.\n"
"Get out there and rob that treasury!\n"
"Failure is not an option!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2560 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8224
msgid ""
"All RIGHT!\n"
"That robbery was brilliant!\n"
"I am very proud of you.\n"
"Keep the loot--it's your reward for a job well done.\n"
"I can safely say the Cavaliers among you have become Black Knights today, and I'll throw in an Honorary Black Knight title for the rest of you.\n"
"You've done well, my students!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2572 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8246 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8257
msgid ""
"Well, it looks like you might be able to do the job I have in mind.\n"
"The fundamental task a Ranger Lord faces is caring for the land.\n"
"Recently, poachers removed a magical gemstone called the \"heart of the forest\" from the Tularean Forest.\n"
"The forest has become restless, and attacks travelers who come too close.\n"
"The forest blames all 'Walkers' for the theft, and won't calm down until the stone is returned.\n"
"Find the stone and return it to the oldest tree in the Forest.\n"
"Come back to me when you've done this."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2586 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8250 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8261
msgid ""
"[Lysander frowns] You've chosen the path of darkness.\n"
"I refuse to teach such as you--you would only use my lessons to further your selfish goals.\n"
"May Heaven have mercy on your souls."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2579 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8252 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8263
msgid ""
"I would like to be your teacher--I really would, but I'm not sure you're cut out to be a Ranger Lord.\n"
"Soon you must make a decision of the heart.\n"
"If you choose the Path of Light, return to me.\n"
"I would be honored to be your teacher."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2583 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8266
msgid ""
"[Lysander shakes his head, smiling gently] Too soon, eager ones.\n"
"I train only the most advanced students.\n"
"Seek me out again when you reach Hunter status."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2596 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8272
msgid ""
"You've done a good thing, returning the Heart.\n"
"The forest is quieter now, and no longer attacks travelers.\n"
"You've probably saved many lives.\n"
"For service to the Land and the Light, I hereby promote all Hunters among you to Ranger Lords, and all honorary Hunters to honorary Ranger Lords!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2594 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8290
msgid ""
"Well, you've spoken with the tree, and now know as much as I do about the theft.\n"
"If you manage to find the stone, take it directly to the tree and then come see me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2589 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8292
msgid ""
"If you can't figure out where to start, you should try finding the oldest tree in the forest.\n"
"It should be somewhere outside of Pierpont in Avlee.\n"
"The oldest tree has the power of speech, and may know something helpful.\n"
"It will be happy to tell you whatever you want to hear, plus a whole lot more.\n"
"You'll see."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8297
msgid ""
"Think you can improve?\n"
"I have a test for you.\n"
"A hunter needs to understand the woods, and a hunter needs to be as skilled with magic as with a blade.\n"
"The best teachers for that are the faeries.\n"
"There's a faerie mound in Northern Avlee.\n"
"Figure out how to get in, and the Faeries will grant magic to the genuine rangers among you, meaning that they will be promoted to Hunter status.\n"
"The rest of you will be honorary hunters. "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8303
msgid ""
"Foxed by the Faeries? [Ebednezer snickers, then begins to laugh uproariously at his own wit] Foxed?\n"
"Faeries?\n"
"Hahahah!\n"
"Get it?\n"
"Foxed… you know…ah ahahah.\n"
"Maybe not.\n"
"Well, I've already told you how to become Hunters.\n"
"Get inside the Faerie Mound in Avlee.\n"
"Now, stop bothering me!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2629 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8308
msgid ""
"Gahhh!\n"
"I can smell the stink of self righteousness on you!\n"
"Get away from me!\n"
"G'won, get!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8311
msgid ""
"Better a bounty hunter than a plain old hunter, huh?\n"
"Well, this test is even simpler than the Faerie Mound idea, and you won't have to think so hard.\n"
"Ever notice how the town halls are always looking for someone to kill a monster for them?\n"
"All you have to do is collect 10,000 in bounties from town halls.\n"
"When you've done that, come back to me, and I'll promote you to Bounty Hunters.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2623 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8315
msgid ""
"I'll be blunt.\n"
"I don't think I like you.\n"
"You'll have to prove to me you're worth something.\n"
"Soon, you will have to choose if you'll follow the Path of Dark or the Path of Light.\n"
"If you choose Light, don't even bother speaking to me again.\n"
"Got it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2641 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8322
msgid ""
"Not yet, not good enough!\n"
"You need to collect more bounties, and more importantly, kill more creatures.\n"
"There's some good clean fun in that.\n"
"Killing, don't you know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2633 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8325
msgid ""
"So, how did if feel?\n"
"All that killing?\n"
"Mmmmm.\n"
"Heh.\n"
"You qualify, my friends.\n"
"You definitely qualify.\n"
"All Hunters amongst you are now Bounty Hunters, and all Honorary hunters and Honorary Bounty Hunters!\n"
"Good job."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:232 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:833
msgid ""
"You return to me with the sword of the Slayer, Whistlebone!\n"
"Is there no end to the treachery that you will commit? Is there no one that you owe allegiance to?\n"
"I will promote those Dragons who travel with you to Great Wyrm, however they will never fly underneath me!\n"
"There rest of your traitorous group will be instructed in those skills which can be taught to them!\n"
"Go now!\n"
"Never show your face here again, unless you want it eaten!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2645 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8345
msgid ""
"Come to my door looking for magic?\n"
"Thee've always had it, if thee knew where to look.\n"
"Some I tell this to, and they still can't see it, though it be plain as the nose on their face.\n"
"Those amongst thee that are simple Rangers are now Hunters, and those who aren't are but Honorary Hunters.\n"
"Clever the ones who can knock on my door!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2650 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8375
msgid ""
"The thieves reached deep inside me to take my Heart.\n"
"The grapevines say they are hiding in the Mercenary Guild in Tatalia.\n"
"We would squeeze them, but they aren't close enough to reach.\n"
"Walkers are needed to catch walkers.\n"
"Catch the thieves for us.\n"
"Ok?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2662 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8394
msgid ""
"Oh, the forest is still very angry.\n"
"The grapevines say the thieves have not left their hiding place.\n"
"You will catch the thieves for us, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2656 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8397
msgid ""
"Ahhh!\n"
"[The tree sighs happily]\n"
"You have the heart!\n"
"The forest sings with joy!\n"
"Tonight we will recite the song of the ancestors.\n"
"Will you stay and recite with us?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8412 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8423
msgid ""
"Priests.\n"
"You have come to me seeking that I be your guide on the Path of Light.\n"
"But be warned, to learn its ways, you must learn the ways of your own soul.\n"
"I would suggest that we meditate on this for awhile, but you look like you're in a hurry.\n"
"South of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.\n"
"Both are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.The Church of the Sun was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Light.\n"
"I propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Sun.\n"
"Using the map that Daedalus Falk sent you to find in order to become priests, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.\n"
"There, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Sun by purifying the altar in the Church of the Moon.\n"
"This will so weaken the Moon cult that the Church of the Sun will be able to overcome them in battle.\n"
"Return to me when you have done this.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2683 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8416 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8427
msgid ""
"You've come to the wrong person if you want to be promoted beyond priest.\n"
"I am well aware of your choice to follow the Path of the Dark, and I will have nothing to do with you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2677 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8418 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8429
msgid ""
"If you wish to follow the Path of Light, first you must formally choose it.\n"
"Soon you will be asked to make the choice, and the way will be clear.\n"
"Until then, I cannot be your guide."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2680 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8432
msgid ""
"If you wish to become Priests of the Light, you must first become Priests.\n"
"I don't have time to train priests, but my bitter rival, Daedalus Falk, does.\n"
"Do not worry, he will promote you fairly, even if you do not wish to follow the terrible path of darkness that he represents."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2688 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8438
msgid ""
"You must visit Evenmorn island and purify the Altar of Darkness in the Church of the Moon.\n"
"Only then can I promote you to Priests of the Light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2685 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8441
msgid ""
"Your bravery has advanced our faith tremendously, Priests.\n"
"It's with a glad heart that I can hereby promote all Priests to Priests of the Light, and all honorary Priests to Honorary Priests of the Light.\n"
"Thank you so much for your help!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2690 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8462
msgid ""
"[Falk gives you a grandfatherly smile] You have, perhaps, an ambition to be priests?\n"
"I can help you, if you'll help me.\n"
"There is an island south of Bracada where stands an old temple that I need to find again.\n"
"I think the pirates west of Erathia must know where the island is.\n"
"The Erathian navy is rather feeble, and hasn't been able to root them out of their hiding places amongst the Tidewater Caverns.\n"
"Perhaps the pirates have a map.\n"
"If you can bring me that map, I would promote you to Priest status immediately."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2704 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8470
msgid ""
"If there is a map that says where that island is, the map would be in the Tidewater Caverns of western Erathia.\n"
"When you bring me that map, then I will be happy to promote you all to Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2697 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8473
msgid ""
"The Map!\n"
"You found it!\n"
"[Falk looks at the map, and points at the island] There it is.\n"
"The island has been shrouded in mist since the Churches of the Sun and Moon began fighting over a century ago.\n"
"Keep the map--I have the coordinates now, and will have no trouble finding the place when I need to.\n"
"I am proud to declare the Clerics amongst you to be Priests, and the rest to be honorary Priests.\n"
"Thank you so much for your good work!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:471 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8497
msgid ""
"How dare you insult me with your presence?\n"
"You have chosen the Path of the Light, and have forever renounced me as your teacher.\n"
"Go now, and wallow in your weakness somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8500
msgid ""
"Priests.\n"
"[Falk gazes coldly at you] Well it is that you have come to see the wisdom of the Path of the Dark.\n"
"Never regret your decision, and never look back.\n"
"South of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.\n"
"Both are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.The Church of the Moon was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Darkness.\n"
"I propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Moon.\n"
"Using the map that I sent you to find, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.\n"
"There, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Moon by defiling the altar in the Church of the Sun.\n"
"This will so weaken the Sun cult that the Church of the Moon will be able to overcome them in battle.\n"
"Return to me when you have done this.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2717 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8504
msgid ""
"If you wish to follow the Path of Darkness, first you must formally choose it.\n"
"Soon you will be asked to make the choice, and the way will be clear.\n"
"Until then, I cannot be your guide."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2720 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8511
msgid ""
"You must visit Evenmorn island and defile the Altar of Light in the Church of the Sun.\n"
"Only then can I promote you to Priests of the Dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:474 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8514
msgid ""
"Your bravery has advanced our faith tremendously, Priests.\n"
"It's with pleasure that I can hereby promote all Priests to Priests of the Dark, and all honorary Priests to Honorary Priests of the Dark.\n"
"Thank you so much for your help!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2722 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8535
msgid ""
"I am indeed the one to speak to if you wish to become Wizards.\n"
"Every student of mine must complete a project before I name them Wizards.\n"
"This year's project is to build a golem.\n"
"There are spare parts scattered about the lands from here to Avlee.\n"
"You'll need all four limbs plus the torso and the head.\n"
"Pay special attention to where you get the head--one of my students made a mistake while making a head last summer and gave the defective head away as a joke.\n"
"When you have all the parts, come talk to me.\n"
"I'll promote you to Wizards then, and I'll animate your Golem.\n"
"Well, on your way, and have fun!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8543 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8563
msgid ""
"[You proudly display your assembled golem to Master Grey, and he nods approvingly] Well done.\n"
"Head looks alright, but you can never be sure…Well, good work!\n"
"Clearly, you qualify for Wizard status.\n"
"All Sorcerers amongst you are now Wizards, and all non Sorcerers are now honorary Wizards!\n"
"[Master Grey spends awhile casting the spell that animates your golem] He's all yours!\n"
"Take him back to your castle and put him where you want.\n"
"He'll attack intruders relentlessly.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:482 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8583
msgid ""
"You have to have all the parts together and properly assembled for me to animate it, students!\n"
"I can't animate incomplete golems."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2739 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8590
msgid ""
"Welcome back, students.\n"
"The golem lesson was just an exercise, but to advance to Archmage, you really have to do something for the profession.\n"
"Copies of the fabled Divine Intervention spell are very rare, and unfortunately the School doesn't have one.\n"
"There's been a history of bad luck regarding the spell.It has been around for time immemorial, but the spell has never found its way into our hands.\n"
"Always just out of reach, we often send guild members to find it, but every one has failed.\n"
"Sometimes they have it in their hands, but lose it on the way back, other times, the book seems to vanish, only to resurface 20 years later in some old dungeon, or on a deserted island.\n"
"Right now, we think it's in the Breeding Zone in the Pit.\n"
"Find the spell, and return with it.\n"
"Break the curse!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2750 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8594
msgid ""
"You've chosen Darkness, my students.\n"
"I will teach you no more."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2748 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8596
msgid ""
"Archmage training is reserved only for people dedicated to the Path of Light.\n"
"Prove to me you have chosen the right way, and I will be proud to be your teacher."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2762 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8603
msgid ""
"I expect trouble finding the book, which is why I'm sending you to find it.\n"
"I know you can succeed in this mission.\n"
"Keep trying!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2752 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8606
msgid ""
"The book!\n"
"The book!\n"
"[Master Grey clutches his ears and spins around in joy] You did it!\n"
"Oh, what a wonderful day!\n"
"I am so proud of you!\n"
"You're all Archmages!\n"
"Of course, if you weren't Wizards to begin with, it's only an honorary title, but who cares?\n"
"You found the book!\n"
"[The Master sets the book down on a table next to a blank book.\n"
"Both open simultaneously, and quill arises from the desk to begin copying the text in the new book] You may keep the copy, and you should start seeing more copies in the Light guilds of Bracada and Celeste."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2765 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8629 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8640
msgid ""
"Fear not death?\n"
"I can perform the Ritual on any Wizard.\n"
"You need a Soul Jar.\n"
"Years ago the Wizards stole a shipment of Jars en route from Nighon to Deyja.\n"
"The jars are very hard to destroy, so they hid them, thinking we would never be able to find them.Fortunately for us, dead men do indeed tell tales.\n"
"Better, in fact, than living ones--dead men never forget, never refuse to talk, and never lie.\n"
"So, we found the one who buried the Jars, and made him die.\n"
"He was very cooperative after his death, and said he hid them somewhere in the Walls of Mist for the Wizards in Celeste. Retrieve these jars and I will perform the Ritual on all Wizards amongst you.\n"
"The rest may become Honorary Liches, for what that's worth, in thanks for finding the extra Jars for us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2779 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8633 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8644
msgid ""
"Having chosen the path of Light, you are not suited to become Liches.\n"
"The Ritual would reject you, and you would die a real death.\n"
"If that is what you want, you certainly don't need my help…"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2776 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8635 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8646
msgid ""
"Only followers of the Dark Path can become Liches.\n"
"You have not yet chosen the path.\n"
"Return when you choose Darkness."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2774 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8649
msgid ""
"If you haven't even become Wizards yet, you aren't ready to become Liches.\n"
"Trouble me not 'til you're qualified."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2795 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8663
msgid ""
"I have no spare Jars with which to perform the Ritual.\n"
"It is impossible for me to promote you until you return with the Jars.\n"
"Remember, each one of you must have a Jar to be Promoted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2782 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8666
msgid ""
"Jars.\n"
"Yessss.\n"
"You have helped us greatly.\n"
"Now for the Ritual.\n"
"[The Lich draws a knife, and approaches you]\n"
"This won't hurt a bit!\n"
"[The ritual actually hurts quite a bit, and takes several hours to complete.\n"
"When it is over, the Lich speaks again]\n"
"So, now it is done.\n"
"Those among you who were Wizards are now most certainly Liches.\n"
"Those who were not, have my gratitude for returning the jars, and I will call you \"Honorary Liches\".\n"
"Remember, Liches must keep their Soul Jars with them at all times while they travel.\n"
"You cannot be separated from your Jar for long, or you will die a real death."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:240 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:868
msgid ""
"Hmmm…things must be serious if trader Loudrin is involving himself in matters other than his own fortunes...and I must say that there is a taint of doom in the air.If only for continued good business between my operation and his, I would normally entertain this notion of Loudrin's. Unfortunately, matters here are tying up all of my resources. I have none to spare for support of this alliance you speak of.Say, perhaps we can help each other? If you were to take care of a little matter for me, I could consider honoring your request."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2798 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8692
msgid ""
"Advancement as a Druid is simple.\n"
"You must visit the three ancient temples to nature we erected centuries ago and pray at their centers.\n"
"They are in Tatalia, Evenmorn Isle, and Avlee, and look like circles of stone with an altar of water in their centers.\n"
"Where exactly I will not say, but exploring the land about them is part of the process.\n"
"When you have visited all three Circles, return to me to detail your experience."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8699
msgid ""
"I have only to look into your eyes to see where you've been.\n"
"You have seen the circles, and they have left their imprint upon you.\n"
"Telling you that all Druids amongst you are now Great Druids is but a formality.\n"
"Telling the rest of you that you're now honorary Druids is showing you respect for the respect you have shown me and my faith.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2806 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8716 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8719
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8722
msgid ""
"You've found a circle!\n"
"Very good, but you must find all three before you will be ready for promotion.\n"
"Remember, circles three, then return to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8724
msgid ""
"Visit the Circles, then return to me.\n"
"That is the process.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2814 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8730
msgid ""
"To be named an Arch Druid, you must serve the land.\n"
"I know of a service you could perform.\n"
"In the land above Stone City, where the Dwarves bury their dead, is the barrow of King Zokarr IV.\n"
"He died fighting in defense of Stone City during the invasion of Erathia by Nighon.\n"
"His remains were never recovered and still lie in those tunnels.\n"
"\n"
"Retrieve his bones and place them in his coffin in his barrow.\n"
"When you have done this, the King will rest, and so will the land.\n"
"Return to me when you've performed this service, and I will perform the Ceremony of Ascension and name you Arch Druids."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2826 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8734
msgid ""
"Servants of Darkness, I am sorry I promoted you earlier.\n"
"I am ashamed I didn't notice the darkness in your souls until it was too late.\n"
"Leave me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2823 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8736
msgid ""
"I am dedicated to the service of the Light.\n"
"I will not promote you further until you are as dedicated as I.\n"
"Come back to me when you choose the Light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2835 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8742
msgid ""
"The Service is not easy, but it needs to be done.\n"
"Remember, you must bring the bones of King Zokarr IV from where they lie in the tunnels between Stone City and Nighon to Zokarr's coffin in a secret dwarven barrow.\n"
"Only then can I perform the Ceremony of Ascension and promote you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2829 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8745
msgid ""
"[Master Green seems beside himself with joy at your accomplishment] I felt the King's soul return to the land of the dead when you returned his bones.\n"
"The land breathed a sigh of relief--did you feel it?\n"
"The Ceremony of Ascension is complete.\n"
"I'm happy to promote all Great Druids amongst you to Arch Druids, and all honorary Great Druids to Honorary Arch Druids.\n"
"This is a very happy day!\n"
"Your service will be remembered!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2838 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8767 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8778
msgid ""
"Becoming a Warlock for some is a simple process, and for others it is nearly impossible.\n"
"You need to find a familiar suited to your personality.\n"
"The familiar will help to focus your magical abilities and sharpen your concentration.\n"
"Sometimes a single familiar can be shared, other times not.\n"
"The magical effects will not be noticed by anyone but a Great Druid--someone who is already attuned to nature.\n"
"Now, let me see what kind of familiar you will need...[Tor picks up an elaborately carved gem and peers at you through it.\n"
"He frowns.]\n"
"Hmm.\n"
"Well, the good news is that you all need the same familiar, and when you find it, you will be very powerful.\n"
"The bad news is that you need to find a dragon familiar.\n"
"You must find a dragon egg.\n"
"Bring them back here and I will hatch it, and cast the familiar spell.\n"
"The baby dragon will imprint to you all, and you to it.\n"
"You may be able to find an egg in a dragon cave in the Land of the Giants.\n"
"'Ware the mother, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2858 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8771 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8782
msgid ""
"Hmmmm.\n"
"[Tor looks at you carefully]\n"
"Nope.\n"
"Can't teach you.\n"
"You chose the Path of Light.\n"
"I can smell it on you.\n"
"I can sympathize with your choice, but I know that none of our spells or rituals can promote you once you have started down that path.\n"
"Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8773 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8784
msgid ""
"Though I like to think of the Warlocks as being followers of the Path of Twilight, or Dawn, we are technically followers of the Path of Darkness.\n"
"You must be dedicated followers of Darkness before I can help you.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2853 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8787
msgid ""
"I would love to get you started on the way to becoming Warlocks, but nothing I can do for you will be of any use until you become Great Druids.\n"
"Return when you have achieved that level of understanding."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2880 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8794
msgid ""
"You need to bring me a dragon's egg so you I can hatch your familiar.\n"
"There is no way around this.\n"
"Try looking in the Land of the Giants for a dragon cave-- perhaps there you can find an egg."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8797
msgid ""
"[Tor looks at you in astonishment] You really found a dragon egg!\n"
"It's been more than a century since any Warlock has both needed and found a dragon familiar!\n"
"This will go down in the history books, that's for sure!\n"
"My spell book!\n"
"I need my book!\n"
"Ah, here it is.\n"
"[Tor chants a spell from the book, then taps the egg three times.\n"
"The egg hatches, and a baby dragon crawls out of the shell]\n"
"There you are!\n"
"Awww, isn't he cute?\n"
"Congratulations!\n"
"No longer are you simple Great Druids, but Warlocks!\n"
"Of course, that's just an honorary title if you weren't a natural Great Druid to begin with, but nonetheless, something to be proud of.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2883 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8828
msgid "You prepare the torso for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2884 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8840
msgid "You prepare the left leg for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2885 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8849
msgid "You prepare the right leg for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2886 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8861
msgid "You prepare the left arm for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2887 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8873
msgid "You prepare the right arm for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2888 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8888
msgid "You prepare the head for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:242 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:890
msgid ""
"Have you recovered the Dragon egg from Zog's Ravage Roaming fortress? Oh, never mind. I can see from your abashed expression that you have not.I stand firm on our deal. Bring me that egg, or I'll have nothing to do with your alliance!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2889 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8903
msgid ""
"You prepare the head (with a dent in it) for assembly with the rest of the parts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2891 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8938 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8944
msgid ""
"You have all the parts together!\n"
"Now you just have to return to Master Grey for the animation process."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1885 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:894
msgid ""
"Well, that matter's done. I will make arrangements to travel to Ravenshore so I myself may sit on your council. Frankly, I could use a bit of change. I will leave my second in command, Reginald Dorray, in charge.Again, good job."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2890 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8950
msgid "You have no parts to assemble yet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2893 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8980
msgid "You remove the normal head and replace it with the dented head."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2894 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8990
msgid "You remove the dented head and replace it with the normal head."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2895 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:8992
msgid ""
"You should not be reading this message.\n"
"This means that you somehow have triggered this event without holding the normal or Abbey normal Golem heads which, based on the preconditions for this event, is absolutely impossible.\n"
"Please tell Bryan that he lost his bet and owes Keith 5 bucks because this event doesn't work properly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2903 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9025
msgid ""
"I fear that talking will fail with these goblins, my lords.\n"
"May I suggest violence?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9028
msgid ""
"Thank heavens you've cleaned them out!\n"
"Now we need to find a way to clean up the castle and rebuild the damaged sections.\n"
"The only people I can think of who would have the inclination and the ability to do this are the Dwarves in Stone City, located in the Barrow Downs to the south.\n"
"The entrance to Stone City lies in the center of the Barrow Downs on one of the largest hills.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9040
msgid ""
"So…The new lords of Harmondale I have before me.\n"
"Not impressed.\n"
"Doubt other kings think much of you either.\n"
"Hrmph.\n"
"Probably get yourselves killed soon.\n"
"But maybe there's more than meets the eye here.\n"
"Yes.\n"
"Maybe you can do something for me, and I for you.\n"
"Medusas have taken my mines in eastern Bracada.\n"
"Turned a few of my people to stone.\n"
"Dangerous monsters, don't want to lose more lives on a rescue.\n"
"Ok to lose yours though.\n"
"Take this elixir and pour it on the statues.\n"
"Wake them up.\n"
"Then I will fix up your castle.\n"
"Give you respect.\n"
"Go now, and beware the griffins in Bracada.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9056 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9089
msgid ""
"Back again, eh?\n"
"Your part of the bargain isn't finished.\n"
"No help 'til you're done.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2923 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9059
msgid ""
"Welcome back, Lords of Harmondale!\n"
"Now, I will help you.\n"
"My engineer will work for you.\n"
"Fix up your castle.\n"
"You have my thanks.\n"
"You are welcome here forever.Hmmph.\n"
"One more thing.\n"
"Your work has interested the other courts.\n"
"They will send ambassadors to you now--check your throne room.\n"
"Watch your back, my friends."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:241 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:916
msgid ""
"One of my customers, an Ogre that goes by the charming moniker of \"Zog the Jackal,\" has seriously betrayed my trust. I gave him an item of great value on promise of future payment. This rather large payment never arrived. I sent a messenger to demand return of the item--a Dragon's egg of great potential. This messenger was slain!Needless to say, this matter concerns me greatly. I have allotted both money and men for the purpose of revenge. If, however, you were to recover the egg for me from Zog's fortress in Ravage Roaming, I would be glad to pledge service to your alliance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2937 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9206
msgid ""
"Your Queen wishes to speak with you as soon as possible.\n"
"Since the War, she has taken up residence at Gryphonheart Castle in Steadwick.\n"
"This is strictly business--whenever new lords assume their office she meets with them to make sure there are no misunderstandings.\n"
"Queen Catherine is particularly interested in you, and has told me she wishes to employ your services."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2941 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9210
msgid ""
"I've received word that you met with the Queen.\n"
"I hope it went well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2943 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9213
msgid ""
"The queen is very pleased with you!\n"
"The rescue operation went well, and Loren can no longer be held as a bargaining chip for that wicked King Parson!\n"
"When the current Harmondale conflict is over, I'm sure the Queen will reward you for your aid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2946 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9217
msgid ""
"The Queen tells me your loyalty is very strong.\n"
"You did the right thing when you informed the Queen of the treachery King Parson was plotting.\n"
"And I'll tell you this:\n"
"Your loyalty is not only strong, but it is well placed.\n"
"Harmondale is the rightful province of Erathia, despite Elvish claims to the contrary.\n"
"Your work for us helps to ensure that Harmondale will forever be in the hands of Humans."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:247 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:922
msgid ""
"You would like my herd to join into an alliance? How could I refuse you? Not only have you saved us from certain death, we have suffered directly from the cataclysm the alliance is being created to fight!You have my pledge. With the greatest haste I myself will travel to Ravenshore to take a seat on the alliance council."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2952 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9232
msgid ""
"[Lady Ellen gasps in delight] You have Gryphonheart's Trumpet!\n"
"This is wonderful!\n"
"When it disappeared from the strongbox, we thought it had been stolen by the enemy!\n"
"Thank you for bringing it back to us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2959 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9254
msgid ""
"I've learned from Queen Catherine that you betrayed us with the old false prisoner trick.\n"
"[Lady Ellen curtsies respectfully] Your skills in the art of deception are formidable.\n"
"I will be sure not to be tricked so easily by your sincere manner again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2962 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9270
msgid ""
"Though Avlee is not currently in charge of Harmondale, my King, Eldrich Parson of Avlee, lays claim to this territory as our rightful domain.\n"
"The reasons are complicated, but boil down to the simple fact that Erathia stole our land in the Timber Wars many years ago, and we will not give up until we have it back.\n"
"My King wishes to speak with you.\n"
"Please travel to Pierpont in the Tularean Forest and meet with him.\n"
"We will make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9274
msgid ""
"Messengers have informed me of your visit with my King.\n"
"I hope you can see now why we are the rightful rulers of Harmondale.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2970 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9277
msgid ""
"I've heard of your daring infiltration of Fort Riverstride, and I am impressed!\n"
"Our strategists are analyzing the plans now, and they say the information will be very useful in any assault they mount against the Fort.\n"
"You have Avlee's gratitude!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2973 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9281
msgid ""
"Word from Court is that you rejected a request from Erathia to break that spy Loren Steel out of prison.\n"
"Not only that, you helped us plant a false prisoner who has been feeding them misinformation ever since he got there.\n"
"Avlee is in your debt!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2976 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9296
msgid ""
"You have Gryphonheart's Trumpet!\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"We lost track of it during the raid, and were afraid that one of the Erathians got away with it.\n"
"Thank you very much for your help!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9318
msgid ""
"I've received a warning from my superiors regarding your delivery of falsified plans from Erathia.\n"
"The King is not amused. And there was some concern that you had more treachery in store for us.\n"
"[Alain smiles, true to his profession] All's fair in love and war, so it's all water under the bridge, eh?\n"
"Yes, all is forgotten.\n"
"[The ambassador chuckles heartily].\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2988 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9333
msgid ""
"[Queen Catherine inclines her head regally] You are the lot that won Lord Markham's silly contest, I see.\n"
"I must admit I had little faith until the Dwarf King recognized you as the rightful rulers of Harmondale.\n"
"You must have done something to win his respect, or he would have nothing to do with you.\n"
"I'm still not sure what he saw in you, but perhaps there really is something of substance here.\n"
"We shall see.Maybe you can do something for me that would make me think I should let you keep your new titles.\n"
"Recently, a valuable...agent of mine was arrested in the Tularean Forest for merely doing his job.\n"
"They're keeping him in a cave somewhere outside of Pierpont.\n"
"His name is Loren Steel, and they are threatening to execute him if certain unacceptable conditions are not met in 28 days.\n"
"Return with him before then and you will win respect, gold, and gratitude."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:573 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9342
msgid ""
"Well, time ran out for poor Loren.\n"
"He was executed for espionage by Avlee on schedule.\n"
"Don't bother with the rescue.\n"
"He's gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9349 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9364
msgid ""
"[Catherine stands and smiles] Good job!\n"
"You've really solved a terrible dilemma for me.\n"
"[Catherine turns to Loren and shakes his hand] Loren.\n"
"It's good to meet you at last.\n"
"Since everyone knows who you are now, you're not much good to me as a spy, but I would like to offer you a job in the Royal Diplomatic Corps.\n"
"Please give it some thought.\n"
"As for our heroes, you have my thanks.\n"
"My purser will credit your bank account with 5000 gold pieces for your services.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:936
msgid "Flood"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:248 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:937
msgid ""
"It was the worst of horrors! I was on guard in the main labyrinth just north of here when the waters came. A great wave as high as my head flooded through the passages. I managed to reach this high chamber. I waited for others, but there were none. I fear that many of the herd are dead or trapped inside the lair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9379
msgid ""
"[Catherine stands and smiles] Good job!\n"
"You've really solved a terrible dilemma for me.\n"
"[Catherine turns to the false Loren and shakes his hand] Loren.\n"
"It's good to meet you at last.\n"
"Since everyone knows who you are now, you're not much good to me as a spy, but I would like to offer you a job in the Royal Diplomatic Corps.\n"
"Please give it some thought.\n"
"As for our heroes, you have my thanks.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3006 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9391
msgid ""
"Loren's life is on the line.\n"
"I cannot give into the Elvish demands, or many more lives will be lost.\n"
"Please hurry.\n"
"I'm sure Avlee will execute him on schedule."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3018 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9397
msgid ""
"[The Queen's eyes narrow] What's this?\n"
"You're admitting to treachery?\n"
"How noble.\n"
"Guards!\n"
"Off with their heads!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3023 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9423
msgid ""
"King Parson asked you to steal the floor plan to Fort Riverstride?\n"
"Hmmm.\n"
"[Catherine turns to one of her advisors] Have some false plans of Fort Riverstride drawn up.\n"
"Make it painful.\n"
"[She turns back to you] If it's plans he wants, it's plans he'll get.\n"
"Give these plans to the King.\n"
"I'm sure he'll be grateful.\n"
"Make sure you don't let him know they're fake.\n"
"[After awhile the advisor returns with the plans and gives them to you]\n"
"You'll need to get the plans back to him on time, of course.\n"
"I'm sure he plans to attack us soon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:249 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:943
msgid ""
"Balthazar Lair has many levels. There are other chambers as high as this one., so there may be others who have survived.I have thought long on this. Though many of the tunnels are flooded, it may be possible to drain them using the doors and air vents as valves. In fact, the whole lair could be drained through the lower level escape tunnel. Help my herd! You would have our eternal gratitude."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3034 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9453
msgid ""
"He took the plans?\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"I'll have the Riverstride commander roll out the red carpet for them.\n"
"As for you, I've instructed my purser to deposit 5,000 gold pieces in your account."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9464
msgid ""
"You told the king the plans were fake?!?\n"
"[The Queen puts her hand on her head, jaw agape] I have never seen such incompetence in all my life!\n"
"Astounding!\n"
"Get out of my sight!\n"
"Just go!\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:250 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:947
msgid ""
"I just feel it. There are still survivors of my herd trapped in the lair. If you can figure out how to drain the water from flooded passages, you may be able to reach them. Help them, I beg of you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9474
msgid ""
"King Parson is beyond the date when he could have used those false papers.\n"
"Don't bother taking them to him--it doesn't matter anymore.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:560 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9482
msgid ""
"You have to get the plans to him before he attacks Riverstride.\n"
"If you don't, they won't lead his forces into all the traps we've prepared for them.\n"
"So hurry up and deliver those plans!\n"
"I'm counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:570 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9487
msgid ""
"[The Queen raises her eyebrows with interest as you tell her how you infiltrated her fort, stole secret plans, and killed many of her guards while in the service of a foreign king] I wish I could truthfully say this is the most shocking treason I have ever witnessed, but unfortunately, it's not.\n"
"Nonetheless...Guards!\n"
"Off with their heads!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:544 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:69 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:950
msgid "Axe of Balthazar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:251 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:951
msgid ""
"Balthazar, the greatest leader in the history of our herd, led our warriors in a mighty battle against the Dark Dwarf vermin that erupt from the earth and spread like a plague. It was not a battle that went well for us. Though Balthazar and some warriors escaped, many were lost along with Balthazar's Axe--his regalia of office, and a powerful artifact as well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:642 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9512
msgid ""
"My loyal subjects!\n"
"You were the ones who took the Trumpet!\n"
"Good work.\n"
"We thought it lost forever.\n"
"Once again, my purser will deposit gold in your account.\n"
"5,000 gold, to be exact."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:580 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9535
msgid ""
"Welcome.\n"
"I understand you've been appointed Lords of Harmondale by that idiot Markham.\n"
"You know, I WILL restore Avlee's rule over Harmondale--the only question is whether you are with me, or against me.\n"
"If you're with me, I will ensure that you retain your post.\n"
"Against me, and I will have done with you once my armies occupy your lands.\n"
"[King Parson smiles affably] So, of course you're with me!\n"
"You just need to prove it.\n"
"Like a famous leader once said:\n"
"Trust, but verify!\n"
"Words to live by.\n"
"What I want right now is the plans to Fort Riverstride.\n"
"It's a huge fort that stands between your lands and Erathia proper.\n"
"You can't miss the thing.\n"
"Sneak in there and get me those plans.\n"
"If you can do this, I will be in your debt.\n"
"Not only that, there's a substantial gold reward as well.\n"
"If the plans are to be any use to me at all, though, I need them delivered to me within a month."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:70 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:954
msgid "Promotion to Minotaur Lord"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:597 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9546 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9586
msgid ""
"[The King smiles broadly as you hand him the plans]\n"
"Thank you!\n"
"These will be VERY useful.\n"
"My factor will deposit 5,000 gold pieces in your bank account for services rendered.\n"
"When we finally win this round against Erathia, I will not forget you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:252 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:955
msgid ""
"Only Masul, our herd leader, can deem an individual worthy of the title of Minotaur Lord.\n"
"One way to prove your worth, would be to recover his father’s axe, the Axe of Balthazar from the bowels of the Mines of the Dark Dwarfs.\n"
"Set your feet upon the path of this quest, and great is you future!\n"
"But we must be sure that the axe you find is indeed the Axe of Balthazar.\n"
"Take the Axe to Dadeross, a Minotaur in the service of the Merchants of Alvar, on the island of Dagger Wound.\n"
"He will be able to verify the truth of what you find."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:604 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9562
msgid ""
"[The King smiles broadly as you hand him the false plans.\n"
"Sucker! ]\n"
"Thank you!\n"
"These will be VERY useful.\n"
"When we finally win this round against Erathia, I will not forget you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:602 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9574
msgid ""
"I really do need those plans soon.\n"
"If you take too long, I'll have to prepare my attack without the plans."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:637 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9579
msgid ""
"The time where I could have used those plans is over.\n"
"Thanks for any efforts you may have put into finding them, but I no longer need the plans."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:71 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:960
msgid "Dark Dwarves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:609 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9603
msgid ""
"What do you mean, these plans are false?\n"
"So you admit to plotting against me?\n"
"[The King throws up his hands in disgust] Guards!\n"
"Take these traitors to the courtyard and execute them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:258 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:961
msgid ""
"These little vermin work with or for the Elements of the Earth.\n"
"No one can tell which.\n"
"They burrow up from the earth in search of wealth, food, and slaves.\n"
"Nothing is left behind where these scavengers have been."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9629
msgid ""
"The wily queen moves against me, eh?\n"
"[The King frowns in thought, then brightens] I have an idea!\n"
"I know someone who looks just like that spy she wants you to rescue.\n"
"Bring my man with you and deliver him to the Queen.\n"
"She's never met him, and won't know the difference.\n"
"His 'inside information' will encourage her to make mistakes.\n"
"[The King takes a moment to summon the imposter]\n"
"Be careful not to tip your hand.\n"
"It wouldn't do for her to discover our little plan.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:623 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9659
msgid ""
"The imposter has infiltrated her military and diplomatic advisors' ranks, and will cause plenty of damage before he's discovered, I'm sure.\n"
"Thank you for your help! My factor will deposit 5000 gold into your account at the bank."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:629 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9669
msgid ""
"You told Queen Catherine about the imposter?!? I can't believe my ears!\n"
"Why did you do it?\n"
"Why?\n"
"[The King stands and points at the door] Get out!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:279 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:967
msgid ""
"Where is Balthazar's Axe?\n"
"You waste my time!\n"
"Find the axe, find Dadeross and return to me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:639 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9678
msgid ""
"The execution date for Loren Steel has passed.\n"
"Don't bother bringing the imposter to the Queen--she'll be too suspicious for our ruse to succeed.\n"
"He'll be leaving you now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:625 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9686
msgid ""
"It's important to get the imposter to the Queen before Mr. Steel's scheduled execution.\n"
"After all, you can't rescue Mr. Steel if everyone knows I've executed him.\n"
"And she'll become suspicious if I stay the execution.\n"
"I've never stayed one before."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:633 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9691
msgid ""
"[The king is silent while you detail your crimes against Avlee, then smiles and spreads his hands once you've finished] Well!\n"
"I suppose that story speaks for itself, doesn't it?\n"
"Guards!\n"
"Take these traitors to the courtyard and execute them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:262 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:971
msgid ""
"You have found the Axe of Balthazar!\n"
"Have you presented it to Dadeross?\n"
"Without his authentication, we can not proceed with the Rite’s of Purity!\n"
"Find him and return to us once you have presented him with the axe!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:648 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9716
msgid ""
"Ah, the Trumpet!\n"
"You captured it!\n"
"We weren't sure how things turned out when news of the human raid reached us.\n"
"Thank you again, my friends.\n"
"My factor will deposit 5,000 gold in your account for your services."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:266 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:974
msgid ""
"You have found the Axe of Balthazar!\n"
"Have you presented it to Dadeross? Ah, you have authentication from Dadeross!\n"
"The Rite’s of Purity will begin immediately! You proven yourselves worthy, and our now members of our herd!\n"
"The Minotaurs who travel with you are promoted to Minotaur Lord.\n"
"The others in your group will be taught what skills we have that maybe useful to them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:653 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9740
msgid ""
"If there is one piece of advice I could give you, it would be to fix your castle.\n"
"I don't know how you're going to find the gold and workers to do it, as only wealthy nobles and kings can afford such large scale projects.\n"
"I suppose it's the old chicken and egg question...you must appear noble to gain wealth and respect, but you must have wealth and respect in order to appear noble.\n"
"In any event, if you expect to be lords of Harmondale for more than a few months, you need to find a way to prove you're not just lucky peasants.\n"
"You must prove that you're fit to rule."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:658 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9743
msgid ""
"Once again, the Human kingdom of Erathia and the Elvish kingdom of Harmondale are fighting.\n"
"As the local Judge, it has fallen to me to patch up their differences and bring the two sides to the negotiating table.\n"
"The two sides are so evenly matched that either could prevail.\n"
"[The judge leans closer to you, lowering his voice] And I'll tell you something else--I don't much care anymore who wins.\n"
"They are like children fighting over a toy.\n"
"Neither really wants Harmondale--they just want to deny it to the other.\n"
"So, you're on your own.\n"
"Whatever actions you take now in support of one side or another could really make a difference.\n"
"Just remember that they couldn't possibly care less what happens to you or who rules in Harmondale.\n"
"Protect yourselves and your people first.\n"
"We didn't have this conversation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9749
msgid ""
"You were wise to return the Trumpet to me.\n"
"Now I can use it to help shore up the weak side in this conflict and promote peace.\n"
"Thank you.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:673 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9776 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9821
msgid ""
"A wise decision.\n"
"You won't regret this--believe me.\n"
"I knew you were going to make this decision, and my bags are already packed and ready to go.\n"
"All you need to do now is get me to my new home, and I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:677 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9784
msgid ""
"Your first order of business is to talk to Lord Ironfist and complete his 'mission.'\n"
"Once your ability and loyalty are proven, you will be allowed to help in more…interesting… ways."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:679 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9788 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9792
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9796
msgid ""
"Each of the advisors to Lord Ironfist has a task for you, complete each one.\n"
"Talk to Kastore, Dark Shade, and Maaximus for more information.\n"
"The completion of these tasks is vital for our future."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:347 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_animations.txt:423 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:348
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/house_data.txt:424 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:156 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/map_stats.txt:19
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:14 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:791 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:98
msgid "Abandoned Temple"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:682 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9800
msgid ""
"Tolberti has a mission of great importance.\n"
"Everything we've staked so far rests on its completion.\n"
"Prepare well for his task or you will certainly fail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:685 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9804
msgid ""
"Xenofex and the rest of the Kreegan must be put down; go to their 'hive' in the Land of the Giants and put a stop to Xenofex and his minions once and for all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:686 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9808
msgid ""
"You will need to visit the craft that brought Kastore and his men to Erathia to continue.\n"
"Go west of Avlee, and make sure to be properly outfitted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:688 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9811
msgid ""
"Bring the Oscillation Overthruster back to Kastore with all possible speed!\n"
"Every moment you dally allows a chance for failure!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3038 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9829
msgid ""
"First, you need to speak to Gavin Magnus in Celeste and complete his training.\n"
"After you have proven your ability and loyalty you will learn more about your role in the future of Erathia."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3040 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9833 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9837
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9841
msgid ""
"Each of Gavin's advisors has a task for you.\n"
"Talk to Resurectra, Sir Caneghem, and Crag Hack for more information.\n"
"Do not fail in these missions- in them rests the balance of the future."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3043 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9845
msgid ""
"Robert the Wise has a regrettable, but necessary, mission for you to complete.\n"
"For any of our plans to continue, this mission must succeed.\n"
"Prepare most carefully for the task, or you invite certain failure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3046 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9849
msgid ""
"The Kreegan, the Devils, and their leader Xenofex must be destroyed completely for the plan to have any long-term benefit.\n"
"You will find their 'hive' in the Land of the Giants."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3048 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9853
msgid ""
"To the west of Avlee lies the craft that Resurectra and her associates used to come to Erathia.\n"
"Visit the ship and retrieve the Oscillation Overthruster to insure our victory.\n"
"Make sure to be properly outfitted for the journey."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3051 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9856
msgid ""
"Bring the Oscillation Overthruster back to Resurectra immediately!\n"
"Every moment wastes valuable time!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3053 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9860
msgid ""
"The Test involves entering the 'front door' of the Walls of Mist, and exiting through the 'back door'.\n"
"I use the word 'door' loosely--you'll see when you get there.\n"
"You will not need your weapons.\n"
"You will fail the test if you kill any creature in the Walls of Mist.\n"
"If you can complete this task, you will be given membership in the Guild of Light. Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3063 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9868
msgid ""
"Remember, you must enter through the front door of the Walls of Mist, and exit through the back door.\n"
"You must not kill any creatures in the Walls of Mist.\n"
"When you have done this, return to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3058 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9871
msgid ""
"You passed the Test!\n"
"That's quite an achievement--few succeed as quickly as you did.\n"
"My advisors are now eager to speak to\n"
"you; they can be found in the four houses on the eastern side of Celeste.\n"
"Once again, congratulations!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3066 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9892
msgid ""
"We need your help retrieving half of a key to a very important place from our enemies, the Necromancers.\n"
"Like us, they have enshrined their half of the key in their highest temple--The Temple of the Dark.\n"
"I'm under no illusions this will be easy.\n"
"Take your time and act when you're prepared.\n"
"Also, bring our half of the key to us, as well.\n"
"It is enshrined in the Temple of the Light.\n"
"Since you're our ally, no one should trouble you when you go there to fetch the key.\n"
"By the same token, please don't harm any of them, either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:40 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:99
msgid ""
"The ruins of a temple built by the lost civilization lies on the island just northwest of the main island. I have not explored it however, for dangerous reptiles have made it their lair. I do suspect that the temple leads to an underwater tunnel which surfaces near the boat docks on the northwest island.With the bridges out, that tunnel may be the only way to reach the docks and a boat to safety!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3078 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9912
msgid ""
"Well, I'm glad you found our half of the key, but you still need their half.\n"
"Hold onto it until you get the other half.\n"
"When you have both halves, return to me.\n"
"I will make them whole."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3084 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9915
msgid ""
"I knew you could do it!\n"
"Never doubted you for a second!\n"
"[You hand her the key halves, and she joins them by running a finger along the crack between them.\n"
"It mends before your eyes, good as new] Finally!\n"
"One piece of the plan is in place.\n"
"Your assistance has been invaluable.\n"
"We are already in your debt, and I expect we'll be even deeper in debt before our plan comes to fruition.\n"
"So have faith in us awhile longer--the future we're planning will astound you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3082 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9930
msgid ""
"Good work on retrieving their half of the key, but you still need ours.\n"
"It is located in the Temple of the Light here in Celeste."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3074 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9932
msgid ""
"No key halves yet, I see.\n"
"Well, take your time.\n"
"It must be done eventually, and sooner is better than later, but later is better than being chained to an altar and sacrificed by the High Priest of the Dark in one of their bloody rituals.\n"
"Just bring back both halves of the key from the temples of Dark and Light, and try not to get yourselves killed doing it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3092 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9937
msgid ""
"Our plans rapidly approach their conclusion, but there is a hitch.\n"
"The Kreegan--also known as the Devils, or the Demons, must be destroyed before we finish our plans.\n"
"They represent a terrible threat, and though they do little but lick their wounds today, will one day regain their strength and devastate the world.\n"
"If anything we do is to have lasting effect, we must first destroy these monsters for once and for all.You are strong, but not strong enough to defeat the devils on your own.\n"
"They are vulnerable to the brand of magic most commonly wielded by the Necromancers, and less so by our own Wizards.\n"
"It is imperative that you infiltrate the Devil's base and kill their leader Xenofex.\n"
"That should end their threat to this world for some time.\n"
"The Warlocks have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the Land of the Giants-- the land the Devils claim as their own.\n"
"Perhaps you can use that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3107 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9955
msgid ""
"I guess there's no hurry getting this job done, but we don't want the Necromancers to grow bored waiting for us to do our part and destroy the blocker.\n"
"So, please, as soon as you feel ready you must attack the Devils.\n"
"Remember that the Warlocks have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the land of the Devils.\n"
"You should be able to use that to get yourselves there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9959
msgid ""
"YOU ARE HEROES!!!\n"
"Your work against the devils was masterful!\n"
"And the rescue of King Roland was as delightful as it was unexpected.\n"
"History will never forget your names for doing what you just did!\n"
"I, for one, am very proud to know you.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3111 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9971
msgid ""
"Our allies in Tatalia have been complaining for some time of a mysterious presence.\n"
"There have been numerous deaths and disappearances for the last few months, and they've asked us if we knew anything about it.\n"
"I think I do.\n"
"I suspect a vampire is preying on Tatalia.\n"
"I don't have time to pursue the question myself, but to keep our allies happy, I'm asking you to please look into it.\n"
"It's possible the monster's presence has deeper implications than just bad luck for Tatalia."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9989
msgid ""
"Keep looking for that Vampire.\n"
"I'm sure that's our problem, and he must be somewhere in or near Tatalia.\n"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3117 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:9992
msgid ""
"Just as I suspected!\n"
"Good work.\n"
"With the death of the Vampire, Tatalia can sleep a bit easier now.\n"
"Queen Catherine is grateful as well, and has been making moves to further strengthen the ties between Bracada and Erathia."
msgstr ""

