"A special Emerald that allows to increase an item Enchant Strength by 4, up to 80 (right-click on an item with a base enchant to use)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:235
msgid "Crafting Sapphire"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:241
